mwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品功能</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/0F/1B/rBEQWVFVLQUIAAAAAALlfka4x0QAADGHAB9ymUAAuWW546.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/0F/1B/rBEQWVFVLQ4IAAAAAANb3g8ISlkAADGHAHpNbAAA1v2756.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">数字文本放大镜</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">当您遇到很小的字时，可将手机变为方便的放大镜。将手机的显示屏悬停在所选的文本上，无论是餐厅菜单、维修手册，还是日报，数字文本放大镜都能将其放大至易于阅读的尺寸。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/0F/1B/rBEQWFFVLQMIAAAAAAIMHMrQ_4gAADGHAMkpvwAAgw0062.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/0F/1B/rBEQWFFVLQ0IAAAAAAN35soaZcYAADGHQCNsqQAA3f-264.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/0F/1B/rBEQWFFVLRkIAAAAAAJbPz-hAVwAADGHQIyUkUAAltX901.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/0F/1B/rBEQWVFVLTcIAAAAAALzS1vecu8AADGHQOApyQAAvNj165.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">高音量扬声器，防止漏接电话。语音报号，防止拨错电话。使用高音量扬声器，必要时可将手机设置成比正常铃声更大的声音。您不必担心错过重要来电，特别是在家中的环境声音或旅途中极大的噪音干扰的情况下。您也可以选择适合自己的更大音量欣赏喜爱的FM收音机节目和音乐。大声播放FM收音机。使用飞利浦手机的内置天线和扬声器功能，您不必始终插上耳机收听收音机。现在您可以根据心情或环境，通过扬声器大声播放您喜爱的电台节目。</div></div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品功效/功能</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Functionality</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/0F/1B/rBEQWFFVLS0IAAAAAAOOn_n0yxwAADGHgDBOs4AA463504.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:10', '2015-03-08 21:28:10');
