bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 23px; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 14px\" class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><br /></span><br /><div style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\">&nbsp;注：选择购机入网送话费的方式购买合约，话费为赠品不开具发票</span></div></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 23px; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:12px;\"></span></div><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品信息</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">华为 P6</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">雅然天成的纤薄，撼世之美。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/02/0A/rBEhU1HHMlUIAAAAAAIysmjVC5QAAAdGAOA7d0AAjLK514.jpg\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M03/02/0D/rBEhV1HH1vsIAAAAAAjgR2oFvPkAAAeUgNH4PoACOBf088.jpg\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品功能</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span></div></div><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">更快、更薄、更富曲线的美感</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">更快、更薄、更富曲线的美感是华为P6的三个重要定义；4.7英寸高清屏幕将色彩及细节体现到极致，1.5GHz处理器动力极速强劲，超薄机身结构恰如其分地诠释着华为P6对美的定义。</p></td><td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M00/02/0D/rBEhWVHH3soIAAAAAAcyYxbL5RIAAAeZQBbB_MABzJ7876.jpg\" /></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M0A/02/0D/rBEhWVHH4hoIAAAAAADzbkZBzlkAAAecgCanRQAAPOG392.jpg\" /></td><td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">800万像素后置、500万像素前置</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">华为P6配备800万像素后置摄像头、500万像素前置摄像头，为更轻松捕捉生活里的每个细节，4cm的超近对焦距离让您轻松抓取每个微距细节。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">2G运行内存、16G机身内存</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">四核1.5GHz主频、2G运行内存、16G海量存储空间，强劲配置成就主流实力.</p></td><td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/02/0D/rBEhVVHH4iMIAAAAAAbktvPhxAYAAAecgFZn5YABuTO918.jpg\" /></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M07/02/0D/rBEhWFHH3ZYIAAAAAACXVgMZosgAAAeYgI_FmMAAJdu019.jpg\" /></td><td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">智能节电、大电量2000mAh</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">华为P6在芯片级、硬件级和软件级三个层面上做到智能省电，使手机的电力使用时间提升高达30%</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:42', '2015-03-08 21:27:42');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('917461', '<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td><iframe marginheight=\"0\" src=\"http://yuntv.letv.com/bcloud.html?uu=82abd5491f&vu=f05039dc59&width=750&height=422&auto_play=0\" marginwidth=\"0\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"422\" width=\"750\"></iframe></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M08/05/1A/rBEhU1IK-zsIAAAAAABGTIeJHiAAACCGgN0XaEAAEZk030.jpg\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M08/05/1A/rBEhUlIK-z4IAAAAAACcfxP6teMAACCGgOEN1EAAJyX225.jpg\" /><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 23px; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 14px\" class=\"formwork_img\"></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 23px; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 14px\" class=\"formwork_img\"><table class=\"                                                                                                                                   \" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><div style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM: 5px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-LEFT: 7px; PADDING-RIGHT: 5px; FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-TOP: 5px\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\">尊敬的顾客：<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 在选购手机的同时可参加京东商城与中国电信合作推出购机送话费活动（新入网用户）：该手机属于电信定制机，3G网络制式为电信CDMA2000，您只需点击“购机入网送话费”按钮加入购物车选择套餐、赠费档位、号码后即可享受当地电信的高额话费赠送，订单提交后京东相关人员会为您办理入网，手机和号卡一同配送，具体赠费明细可加入购物车后查看：</span></div></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\">&nbsp;</td><td align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t319/102/433254207/12134/9dfcdac1/54116373N9e056efb.png\" alt=\"\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 23px; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 14px\" class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><br /></span><br /><div style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\">&nbsp;注：选择购机入网送话费的方式购买合约，话费为赠品不开具发票</span></div></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 23px; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:12px;\"></span></div><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品信息</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">华为 P6</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">雅然天成的纤薄，撼世之美。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/02/0C/rBEhVFHH5-4IAAAAAAIysmjVC5QAAAd4AC2FCEAAjLK522.jpg\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/02/0C/rBEhU1HH5_oIAAAAAAjgR2oFvPkAAAd4AJk3uYACOBf314.jpg\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品功能</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span></div></div><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">更快、更薄、更富曲线的美感</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">更快、更薄、更富曲线的美感是华为P6的三个重要定义；4.7英寸高清屏幕的色彩及细节表现，1.5GHz处理器动力强劲，超薄机身结构恰如其分地诠释着华为P6对美的定义。</p></td><td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M07/02/0E/rBEhWFHH6CgIAAAAAAcyYxbL5RIAAAehQChe_UABzJ7252.jpg\" /></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M06/02/0E/rBEhV1HH6EYIAAAAAADzbkZBzlkAAAehQBCZMwAAPOG063.jpg\" /></td><td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">800万像素后置、500万像素前置</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">华为P6配备800万像素后置摄像头、500万像素前置摄像头，为更轻松捕捉生活里的每个细节，4cm的超近对焦距离让您轻松抓取每个微距细节。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">2G运行内存、16G机身内存</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">四核1.5GHz主频、2G运行内存、16G海量存储空间，强劲配置成就主流实力.</p></td><td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M09/02/0C/rBEhVFHH6G4IAAAAAAbktvPhxAYAAAd4QGyKrsABuTO878.jpg\" /></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M07/02/0E/rBEhWVHH6IUIAAAAAACXVgMZosgAAAehgCLGY0AAJdu525.jpg\" /></td><td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">智能节电、大电量2000mAh</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">华为P6在芯片级、硬件级和软件级三个层面上做到智能省电，使手机的电力使用时间提升高达30%</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:37', '2015-03-08 21:27:37');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('917770', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">华为 P6</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">雅然天成的纤薄，撼世之美。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/02/0F/rBEhVlHIFsYIAAAAAAIysmjVC5QAAAfHwJO6NIAAjLK978.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M00/02/0E/rBEhUlHIFtUIAAAAAAjgR2oFvPkAAAeeQHi6B8ACOBf293.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-4\" name=\"detail-tag-id-4\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">更快、更薄、更富曲线的美感</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">更快、更薄、更富曲线的美感是华为P6的三个重要定义；4.7英寸高清屏幕将色彩及细节体现到极致，1.5GHz处理器动力极速强劲，超薄机身结构恰如其分地诠释着华为P6对美的定义。\n</p></td>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/02/0E/rBEhU1HIF78IAAAAAAcyYxbL5RIAAAefAFyo70ABzJ7925.jpg\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M02/02/0F/rBEhVVHIF-kIAAAAAADzbkZBzlkAAAfIgGag-EAAPOG256.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">800万像素后置、500万像素前置</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">华为P6配备800万像素后置摄像头、500万像素前置摄像头，为更轻松捕捉生活里的每个细节，4cm的超近对焦距离让您轻松抓取每个微距细节。\n</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">2G运行内存、16G机身内存</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">四核1.5GHz主频、2G运行内存、16G海量存储空间，强劲配置成就主流实力.\n</p></td>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M06/02/0F/rBEhWFHIGU0IAAAAAAbktvPhxAYAAAfJgGd02AABuTO034.jpg\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/02/0E/rBEhVFHIGXcIAAAAAACXVgMZosgAAAegABEuxMAAJdu839.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">智能节电、大电量2000mAh</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">华为P6在芯片级、硬件级和软件级三个层面上做到智能省电，使手机的电力使用时间提升高达30%\n</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:54', '2015-03-08 21:27:54');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('919669', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M01/02/16/rBEhWlHKR_8IAAAAAADk_QJPxd8AAAh4AAcy2QAAOUV405.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品特色</span><span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span></div></div><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M03/02/16/rBEhVVHKSC8IAAAAAAAnUaJy6i8AAAh4AL5f7sAACdp559.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">精密设计</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">更快，更薄，更富曲线的美感是您手上的华为Ascend P6的三个重要定义。4.7&rdquo; 高清屏幕将色彩及细节体现极致，1.5GHz处理器动力急速强劲，超薄机身结构恰如其分地诠释着华为Ascend P6 对美的定义。作为一部智能手机，华为Ascend P6 志在重新定义完美的内涵。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">捕捉微观</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">华为Ascend P6 所配备800万像素堆栈式摄像头只为更轻松捕捉生活里的每个细节。4cm的超近对焦距离让您轻松抓取每个微距细节。</p></td>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M04/02/16/rBEhV1HKSGIIAAAAAAAtVtMvzUIAAAh4QKZDIcAAC1u177.jpg\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M01/02/16/rBEhWFHKSIoIAAAAAABLlu16gXQAAAh4ALo4aEAAEuu875.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">美颜自拍</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">华为Ascend P6 当然能把您拍得更美。500万像素前置摄像头让自拍画质得到提升；10档美颜功能，亦会让您的面容变得完美无瑕。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">自动场景识别</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">IMAGESmart 引擎预设多达几十种场景模式，华为Ascend P6 会自动识别这些场景并进行调整，让您在任何环境下，都能轻松拍出完美的照片。</p></td>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M02/02/16/rBEhWVHKSK4IAAAAAABUhW3DMF8AAAh4QMS38wAAFSd382.jpg\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/02/14/rBEhUlHKSMcIAAAAAABdq4nLVsAAAAhLQGjBYkAAF3D186.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">只属于您自己的场景设定</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">华为Ascend P6 是真正属于您自己的手机。您可以把最喜爱的应用程序，如相册、联系人和天气通过Me Widget 整齐拖放到主屏幕上，方便快速获取。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">AirSharing</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">通过多屏互动功能，您只需手指轻轻一点，即可轻松将音乐和视频发送到TV大屏播放，一个手势轻松将手机中照片、视频传送到朋友的手机。您也可以通过MediaQ将华为Ascend P6 作为您的电视机遥控器使用，您可以在手机上进行暂停/播放、快进/快退等操作。</p></td>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/02/14/rBEhU1HKSPMIAAAAAAA58V2I5lgAAAhLgM5Pj8AADoJ815.jpg\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M05/02/16/rBEhV1HKSQYIAAAAAAA1txdkIfUAAAh4gGk7ksAADXP345.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">魔幻触控</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">华为Ascend P6 采用的高灵敏触屏让您带着手套也能精准地操作手机，温度和风度兼得的体验此刻即见。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">智慧阅读</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">看到新单词想知道它的意思？问题！在华为Ascend P6 长按这个词就可以同屏通过字典或者搜索引擎快速查询它的意思。</p></td>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M02/02/16/rBEhWFHKSSQIAAAAAABJ9l3VCCQAAAh4QP_kKUAAEoO222.jpg\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M04/02/16/rBEhWFHKSWIIAAAAAAAS2TRk30QAAAh4wEF7UUAABLx080.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">智能节电</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">华为Ascend P6在芯片级、硬件级和软件级三个层面上做到智能节电，是手机的电力使用时间提升高达30%。您亦可以一次性关闭后台运行的所有程序，便捷提高手机使用的效率。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:37', '2015-03-08 21:27:37');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('925237', '<br /><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td style=\"display: block;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M04/00/02/rBEhU1Gv_hAIAAAAAADiLHrTYQMAAAA7AEoHVAAAOJE536.jpg\" /></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td style=\"display: block;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M04/00/02/rBEhUlGv_hEIAAAAAAC5O6JspXsAAAA7AFWfQgAALlT742.jpg\" /></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td style=\"display: block;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M04/00/02/rBEhU1Gv_hMIAAAAAAEvGiwyLUoAAAA7AGWOAwAAS8y899.jpg\" usemap=\"#Map\" border=\"0\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/erpWareDetail/6Hm9HuRJFBbfrEpw.gif\" height=\"44\" border=\"0\" width=\"753\" /> <br /><div style=\"padding: 15px 15px 15px 7px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 18px;\" class=\"STYLE1\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"></span></strong><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">1、 若遇到联通政策修改，致使各省联通实际返还话费与页面介绍有所区别，请以选号选套餐页面返费情况以及订单为准。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2、 用户下单后，如遇联通调整资费政策或手机暂时不可办理合约的或号码不可用，京东会主动告知用户相关情况，用户需要三天内确认是否按照新资费办理。用户也可以取消原订单，重新下单。超期京东将取消订单。<br /></span></p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3、购买联通合约机请将联通3G号卡放在SIM卡槽1中，不然系统不能识别，无法返还话费。</span></div></td>  </tr></tbody></table><map id=\"Map\" name=\"Map\"><area href=\"http://www.360buy.com/knowledge/1-55-1335.html\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" coords=\"213,168,358,206\" /><area href=\"http://sale.jd.com/p10643.html#01\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" coords=\"377,169,527,205\" /></map><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/04/0B/rBEQYFGMjGUIAAAAAABGTIeJHiAAAA2iAB2MUoAAEZk192.jpg\" /></td></tr><tr>    <td><iframe marginheight=\"0\" src=\"http://yuntv.letv.com/bcloud.html?u