nter\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>    <tr>      <td colspan=\"2\"><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>    <tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">  <a href=\"http://chat.jd.com/index.action?groupId=14\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g14/M02/04/1B/rBEhV1HdDzYIAAAAAAAU3twXtUkAAA8ogGmEQgAABT2521.gif\" border=\"0\" /></a></td><td valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td><td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><a href=\"http://chat.jd.com/index.action?groupId=15\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g14/M02/04/1B/rBEhVVHdDy8IAAAAAAAU5CGUnOQAAA8ogDj0x0AABT8609.gif\" border=\"0\" /></a></td></tr>  </tbody></table>  </td></tr></tbody></table> <map name=\"Map\"><area href=\"#\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"216,10,357,35\" /><area href=\"#\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"211,12,216,14\" /></map></div></td></tr></tbody></table>       <br />        <br />  <map id=\"Map\" name=\"Map\"><area href=\"http://www.360buy.com/knowledge/1-55-1335.html\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" coords=\"213,168,358,206\" /><area href=\"http://sale.jd.com/p10643.html#01\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" coords=\"377,169,527,205\" /></map><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/erpWareDetail/6Hm9HuRJFBbfrEpw.gif\" height=\"44\" border=\"0\" width=\"753\" />        <br />        <div style=\"padding: 15px 15px 15px 7px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 18px;\" class=\"STYLE1\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"></span></strong><div style=\"padding: 15px 15px 15px 7px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 18px;\" class=\"STYLE1\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"></span></strong><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">1、 若遇到联通政策修改，致使各省联通实际返还话费与页面介绍有所区别，请以选号选套餐页面返费情况以及订单为准。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2、 用户下单后，如遇联通调整资费政策或手机暂时不可办理合约的或号码不可用，京东会主动告知用户相关情况，用户需要三天内确认是否按照新资费办理。用户也可以取消原订单，重新下单。超期京东将取消订单。<br /></span></p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3、购买联通合约机请将联通3G号卡放在SIM卡槽1中，不然系统不能识别，无法返还话费。</span></div></div><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/04/0B/rBEQYFGMjGUIAAAAAABGTIeJHiAAAA2iAB2MUoAAEZk192.jpg\" /></td></tr><tr>    <td><iframe marginheight=\"0\" src=\"http://yuntv.letv.com/bcloud.html?uu=82abd5491f&vu=f0efe43068&width=750&height=422&auto_play=0\" marginwidth=\"0\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"422\" width=\"750\"></iframe></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/erpWareDetail/nfda67aH5UbSj0ZR.jpg\" height=\"44\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\" /></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWFFjjNkIAAAAAAEQDjaxouwAADsxgJVudEAARAm338.jpg\" /></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/erpWareDetail/UIbzsEuXAelXrMQN.jpg\" height=\"44\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\" /></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWVFjjMsIAAAAAAGQ7doz-PkAADsxgFpEJsAAZEF383.jpg\" /></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWVFjjMwIAAAAAAF-0A5kRgcAADsxgGOur0AAX7o326.jpg\" /></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td colspan=\"2\"><div style=\"padding: 20px 15px 15px 25px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 16px;\"> 双卡双待，Micro SIM 卡/Micro SIM卡</div></td>  </tr><tr>  <td colspan=\"2\"><div style=\"line-height: 1.5em; padding-right: 15px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 25px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px;\">全新三星GALAXY S4双卡双待版，可同时支持GSM和WCDMA两种网络制式，并采用Micro SIM卡/Micro SIM卡两种卡式，让您的生活轻松愉悦，工作井然有序。<br />          </div></td>  </tr><tr>  <td width=\"26\"><div align=\"center\"></div></td>      <td width=\"724\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/0A/15/rBEQYVGi-AQIAAAAAACEyXRk4zEAACFYwKjr1YAAITh240.jpg\" /></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td colspan=\"2\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/erpWareDetail/nQTYErDwzk5CYU4X.jpg\" height=\"44\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\" /></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td colspan=\"2\" height=\"559\" background=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWFFjjNAIAAAAAAES0aSO66kAADsxgEdoMkAARLp128.jpg\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">      <tbody><tr>        <td><div style=\"padding: 15px 15px 305px 25px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px;\"><strong>·</strong>在一段视频（5秒）录制前选定焦点，来完成生动的记录某对象的愿望<br />            <strong>·</strong>一旦焦点选定，其他周围一切就变成静态的背景，使得这段视频极具特色和艺术性<br /></div></td>      </tr>    </tbody></table></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td colspan=\"2\" height=\"296\" background=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWFFjjOIIAAAAAAC1WDl6xwwAADsxgNkBMsAALVw574.jpg\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">      <tbody><tr>        <td><div style=\"padding: 20px 15px 15px 25px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 16px;\">创新非接触式操作方式</div></td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td><div style=\"padding: 5px 480px 15px 25px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px;\"><strong>·</strong>手指只需接近手机屏幕，无需触碰，即可感应手指所指位置，展开文件夹预览、全文显示、快速拨号等功能。（即便戴手套也能实现）。</div></td>      </tr>    </tbody></table></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td height=\"268\" background=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g