INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1008825', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M09/1B/09/rBEhVlKARtgIAAAAAAChWBqv5Q4AAFVHQGJLHgAAKFw509.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M00/15/07/rBEhWlKARucIAAAAAAFJKfhC740AAFSEgPUBpEAAUlB547.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M01/15/07/rBEhWlKARvcIAAAAAApwcgy-0akAAFSEwHbgMUACnCK146.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">黑色注塑工艺打造超窄边框，最大程度扩大你的视野。超窄，展现极致科技；超窄，展现极致视觉体验。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M0A/16/10/rBEhU1KASKcIAAAAAAYnuwlUqWoAAFSgAFa3F8ABifT130.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">底部装饰条为精心挑选的香槟色，优雅低调，经典永不过时。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M08/15/07/rBEhWlKASRIIAAAAAActC7NVurwAAFSGAOcBqQABy0j597.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">强大的数字梳状滤波器和六大色彩处理引擎技术，为您轻松展现清晰流畅的画面。    </div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M01/16/10/rBEhUlKASUwIAAAAAAfgG391u_UAAFSggBzYucAB-Az861.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M01/16/10/rBEhVFKASWQIAAAAAAifRkRXYggAAFSggI2E_AACJ9e211.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">动态对比度调节技术能根据画面的明暗程度自动调节画质的对比度和层次感，就算频繁切换画面，眼睛也不会干涩。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M01/16/10/rBEhU1KASe0IAAAAAAcScYElrY0AAFSggM-3-MABxKJ560.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">TCL采用自然光技术专利，将容易导致人眼疲劳的人造线偏振光转化成舒适护眼的圆偏振光，保证画质清晰，亮度自然不伤眼。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M04/16/10/rBEhVFKASh4IAAAAAAck23BcRb8AAFShAFE0t4AByTz747.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">以前，电视播什么，咱们看什么；现在，你想看什么，电视就播什么！L40F3301B支持USB播放，超强解码能力支持绝大多数视频格式，将你喜欢的电影下载到U盘/硬盘，接上电视，从此只看你喜欢看的吧！</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M03/1B/09/rBEhVVKASlQIAAAAAAfAXbxT6p4AAFVJQAyA64AB8B1006.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">F3301B系列采用鹦鹉螺音响系统，配备降噪还原技术和DDAS动态声谷技术使声音通透力更强，指向性更宽，立体逼真，为你营造媲美影院的震撼音效。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M03/15/07/rBEhWVKAStcIAAAAAAZv9qwfqysAAFSHAHU-TEABnAO834.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M04/16/0E/rBEhWVNM3iwIAAAAAACKtMN10NkAAL1ugIFuCMAAIrM842.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-19\" name=\"detail-tag-id-19\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M0A/00/00/rBEhVVKAbXgIAAAAAABs5qgzbSUAAFfwwKoAlwAAGz-386.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M0A/15/08/rBEhWFKAbakIAAAAAAFZwOVsVg8AAFXJAGGj6IAAVnY657.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M0A/00/00/rBEhVlKAbbMIAAAAAAHgo0CVolgAAFfxAIahDYAAeC7646.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M09/14/05/