ADDING-BOTTOM: 15px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 15px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">重温经典，阅读好书，一次下载一部电子书，打造你的私人图书馆。</div></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td>&nbsp;</td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g14/M09/0F/17/rBEhVlIwF1YIAAAAAABzmp6gxzsAADExAH8LSIAAHOy027.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td>&nbsp;</td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\';PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 7px; FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 15px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 15px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Keynote</strong></span></div></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 7px; FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 15px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 15px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">运用强大的工具和迷人的特效，制作令人难忘的出色演示文稿。</div></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td>&nbsp;</td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 7px; FONT-SIZE: 30px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 15px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 15px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">      <div align=\"center\"><strong>App Store<br />        让iPhone 大有可为，几乎无所不能为。</strong></div>    </div></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 7px; FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 15px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 15px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">      <div align=\"center\">        <p>App Store 是你随时随地搜罗精选移动 app 的绝佳途径。这里的 app 数量超过 900,000 款之多。由于款<br />          款 app 皆为 iPhone 度身打造，因此你能享受到极佳的 app 使用体验。你可浏览并购买各式各样的 app，<br />          从生产力到游戏、教育到娱乐、社交到财务等等一应俱全。这些 app 全部来自一个值得信赖的来源，而且<br />          全部集中于一处。因此，你可以轻松访问，轻松搜索，更轻松拥有这些精彩 app。<br />          <br />          </p>        </div>    </div></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g14/M0A/0F/17/rBEhVVIwGukIAAAAAAEnn-AQxFoAADE1gAwHZYAASe3638.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td>&nbsp;</td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 7px; FONT-SIZE: 30px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 15px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 15px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">      <div align=\"center\"><strong>iCloud<br />        随你所需，随处可取。</strong></div>    </div></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 7px; FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 15px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 15px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">      <div align=\"center\">        <p>无论你在使用 iPhone、iPad、iPod touch 或 Mac，iCloud 都能让你访问自己的内容。得益于 iOS 7 的全新<br />          功能，iCloud 变得比以往更加举足轻重。即便 iPhone 是你唯一的 Apple 设备，你也可使用 iCloud 照片共<br />          享向朋友的 iOS 设备发送照片和视频。他们可在你的共享流上添加评论，还能发布自己的照片和视频。而查<br />          找我的 iPhone 现具备全新激活锁功能，使除你之外的任何人更难擅自使用或出售你的设备。<br />          <br />          <br />        </p>      </div>    </div></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M06/0A/1E/rBEhU1IwGusIAAAAAADVN1cb614AADCQgJDNEAAANVP290.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></td>  </tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:54', '2015-03-08 21:27:54');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1023752', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/0A/07/rBEhU1KhqTQIAAAAAAGJx_T3ddMAAGdrAL5zkoAAYnf649.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">每一个细节精雕细琢&mdash;&mdash; 特别的爱，只为特别的你</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">高水准的设计与制造工艺，成就与生俱来的高贵；奢华工艺与翻盖设计，品味尽现。内外双屏设计，张弛之中尽显大气、从容。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M02/1B/05/rBEhWlKlHRQIAAAAAAGR1yjCl7wAAGg5wDGT_wAAZHv892.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">大字体、大键盘、大鈴声&mdash;&mdash; 只因爱最大</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">支持手写输入，500万像素摄像头，操作简易顺畅。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M02/1B/05/rBEhWVKlHRwIAAAAAAGZURhh_4QAAGg5wGy30YAAZlp096.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">飞利浦节电技术&mdash;&mdash;让爱时时在线</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">2000毫安时的大容量电池，让手机完成一次充电，便可超长待机长达30天，也可支持长达9.5小时的通话，让你时时保持可联系状态，让爱时时在线。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t610/80/1390920444/124767/fde9d46d/54d469a2Ncfe27069.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">最高绿色环保标准&mdash;&mdash;爱你更健康</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">从无铅、RoHS到无卤素，飞利浦 &ldquo;爱要久久&rdquo;已经达到目前电子产品的最高要求&mdash;RoHS是欧盟限制电子电器设备中某些有害物质的指令，限制使用铅、镉、六价铬、多溴联苯和多溴二苯醚等六种有害物质。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M04/05/10/rBEhVVKhquAIAAAAAAHBngSUFhQAAGkPwN76H4AAcG2703.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">双模双待设计&mdash;&mdash;爱的瞬间立即连线</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">支持WCDMA/GSM双网双卡双待，自由切换，让生活进退自如，让爱瞬间连线。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M01/0A/07/rBEhU1KhqyEIAAAAAAGfizglsnwAAGdvwDEjFkAAZ-j773.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-13\" name=\"detail-tag-id-13\" text=\"产品包装\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品包装</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">packing detail</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M09/1D/0E/rBEhWVKycFcIAAAAAAIJhQYSx6cAAG9igM6gdAAAgmd257.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M09/1D/0E/rBEhWFKycGEIAAAAAATfxkq1oesAAG9iwGeiOYABN_e995.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:29:12', '2015-03-08 21:29:12');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1025149', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M00/1A/18/rBEhWVKhldUIAAAAAAcbJcYf8CkAAGbuQExrc4ABxs9839.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M05/05/0E/rBEhV1KhlkEIAAAAAALoT23Gb88AAGjvAMD1SIAAuhn430.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">飞利浦逐点高清画质处理技术从细节、色彩、层次感、运动画面等多方面提升画面效果，带来栩栩如生、自然真实的高清画质，\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M02/0A/06/rBEhVFKhlmwIAAAAAAJcvXX8gdMAAGdPQEEOWkAAlzV229.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">通过对声音的特别处理，表现出更多细节，无论是潺潺流水声，还是轻细的谈话声都异常清晰。 开启飞利浦自动音量调衡功能，在切换频道时，能够自动调整突然性的音量变化，使声音平稳过渡。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M03/1A/18/rBEhWFKhlokIAAAAAAIT8kef3AgAAGbvAFEAcgAAhQK208.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">飞利浦电视在传统的音视频接口、电脑接口的基础上，增加了USB、HDMI数字接口，能够支持多种格式视频、音频、图像的播放，给您带来更加丰富的娱乐体验。\n</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-9\" name=\"detail-tag-id-9\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M07/1A/18/rBEhWVKhmcUIAAAAAAEDuXeRbhkAAGbywMD8PEAAQPR618.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-11\" name=\"detail-tag-id-11\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M02/05/0F/rBEhV1KhmlcIAAAAAAD8D-YFLDsAAGjzwBjE50AAPwn256.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-13\" name=\"detail-tag-id-13\" text=\"实景展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>实景展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Virtual show</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M06/05/0F/rBEhVlKhnCQIAAAAAAd4GCKY54UAAGj1QKAz1YAB3gw679.png\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-15\" name=\"detail-tag-id-15\" text=\"售后服务\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>售后服务</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">After-Sales Service</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M09/05/0F/rBEhV1KhnHQIAAAAAAJTlYxjvTMAAGj1wH85DAAAlOt993.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M08/0A/06/rBEhU1KhnIMIAAAAAAGu2cyK7QAAAGdVwFN2vYAAa7x045.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M08/0A/06/rBEhVFKhnJEIAAAAAADjwBTg4XQAAGdVwOt4m8AAOPY719.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-19\" name=\"detail-tag-id-19\" text=\"品牌荣誉\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌荣誉</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Awards</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/05/0F/rBEhVVKhnK8IAAAAAAc0chYuSjUAAGj2AN3OvMABzSK011.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-21\" name=\"detail-tag-id-21\" text=\"温馨提示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>温馨提示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t544/187/198856235/708795/100f1a1a/5456fd66N31343e87.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:35', '2015-03-08 21:27:35');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1026253', '	<div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\"> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\">   <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/0A/12/rBEQYFGiw_4IAAAAAAAp4J-ptK0AACEDgOO5BAAACn4809.jpg\" /> </div>  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t613/132/593870923/162032/5fe9adf5/54731465Nc06d9e45.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 538px;\">   <div style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 22px; padding-top: 83px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 14px;\">    4.7英寸超大视野，让眼前的一切如同亲身经历。全视角显示技术，    <br /> 任何角度都清晰如一。炫丽色彩，高清晰显示，时刻迸发震撼视觉冲击！   </div>  </div>  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M00/0A/0A/rBEhWlMW1T8IAAAAAABTEVCeVeMAAJefgNwjrQAAFMp835.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 353px;\">   <div style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 22px; padding-top: 88px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 14px;\">    个性时代，用时尚装务自己。简约小巧的机身设计，圆润弧度让握感更加舒适。    <br /> 机身侧面独特的S型切割边线，工艺精致，更彰显时尚独特的生活态度。    <br />   </div>  </div>  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M04/0A/0A/rBEhWVMW1U4IAAAAAAEDaHIxMB0AAJegAAQTYcAAQOA696.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 538px;\">   <div style=\"color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 22px; padding-top: 90px; padding-left: 368px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 14px;\">    玩游戏不流畅，快乐就大打折扣！8085Q配置四核1.2GHz    <br /> 高速CPU，强大的任务处理能力，让画面流畅无比，操作    <br /> 瞬间反应，快感体验要你足够过瘾！    <br />   </div>  </div>  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/19/1A/rBEhVFMW1V0IAAAAAAEBO1KZzcYAAJgaQKnf90AAQFT435.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 538px;\">   <div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 22px; padding-top: 110px; padding-left: 38px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 14px;\">    500万像素超清摄像头，加上多种拍摄场景模式，    <br /> 可随时随地，随心随意，记录精彩生活瞬间。    <br />   </div>  </div>  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/19/1A/rBEhVFMW1W4IAAAAAAFk0cyfgdwAAJgagPfxmwAAWTp738.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 538px;\">   <div style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 22px; padding-top: 70px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 14px;\">    玩，就要痛快到底！1900mAh大容量电池，超长续航时间让娱乐检验不断延续，    <br /> 打破电量束缚，玩游戏、看电影当然更尽情尽兴。    <br />   </div>  </div>  <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\">   <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/0A/12/rBEQYFGixPYIAAAAAAApsmGaiwAAACEFgHIF8AAACnK214.jpg\" /> </div>  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M05/0A/0A/rBEhWVMW1XsIAAAAAAE4hvGVuaUAAJegQEvcqUAATie015.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 538px;\">   <div style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 20px; padding-top: 95px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 14px;\">    快速查找联系人；一键启动；边看视频边写短信；让你操作更便捷    <br />   </div>  </div>  <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\">   <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M08/0A/0A/rBEhWlMW1YkIAAAAAAF4H_KZ9rkAAJeggEofZgAAXg3209.jpg\" /> </div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:54', '2015-03-08 21:27:54');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1026324', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M09/0C/05/rBEhV1LOXeoIAAAAAAEnn9fJZBwAAH3fQJVDxkAASe3366.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M06/01/0D/rBEhWFLOXfMIAAAAAAJT7HETfE4AAHvOgAxP9YAAlQE666.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M08/05/0E/rBEhWlIRrdoIAAAAAAAVx3qJcykAACMzQGmRNQAABXf281.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">东芝 REGZA高画质引擎</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">东芝是所有电视品牌中唯一一家使用自己研发、生产、制造芯片的品牌，它保证了东芝电视所有技术的无缝对接，使图像处理速度更快，画质更清晰、细腻，颜色过渡更自然。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/06/16/rBEhUlIRsDgIAAAAAAAVf1ItuosAACM2gMOF0IAABWX643.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">东芝 火箭炮音响系统</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">东芝电视的火箭炮音响系统融合了杜比音效技术，采用5+1立体式环绕，可以在极短时间营造极其震撼的立体环绕效果。新增的低音扬声器和大功率复合增频系统，保证音质的完美呈现，给您不一样的听觉感受。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-6\" name=\"detail-tag-id-6\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M06/01/0D/rBEhWVLOXf4IAAAAAAOVUPC1U3wAAHvOgGdB0IAA5Vo510.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M06/01/0D/rBEhWVLOXg0IAAAAAAIdXllmqsMAAHvOgK0NV4AAh12702.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M00/10/1C/rBEhVFLOXhIIAAAAAAJ_4X6dEB8AAHw8gNYo5EAAn_5551.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M09/0C/05/rBEhVlLOXhsIAAAAAAHZSe6X2XIAAH3fQPotsMAAdlh000.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-11\" name=\"detail-tag-id-11\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M09/0C/05/rBEhVVLOXiMIAAAAAAEpg9klj1QAAH3fgE8yF4AASmb139.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M06/01/0D/rBEhWVLOXi0IAAAAAAEeunajFPcAAHvOgN9POcAAR7S673.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M09/01/0D/rBEhWlLOXjcIAAAAAAHX2qdy-uEAAHvOwD4QWkAAdfy438.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M09/01/0D/rBEhWFLOXkcIAAAAAAA_Kx4TqdgAAHvOwPkDA8AAD9D990.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-16\" name=\"detail-tag-id-16\" text=\"品牌介绍\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌介绍</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Introduction</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/06/1A/rBEhU1ISwjMIAAAAAACv6ENgKucAACOgAPdqPgAALAA231.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">东芝在日本东京都的总部大楼东芝（TOSHIBA），是日本最大的半导体制造商，亦是第二大综合电机制造商，隶属于三井集团旗下。到今年，东芝在中国的事业已经开展了38年，始终不变的是&ldquo;与中国共同发展&rdquo;的决心与努力。现在东芝所涉足的数码产品，电子设备与零部件，社会基础设施，家电事业领域都在中国有业务开展。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-19\" name=\"detail-tag-id-19\" text=\"温馨提示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>温馨提示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">液晶电视保养小常识 不要随手关电视：不是让大家浪费电能，而是要注意权衡开启电源对电视寿命的影响。 荧光管：我们都知道，背光灯是液晶电视所有配件中寿命消耗最严重的一个部件，它和我们家中使用的荧光灯管是非常类似的。所以，它的使用寿命和点燃次数也是有很大关系的。启动的时候预热和高压脉冲式的阴极电子物质的溅射增大，缩短灯管寿命。如果您养成了随手关电视的习惯，以一天开四次计算，灯管的寿命将减少到原来的1/2。 避免长时间工作：这一条并不与上面的注意事项相冲突。在超长时间工作的情况下，热量会在液晶电视的机身内部存积，这对于其它电子元件还不够成太大的威胁，但是液晶面板是有可能烧毁，从而形成大面积坏点的。</div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:39', '2015-03-08 21:27:39');
