t: 30px;\">   <h2 style=\"color: rgb(32, 31, 31); font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 24px;\">快感在线</h2>   <h3 style=\"color: rgb(95, 95, 95); font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"color: rgb(95, 95, 95); font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"color: rgb(95, 95, 95); font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 16px;\">双卡双3G</h3>   <p style=\"line-height: 22px; font-size: 12px;\">双卡双待让上网体验都翻倍。在双卡双待基础上，<br /> 支持两大3G上网制式，从此不用再担心流量，<br /> 网速随你的需要而切换，时刻享受在线生活。</p>  </div> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\">  <div style=\"text-align: center; padding-top: 30px;\">   <h2 style=\"color: rgb(32, 31, 31); font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 24px;\">时尚设计 . 彰显内涵</h2>   <h3 style=\"color: rgb(95, 95, 95); font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"color: rgb(95, 95, 95); font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"color: rgb(95, 95, 95); font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 16px;\">灵动锐利 精致轻盈</h3>   <p style=\"line-height: 22px; font-size: 12px;\">机身便捷掌控，外观更优雅，经典色彩搭配，炫出品质人生。</p>  </div>  <div>   <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/16/11/rBEhVVMdXeEIAAAAAAESgRgvJXUAAJ5HwDDZAIAARKZ469.jpg\" />  </div> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\">  <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M04/0B/18/rBEhWlMdXVUIAAAAAAGl-6xevT4AAJwWAP8DEgAAaYT158.jpg\" /> </div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:30', '2015-03-08 21:28:30');
