云安全等多项人性化的便捷功能，使用更随心随意。</span>  </div> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 638px; background-image: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t163/292/516052788/63973/67dc66e7/5390101bN7850d47d.jpg\');\">  <div style=\"padding-top: 180px; padding-left: 28px;\">   <span style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\';font-size:24px;\">多模技术，通话上网无界限</span>  </div>  <div style=\"line-height: 20px; padding-left: 28px; font-size: 12px;\">   兼容2G、3G、4G的多模技术，支持全网协议；   <br />网络切换更自由，通话上网无界限。  </div></div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\">  <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; text-align: center;\">   <span style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\';font-size:24px;\">酷派智能省电技术</span>   <br />   <br />   <span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height: 20px;\"> 多种省电设计，配合2000mAh大容量电池，突破大屏智能手机使用时间短的瓶颈， <br />让手机续航能力大大加强，尽情玩乐无所顾忌！</span>  </div>  <div>   <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t145/1/539744980/50548/76369587/5390102cN7c1976b9.jpg\" />  </div> </div></div><div class=_00000_B_ERPFUSE_9147018 id=\"abdis_B\">					<div style=\"width:750px; margin:0 auto;\"> \r\n <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/0A/12/rBEQYFGixPYIAAAAAAApsmGaiwAAACEFgHIF8AAACnK214.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \r\n</div> \r\n<div style=\"width:750px; height:478px; margin:0 auto; background:url(http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M09/1F/09/rBEhWFK9Rf0IAAAAAAFIomarCzgAAHUeAKdkwQAAUi6397.jpg) no-repeat; border-bottom:dashed 1px #CCC;\"> \r\n <div style=\"padding-top:35px; padding-left:40px;\"> \r\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size:22px; color:#515151; padding-bottom:10px; line-height:25px;\">4G网络100M极速上网</h2> \r\n  <p style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:22px; color:#7c7c7c;\">领先的TD-LTE4G高速网络，<br /> 最高速率达100Mbps，让你抢先感受酣畅的视频体验和非凡的游戏快感。<br /> </p> \r\n </div> \r\n</div> \r\n<div style=\"width:750px; height:641px; margin:0 auto; background:url(http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M05/0A/00/rBEhVVK9Rg4IAAAAAAGEjzW8zz8AAHcpACQm3EAAYSn750.jpg) no-repeat; border-bottom:dashed 1px #CCC;\"> \r\n <div style=\"padding-top:45px; text-align:center;\"> \r\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size:22px; color:#515151; padding-bottom:10px; line-height:25px;\">CoolLife UI5.0 洞悉你心</h2> \r\n  <p style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:22px; color:#7c7c7c;\">酷派8720L独有的CoolLife UI5.0系统，<br /> 具有桌面管理、三笔定位、赏心酷派秀、云安全等多项人性化的便捷功能，使用更随心随意。</p> \r\n </div> \r\n</div> \r\n<div style=\"width:750px; height:545px; margin:0 auto; background:url(http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M07/0A/00/rBEhV1K9RjUIAAAAAAEQIhieoVwAAHcpQMqKUEAARA6420.jpg) no-repeat; border-bottom:dashed 1px #CCC;\"> \r\n <div style=\"padding-top:70px; padding-left:43px;\"> \r\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size:22px; color:#515151; padding-bottom:10px; line-height:25px;\">多模双待，通话上网无界限</h2> \r\n  <p style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:22px; color:#7c7c7c;\">酷派8720L兼容2G、3G、4G的多模技术，支持全网协议；<br /> 双待技术，数据网络切换更自由，通话上网无界限。</p> \r\n </div> \r\n</div> \r\n<div style=\"width:750px; margin:0 auto;\"> \r\n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M06/0A/00/rBEhV1K9RlEIAAAAAABeW-x2z0AAAHcpwGgl6wAAF5z169.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \r\n</div> \r\n<div style=\"width:750px; margin:0 auto;\"> \r\n <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/0A/12/rBEQYFGiw_4IAAAAAAAp4J-ptK0AACEDgOO5BAAACn4809.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \r\n</div> \r\n<div style=\"width:750px; height:451px; margin:0 auto; background:url(http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M01/1F/09/rBEhWlK9RmUIAAAAAAFh-T99XPUAAHUeQJ9wCEAAWIR568.jpg) no-repeat; border-bottom:dashed 1px #CCC;\"> \r\n <div style=\"padding-top:30px; padding-left:50px\"> \r\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size:22px; color:#515151; padding-bottom:20px; line-height:25px;\">5.0英寸高清晰屏</h2> \r\n  <p style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:22px; color:#7c7c7c;\">配备5英寸高清大屏，不仅色彩饱和度更高，色彩还原更逼真，<br /> 还拥有更宽广的视野。<br /> </p> \r\n </div> \r\n</div> \r\n<div style=\"width:750px; height:547px; margin:0 auto; background:url(http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M00/0E/17/rBEhU1K9RpgIAAAAAAEo8lJi9pQAAHWHANzNoUAASkK697.jpg) no-repeat; border-bottom:dashed 1px #CCC;\"> \r\n <div style=\"padding-top:50px; text-align:center;\"> \r\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size:22px; color:#515151; padding-bottom:20px; line-height:25px;\">四核1.2GHz极速CPU</h2> \r\n  <p style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:22px; color:#7c7c7c;\">搭载全球首发的四核1.2GHz极速处理器，轻松处理每一个指令，<br /> 多任务流畅运行，助您随时洞悉世界风云。<br /> </p> \r\n </div> \r\n</div> \r\n<div style=\"width:750px; height:485px; margin:0 auto; background:url(http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M02/1F/09/rBEhWFK9RnUIAAAAAAD_VYGD6mAAAHUegLMHh8AAP9t651.jpg) no-repeat; border-bottom:dashed 1px #CCC;\"> \r\n <div style=\"padding-top:35px; padding-left:20px;\"> \r\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size:22px; color:#515151; padding-bottom:10px; line-height:25px;\">500万像素自动对焦+200万像素双摄像头</h2> \r\n  <p style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:22px; color:#7c7c7c;\">支持高清拍摄，呈现全景画面，成像更完美，不错失任何细节。</p> \r\n </div> \r\n</div> \r\n<div style=\"width:750px; height:468px; margin:0 auto; background:url(http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M05/0A/00/rBEhVVK9Rh0IAAAAAACyvkL8OUgAAHcpAKpXO0AALLW984.jpg) no-repeat; border-bottom:dashed 1px #CCC;\"> \r\n <div style=\"padding-top:35px; text-align:center;\"> \r\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size:22px; color:#515151; padding-bottom:10px; line-height:25px;\">2000mAh超大容量电池</h2> \r\n  <p style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:22px; color:#7c7c7c;\">多种省电设计，配合1900mAh大容量电池，突破大屏智能手机使用时间短的瓶颈，<br /> 让手机续航能力大大加强，尽情玩乐无所顾忌！</p> \r\n </div> \r\n</div> \r\n<div style=\"width:750px; margin:0 auto;\"> \r\n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M0A/1F/09/rBEhWFK9Rd0IAAAAAABGIeQZODwAAHUdwCKXwQAAEY5911.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \r\n</div> \r\n<div style=\"width:750px; margin:0 auto;\"> \r\n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M0A/1F/09/rBEhWlK9ReoIAAAAAAHU9t1w2iIAAHUdwMS3XwAAdUO768.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \r\n</div>\r\n				</div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:01', '2015-03-08 21:28:01');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1041045', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品特色</span><span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M06/11/14/rBEhU1LU24AIAAAAAAc31bEPblwAAH6FgA30AoABzft319.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品信息</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">①豪华动力，磅礴气势，大美镜界浑然天成，创新Metal fabric肌理，不凡气质彰显个性，灵动流线型机身，超薄视觉与舒适握感完美平衡</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M04/02/05/rBEhWFLU26wIAAAAAALP_HvhansAAH4XALTKbwAAtAU581.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">②5.3&rsquo;高清大屏，分辨率1280*720，IPS材质，PPI 277,亮度500nit，透光率达到90%以上，显示效果更加逼真增加防指纹镀膜，表面抗污能力强，想独有的抗干扰算法；高精确度触控，误差小于1mm</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M07/02/05/rBEhWFLU28YIAAAAAAMOEhLOkqAAAH4XgC-FxsAAw4q201.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">③超级相机 &mdash; 强大易用前置：200万像素,后置：1300万像素,BIS-2第二代背照式技术,F2.2超大光圈,BlueGlass滤层,支持闪光灯</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M03/0C/1C/rBEhVlLU2-EIAAAAAAIQN2g1k9IAAIAogJmrycAAhBP305.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品细节</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M08/11/14/rBEhVFLU2_IIAAAAAAKqjVO0YssAAH6FwG-LBoAAqql060.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:42', '2015-03-08 21:27:42');
