屏幕: 1、不能用一般软布（如眼镜布）或纸巾来擦拭液晶屏幕，对于柔软的液晶屏幕而言，它们的表面还是太粗糙了，很容易划伤娇气的液晶屏幕。 2、不能使用清水清洁，使用清水液体极易滴入液晶电视内部，这样会造成设备电路短路，从而烧坏昂贵的电子设备。并且对于指纹和油污，清水照样无能为力。 3、不要用酒精和其它一些化学溶剂清洁液晶屏幕，因为现在的液晶屏幕，都在屏幕上涂有特殊的涂层，使屏幕具有更好的显示效果，一旦使用酒精擦拭显示器屏幕，就会溶解这层特殊的涂层， 对显示效果造成不良影响。用化学溶剂就更不可取，这种化学制剂对&ldquo;骄气&rdquo;的液晶面板简直就是毁灭性的打击。 4、您可以用液晶专用擦拭布喷加适量无离子水，使擦拭布略具潮湿感，然后再去擦拭，就可以既让污渍无踪迹也不会擦伤您的液晶屏幕了。因为专用的液晶擦拭布采用的是特殊纤维，具有比一般高档眼镜布要好的多的，擦拭效果，而且柔软不会擦伤屏幕，同时还具有消散静电的独特功能。</div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:35', '2015-03-08 21:27:35');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1063684', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品特色</span><span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/0A/18/rBEhU1KlifsIAAAAAAJVNnzCoF4AAGkUgClTA8AAlVO543.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品信息</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">友约无需注册，手机号码就是友约账号；手机联系人就是友约联系人，查找好友更方便,友约可以利用3G网络和无线网络，随时随地和好友视屏通话，只需要网络，不用付电话费\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M09/06/01/rBEhVlKliiwIAAAAAAsh4qTx0KsAAGq2AIESEAACyH6655.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">&ldquo;空灵触控&rdquo;内提供了几乎所有常用操作：截屏、省电开关、返回、快捷链接、锁屏、拍照、等等，还可以悬停在手机侧面任意位置\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M0A/1B/0A/rBEhWlKlijUIAAAAAAxaMhYJPmIAAGi0gADqbgADFpK397.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品功效/功能</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Functionality</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">急速</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M08/1C/06/rBEhWlKqntgIAAAAAAPEeq3jOzQAAGt-gG2AzQAA8SS277.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品展示</span><span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M0A/05/09/rBEhWVL9iOYIAAAAAAFumUxQy6wAAIfnwLvKlcAAW6x863.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M01/05/09/rBEhWFL9iPoIAAAAAAHEB1rxNKoAAIfoALj7woAAcQf366.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M01/10/01/rBEhV1L9iTAIAAAAAAA_61UY25gAAIn6QKpBzgAAEAD574.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:01', '2015-03-08 21:28:01');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1066731', '			<div class=\"content_tpl\">    <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">    <span>产品信息</span>    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>   </div>  </div> <div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M0A/1F/06/rBEhV1NWGk8IAAAAAAFZ1ILXtoMAAMayQGUlb4AAVns967.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div>    <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品功能\">   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">    <span>产品功能</span>    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>   </div>  </div> <div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">真正八核 一手玩转大型游戏</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">采用业内领先MTK6592真八核芯片，兼具运行速度快，同步运行程序多，绿色环保省电节能等优点，比普通四核处理器性能提升一倍以上。流畅运行多种程序及各类大型3D游戏。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/15/1E/rBEhUlMEXU8IAAAAAANsmur7WVYAAIv-wEwuRwAA2yy688.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">一屏处理双任务，前所未有的大屏体验</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">独特智能分屏，配以6.0英寸大屏，带来超凡应用体验，您可以一遍看NBA，一边聊微信；娱乐、沟通两不误。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t1171/344/48450906/248333/8e04fb36/54f442b1N725b5f4f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; text-align: center;\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">高清画质，清晰无与伦比</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">升级15/24/30帧的普通画面自动插帧到60帧，最大程度保证了画面清晰度。与朋友分享更完美的视觉体验。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t547/93/1431202162/218072/c327af9c/54f44357Na8b85f26.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"502\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; text-align: center;\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">手机安全助手，五星级安全</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">拥有主动式安全管理，获得工信部五级安全认证，从安装程序软件开始到手机使用，随时随地全方位保护您的手机。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M01/06/0F/rBEhWVMEX2AIAAAAAAPDU63LktYAAIuSQLDlFUAA8Nr458.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">更多精彩功能</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M05/11/06/rBEhV1MEX4cIAAAAAAM13wQUkAIAAI2lAIsXZwAAzX3986.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:54', '2015-03-08 21:27:54');
