INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1073239', '		<table cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">   <tbody> <tr>     <td><iframe marginheight=\"0px\" marginwidth=\"0px\" src=\"http://cloud.letv.com/bcloud.html?uu=82abd5491f&vu=84e7ecd74d&width=750&height=422&auto_play=0\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"422px\" width=\"750px\"> </iframe></td>   </tr> </tbody> </table><div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品特色</span><span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M03/0C/1A/rBEhWFMhJvEIAAAAAAAzenfkOksAAJ9qQFwVJwAADOS846.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星N7506V支持中国联通TD-LTE 4G网络，让您畅享移动过程中的高速网络服务。无论是观看视频，还是传送大容量文件，都会让您体验到无法想象的高速快感！</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/1C/0A/rBEhU1MhJ5gIAAAAAACWRGL-iN4AAJ_5gB261MAAJZc246.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/1C/0A/rBEhVFMhJ6cIAAAAAAAhggCpDDIAAJ_5gLfvMUAACGa951.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星N7506V配置有5.5英寸高清大屏，开阔的视界呈现，让精彩内容一览无余。高分辨率让画质更细腻自然，细节呈现恰到好处。简洁流畅的机身线条，配以纹理触感设计的后盖，让N7506V在简约而不简单的独特设计中，达到功能和艺术的妙趣平衡。 </div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M03/17/13/rBEhVlMhKEsIAAAAAADyDKevp80AAKGnQF1848AAPIk586.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M04/0C/1A/rBEhWFMhKFYIAAAAAAAfc_EIkb4AAJ9tgAEoH0AAB-L270.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M01/17/13/rBEhV1MhKJIIAAAAAABp2IOJ8-gAAKGoALYyrgAAGnw284.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星N7506V的超强性能和超大屏幕，支持多窗口多任务操作，无需关闭窗口或打开新的页面，即可在应用程序之间进行无缝切换。您可以同时处理两项任务，还可以直接将文本、图片等内容拖拽到另一个窗口，在多窗口托盘，还可预览激活的页面。多窗口功能将大幅提高您的工作效率，助您在工作中游刃有余。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M01/17/13/rBEhV1MhKhUIAAAAAADeX3q8K6AAAKGtgH_AH4AAN53149.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星N7506V搭载四核1.6GHz处理器，支持多任务处理，页面加载和应用启动均流畅自如，毫无卡顿之感。其内置的Android 4.3智能操作系统，更是为您带来灵敏的触控体验和更简洁的用户界面，让您的各项操作都得心应手，翻转自如。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/1C/0B/rBEhVFMhKsoIAAAAAAESQbBvi3IAAKAEANqeVsAARJZ966.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星N7506V具有优质的成像效果，800万像素主摄像头以及200万像素的前置摄像头，让成像颇近专业效果，更有多种拍摄模式可选，让您尽情领略拍摄之美，驻留美好时光。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/1C/0B/rBEhVFMhK0sIAAAAAADv5uWeFNoAAKAGQCDSPMAAO_-758.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星N7506V与Samsung GALAXY Gear完美兼容，让您接听或拨打电话时无需再单手握持，Samsung GALAXY Gear让通话更简捷。让您拿起电话时，应用程序会自动显示在Samsung GALAXY Gear上，如信息、邮件、ChatON等细节内容。当手机离开Samsung GALAXY Gear设定的距离，手机会自动上锁，保障信息安全。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/1C/0B/rBEhVFMhLIAIAAAAAACNsJ7Q1AAAAKAIAHwZQEAAI3I884.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:37', '2015-03-08 21:27:37');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1073311', '	<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品特色</span><span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M08/18/09/rBEhU1MP_PUIAAAAAAGFfc7NSaoAAJNVgDzmV0AAYWV655.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品信息</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">4英寸主流屏幕 800*480分辨率</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">上网、看电子书，正合适；看视频、玩游戏，足够用；单手轻松操作！800*480分辨率，看图片、看电影效果清晰！</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M01/13/12/rBEhVlMP_SkIAAAAAAK2nQL9xW4AAJT_gDT_lEAAra1197.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">乐商店 乐安全</div><div class=\"formwork_text\"><br />乐商店：20多万海量免费应用，任您下载；随时随地下载、安装、卸载应用，管理更方便；丰富的信息推送，让您及时了解最新讯息！<br />乐安全：手机安全防护，病毒查杀，拦截吸毒软件；流量监控，广告拦截；隐私保护，访客模式。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M03/13/12/rBEhVlMP_bYIAAAAAAGW8rsFMKkAAJUAgLfmLMAAZcK844.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><br /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:16', '2015-03-08 21:28:16');
