rc=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g16/M00/05/0B/rBEbRlNzUjIIAAAAAAApeEQBxuMAABCugOLGzQAACmQ805.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://sale.jd.com/act/ZlGpaNHWKJo.html\"><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g16/M00/05/0B/rBEbRlNzUj8IAAAAAAAq3GQhkikAABCuwL8WoQAACr0727.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"formwork_img\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><br /></span><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\';\">&nbsp;注：选择购机入网送话费的方式购买合约，话费为赠品不开具发票</span></div></div></div><br /></div><div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品信息</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M02/01/13/rBEhWlLPrusIAAAAAAfAEfhRy8YAAHxewPXMV8AB8Ap828.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">精致机身设计，金属质感；GPS/Glonass/北斗三网导航，指路精灵；</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">3000mAh大电池，智能节电；前置500万像素摄像头，美颜自拍；后置1300万像素摄像头，全焦拍照。</div></div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品功能</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/11/02/rBEhVFLPtmcIAAAAAAIh_4WTz6IAAHzUwHmFLQAAiIX761.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M04/11/02/rBEhUlLPtoMIAAAAAAPnM9R8wUEAAHzVAKNyd4AA-dL613.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/11/02/rBEhVFLPtpcIAAAAAAH-MrZKL7MAAHzVQFl1JoAAf5K227.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M06/0C/0B/rBEhVVLPtqQIAAAAAAJ-mrJSuk0AAH53wNJeYYAAn6y112.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M01/0C/0B/rBEhV1LPttAIAAAAAAK9-d3vgOIAAH54QPe4rUAAr4R353.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M02/0C/0B/rBEhV1LPttsIAAAAAAKnfxZSOcAAAH54gIWE5QAAqeX992.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M03/0C/0B/rBEhV1LPtuYIAAAAAAMndEEVu-YAAH54wCdNm8AAyeM339.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><br /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:54', '2015-03-08 21:27:54');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1076416', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t226/176/1066182513/132935/6cd57a95/53f59b60N22682fc6.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">飞利浦&ldquo;耀&rdquo;系列:</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\"><br>该系列手机成为闪耀的代表，酷炫的造型，精细的做工，更好诠释了商务精英硬朗沉稳的形象，时刻成为众人眼中闪耀的焦点；\n<br>融汇中国传统文化，实现科技与文化的跨界融合，让传统文化再次绽放耀眼光芒，这也是飞利浦秉承创新精神，打造精品内涵体现。\n</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-3\" name=\"detail-tag-id-3\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M04/1A/0F/rBEhUlMZcVUIAAAAAAm8HwmpyX8AAJo6QMk-ZoACbw3155.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">MTK联发科28纳米四核1.2GHz</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\"><br>搭载28纳米工艺 MT6589M四核1.2GHz，采用Cortex-A7超低功耗架构，享受极速体验； 1GB RAM+4GB ROM配合1.2GHz四核处理器，保证多任务在手机上操作的流畅度。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-6\" name=\"detail-tag-id-6\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/15/18/rBEhV1MZcXkIAAAAAAg0xL-3tukAAJvmgLE97wACDTc173.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-8\" name=\"detail-tag-id-8\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M0A/15/18/rBEhVlMZcZgIAAAAAASVBgaSpn8AAJvnAFeiYcABJUe626.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-10\" name=\"detail-tag-id-10\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M06/15/18/rBEhV1MZca8IAAAAAAVPuPArrdoAAJvnQO0mpMABU_Q588.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"> 健康环保</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\"><br>天线远离大脑，低sar，Sar值：0.4，远低于国家标准（国家标准Sar是2)；\n<br>特别的射频电路控制，高效率的天线，低衰减；\n<br>ROHS，PVC free，无卤素；\n<br>省电也是环保。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-13\" name=\"detail-tag-id-13\" text=\"温馨提示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>温馨提示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">RoHS是由欧盟立法制定的一项强制性标准，它的全称是《关于限制在电子电器设备中使用某些有害成分的指令》(Restriction of Hazardous Substances)。该标准已于2006年7月1日开始正式实施，主要用于规范电子电气产品的材料及工艺标准，使之更加有利于人体健康及环境保护。该标准的目的在于消除电机电子产品中的铅、汞、镉、六价铬、多溴联苯和多溴联苯醚共6项物质，并重点规定了铅的含量不能超过0.1%。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-15\" name=\"detail-tag-id-15\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M08/1A/0F/rBEhUlMZcckIAAAAAAOaaVNPqZwAAJo7gLtj-YAA5qB010.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-17\" name=\"detail-tag-id-17\" text=\"产品细节\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品细节</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t619/225/1410623470/480678/1f59018a/54d47712N073a3ac6.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M08/15/18/rBEhVlMZciEIAAAAAAZq1ANYFIkAAJvoALw4TMABmrs489.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-20\" name=\"detail-tag-id-20\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M05/0B/00/rBEhWVMZcl4IAAAAAApfPdUEXV0AAJm9wH5YkIACl9V917.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:29:12', '2015-03-08 21:29:12');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1078792', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t550/37/1223327488/806738/24278db5/54aa5cb0N8e9e85b5.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t472/32/1070421584/943277/59d819fe/54aa5cdbNa71fe365.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t592/71/1059681971/698539/353de09/54aa5d88N05818f27.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t568/294/1045826583/983962/e5b2c6b/54aa5dd8Nf055c455.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t700/166/380413709/543655/77a99078/54aa5ebdN53fdd33c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t463/285/1048461035/1136549/2b2bcdf7/54aa5ee4Nf598cb1e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t475/196/1054426068/347896/24ac03f9/54aa5f1dN203a4989.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:39', '2015-03-08 21:27:39');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1078794', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t199/3/1851061554/321528/aa6524a5/53bba8a3Nd0b07595.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-1\" name=\"detail-tag-id-1\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">内置的三大UI电视</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t163/363/3035598376/288562/56de8e99/53df42dbN0824eb76.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">比声音更近的，是心灵&mdash;语义操控</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t208/202/2207404621/209085/a4f6fd1c/53ca2842N7bc996a4.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">提升输入生产力&mdash;极简输入法</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t184/95/3006002617/158315/d0fc056e/53df430eNf891a3da.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">大拇指遥控器</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t163/284/3098737959/272891/d788845/53e21700N26b0014c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">智能家居，不再是科幻&mdash;云智控</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t193/264/3156833421/273705/ecbcf438/53e21713N51f14d0e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">&ldquo;果冻豆&rdquo;&mdash;原生态安卓4.2</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t190/153/1847032868/241411/9b1ff8f3/53bbab90Nd01ea326.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">WIFI接收无界限&mdash;内置双天线WIFI</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t163/74/1823359640/145757/d7764ee2/53bbac60N99e985c1.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">&ldquo;核&rdquo;竞备&mdash;超强八核</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t187/222/2267007765/116830/15a1b7fb/53ca28e5N943a7d3a.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">电视80%的成本是屏！&mdash;韩国原装IPS硬屏</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t160/116/2266545916/230537/8261c9ef/53ca492aNa03f5ad5.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">第二代色轮技术&mdash;让电视成为大自然的窗口</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t166/327/1785957225/213830/4f440b3a/53bbadb9N66870391.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">观看视野&mdash;超窄边框设计</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t202/325/2318252282/63150/1cb77117/53ca290eN4658d9ef.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">全供应链掌控&mdash;工业设计</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t169/168/1869326174/199895/9c1ce0bb/53bbae68N033d93cc.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">标配的地面数字一体机&mdash;DTMB</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t151/328/2984938288/119198/7a4c4f42/53df4365N87d6c2c7.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">标配的高清卡槽&mdash;一体机</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t172/105/2264244241/94581/d230b8ff/53ca2931N78aad346.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">智能就要速度&mdash;USB3.0和HDMI1.4</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t187/67/2235010000/116670/cc82b8ab/53ca296fN5b7dc6f7.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">随身携带的遥控器&mdash;多屏互动4.2.1版</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t145/168/1805448457/160068/a795946e/53bbaf99Na4ba9404.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">多屏互动，欢乐共享</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t196/39/1834040853/247530/7e38e5bb/53bbafd6N86995625.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-36\" name=\"detail-tag-id-36\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t181/345/1845417355/357440/117bece3/53bbb01dN5fe995de.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:39', '2015-03-08 21:27:39');
