色彩饱和度提高至90%，万千色彩始终出色演绎。   <br />  </div> </div> <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M07/0E/12/rBEhV1Lk3D0IAAAAAAGDaJ5U8H8AAIVswAZVZIAAYOA590.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 601px;\">  <div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 20px; padding-top: 120px; padding-left: 45px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 12px;\">   最新一代LTPS玻璃和IPS全视角技术，上下左右可视角度皆提升至178度，   <br /> 每一度都明艳如一；   <br />  </div> </div> <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M05/03/1B/rBEhWFLk3E0IAAAAAAE4Id-ryuIAAINagLsRUYAATg5284.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 648px;\">  <div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 20px; padding-top: 120px; padding-left: 50px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 12px;\">   极速四核处理器，轻松处理每一个指令，多任务流畅运行，   <br /> 助您随时洞悉世界风云。   <br />  </div> </div> <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M05/03/1B/rBEhWlLk3FwIAAAAAADhgf4PXSYAAINagOmHDYAAOGZ161.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 488px;\">  <div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 20px; padding-top: 175px; padding-left: 443px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 12px;\">   苦恼前置摄像头不够清晰？手指点触屏幕时手抖导致   <br /> 照片模糊？   <br />   <br /> 800万摄像头智语自拍，语音提醒后置摄像头从容自拍，释放你的手指，说拍就拍！  </div> </div> <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M06/03/1B/rBEhWlLk3GwIAAAAAACNfx8erjYAAINawCF_AoAAI2X233.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 650px;\">  <div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 20px; padding-top: 125px; padding-left: 45px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 12px;\">   7.9mm锋脱机身，让科技智能演艺至美时尚；超窄无边设计，将极简主义发挥得淋漓尽致；   <br /> 高光电镀侧线，考究细节，低调之中难掩锋芒。  </div> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\">  <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/0A/12/rBEQYFGixPYIAAAAAAApsmGaiwAAACEFgHIF8AAACnK214.jpg\" /> </div> <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M0A/13/0A/rBEhU1Lk3HoIAAAAAAFI9vJT-icAAIPJwKmVXsAAUkO408.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 570px;\">  <div style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 20px; padding-top: 110px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 12px;\">   16GB机身内存，为你的精彩预留更多空间，海量应用、视频、   <br /> 游戏纵情下载，娱乐宝库与你随行，丰富的掌上娱乐从不间断。   <br />  </div> </div></div><div class=_1079605_B_ERPFUSE_2898019 id=\"abdis_B\"><div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\">  <br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M05/03/1B/rBEhWFLk294IAAAAAABGIeQZODwAAINagGybQAAAEY5018.jpg\" /> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\">&nbsp;  <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M07/12/00/rBEhWVM5LicIAAAAAAHX5nUrlM0AAK-aAMcaGMAAdf-078.jpg\" />  <img alt=\"酷派8750\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M02/01/0E/rBEhVFM5LjYIAAAAAAIZ-3KAV0IAAK_4AIojLUAAhoT447.jpg\" />  <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/01/0E/rBEhUlM5LkQIAAAAAAHNg9C6bKAAAK_4QFIv-UAAc2b104.jpg\" />  <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/01/0E/rBEhVFM5LlQIAAAAAAEVrYRDvc4AAK_4wAVznoAARXF813.jpg\" />  <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M00/01/0E/rBEhVFM5LmMIAAAAAADe1tnXCe0AAK_5AK3QJ0AAN7u225.jpg\" /> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\">  <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/0A/12/rBEQYFGiw_4IAAAAAAAp4J-ptK0AACEDgOO5BAAACn4809.jpg\" /> </div> <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M03/0C/1A/rBEhWFMhKUgIAAAAAAEUM0bMMLEAAJ9wAJT8BUAARRL055.jpg\') no-repeat; margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; height: 667px;\">  <div style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); line-height: 19px; padding-top: 113px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; font-size: 12px;\">   5.5英寸高清大屏，外加OGS全贴合工艺，尽情演绎高清影像，触控感受更为直观；  </div> </div> <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360bu