ork_titleleft\">多窗口多任务——全面兼顾 游刃有余</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星N7508V的超强性能和超大屏幕，支持多窗口多任务操作，无需关闭窗口或打开新的页面，即可在应用程序之间进行无缝切换。您可以同时处理两项任务，还可以直接将文本、图片等内容拖拽到另一个窗口，在多窗口托盘，还可预览激活的页面。多窗口功能将大幅提高您的工作效率，助您在工作中游刃有余。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t178/112/2001057778/67361/a185a606/53c47c47N4d899fca.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">四核1.6GHz处理器——强劲性能 随心畅游 </div><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星N7508V搭载四核1.6GHz处理器，支持多任务处理，页面加载和应用启动均流畅自如，毫无卡顿之感。其内置的Android?4.3智能操作系统，更是为您带来灵敏的触控体验和更简洁的用户界面，让您的各项操作都得心应手。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t208/344/2079935329/65187/f0a7c012/53c47c70N3c65fa9b.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">800万像素+200万像素双摄像头——领略摄影之美</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星N7508V具有优质的成像效果，800万像素主摄像头以及200万像素的前置摄像头，更有多种拍摄模式可选，让您尽情领略拍摄之趣，留驻美好时光。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t154/246/2036779044/55388/994b8531/53c47dacNf2e593fc.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:37', '2015-03-08 21:27:37');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1081036', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品特色</span><span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M08/08/14/rBEhVFNY3HoIAAAAAAEIchPKJRQAAMZUgL29_UAAQiK142.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/0B/0A/rBEQYVNY3MkIAAAAAAB5dR_bOvEAAFCTQLqmd4AAHmN416.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品信息</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">5.7吋高清大屏，大屏幕，大视野</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">5.7英寸，1280*720分辨率，大屏上网酣畅体验，大字体大按钮操控准确，玩游戏得心应手，高清电影拍照画质细腻</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/0B/0A/rBEQYFNY3OoIAAAAAAF2TPZRXuYAAFCTwE_-nQAAXZk810.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">双卡双待，自由切换，更多选择</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">W+G双卡双待，多彩人生一手抓，工作生活两不误。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/0B/0A/rBEQYVNY3RkIAAAAAACU9UeN7Z8AAFCUQPc8uYAAJUN079.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/0F/06/rBEQYFNm7-0IAAAAAACZUNUsJcYAAFf3QJSymIAAJlo701.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">掌心管家，全方位智能管理</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">掌心管家，全方位智能管理；四大功能更有效保护用户的信息安全，防止偷信息、偷流量，是流氓软件的克星</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/0B/0A/rBEQYFNY3SAIAAAAAACc1CemMe0AAFCUgFe4PsAAJzs488.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M02/08/14/rBEhVFNY3SwIAAAAAAEpOfrE23oAAMZWgJ4G0AAASlR210.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:10', '2015-03-08 21:28:10');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1081117', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品信息</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M05/0C/05/rBEhWFMeyyMIAAAAAAF3IDfnXJEAAJ1hAIkNTUAAXc4699.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M08/0C/05/rBEhWFMeyy8IAAAAAAG2G5ujlFcAAJ1hQHblaoAAbYz954.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/1B/15/rBEhU1MeyzoIAAAAAADQj5Ty-J8AAJ3pwHYCaAAANCn671.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品特色</span><span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M08/16/1E/rBEhV1Mey2EIAAAAAAFPMTHBMj8AAJ-WQFHN0kAAU9J660.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M03/0C/05/rBEhWFMey2wIAAAAAAGylIQ9T-cAAJ1hwD8CA4AAbKs133.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/06/16/rBEhVFIRuz4IAAAAAAAVx3qJcykAACNBAP_YkUAABXf404.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">东芝 REGZA高画质引擎</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">东芝是所有电视品牌中唯一一家使用自己研发、生产、制造芯片的品牌，它保证了东芝电视所有技术的无缝对接，使图像处理速度更快，画质更清晰、细腻，颜色过渡更自然。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/06/16/rBEhU1IRu1kIAAAAAABkO3dq8qgAACNBQOLIB4AAGRT685.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M02/16/1E/rBEhV1Mey3cIAAAAAAFs9rfaMgQAAJ-WgHkf0AAAW0O661.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M03/16/1E/rBEhVlMey4IIAAAAAAG52GWKTYsAAJ-WwJZq88AAbnw761.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/06/16/rBEhU1IRvEQIAAAAAAAVf1ItuosAACNCQJh140AABWX039.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">东芝 火箭炮音响系统</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">东芝电视的火箭炮音响系统融合了杜比音效技术，采用5+1立体式环绕，可以在极短时间营造极其震撼的立体环绕效果。新增的低音扬声器和大功率复合增频系统，保证音质的完美呈现，给您不一样的听觉感受。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M04/16/1E/rBEhVlMey40IAAAAAAEDy5uXvSUAAJ-XANK4kgAAQPj806.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M05/16/1E/rBEhVlMey5UIAAAAAACQ3sNQ2cAAAJ-XQN3t-AAAJD2283.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M05/16/1E/rBEhVVMey50IAAAAAACiSAgIwLgAAJ-XgMincIAAKJg542.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M0A/16/1E/rBEhVVMey6YIAAAAAAD0nquUhAkAAJ-XwEhmqUAAPS2442.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M06/0C/05/rBEhWFMey7AIAAAAAADkWa8Wtc8AAJ1iAM6L_MAAORx124.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M02/16/1E/rBEhV1MezK8IAAAAAAGAn7drJwwAAJ-ZgBZFK4AAYC3475.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品功能</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/1B/15/rBEhUlMezwgIAAAAAAEpfyc4ZxoAAJ3ywFF6E0AASmX130.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M04/1B/15/rBEhVFMezxEIAAAAAAEC43gDcE0AAJ3zACz5AYAAQL7715.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M07/16/1E/rBEhV1MezxwIAAAAAAEFzXTMPEQAAJ-eAHhlaUAAQXl938.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M0A/16/1E/rBEhVlMezy0IAAAAAADoNU4GGeIAAJ-eQNYpa8AAOhN811.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M02/16/1E/rBEhV1MezzoIAAAAAADMnCFqjFQAAJ-ewB_XYMAAMy0418.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品展示</span><span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M04/0C/06/rBEhWVMez5kIAAAAAACSclXjlecAAJ1rALSosEAAJKK183.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M07/0C/06/rBEhWVMez6AIAAAAAADiHWeqhioAAJ1rQItepYAAOI1142.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M09/0C/06/rBEhWFMez6cIAAAAAAB0y0MThCYAAJ1rgGE5GQAAHTj481.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M09/0C/06/rBEhWFMez60IAAAAAABVYmHiRIQAAJ1rgP_ce0AAFV6086.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/1B/15/rBEhU1Mez7YIAAAAAACe5FaxJMkAAJ3zQFwAkEAAJ78592.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/1B/15/rBEhUlMez70IAAAAAAEEpvI6k4IAAJ3zQPo3Q0AAQS-963.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M00/1B/15/rBEhU1Mez8MIAAAAAAD3xCfVdGQAAJ3zgKZccMAAPfc302.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M01/1B/16/rBEhUlMez8oIAAAAAACnbQSMAFUAAJ3zwHH5l0AAKeF958.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>品牌介绍</span><span class=\"s2\">Brand Introduction</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/1B/16/rBEhUlMez_sIAAAAAAD-dwTHC1wAAJ30wAdbj4AAP6P638.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M06/0B/13/rBEhVVIS4WoIAAAAAACv6ENgKucAACRSwGD2zcAALAA699.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">东芝在日本东京都的总部大楼东芝（TOSHIBA），是日本最大的半导体制造商，亦是第二大综合电机制造商，隶属于三井集团旗下。到今年，东芝在中国的事业已经开展了38年，始终不变的是&ldquo;与中国共同发展&rdquo;的决心与努力。现在东芝所涉足的数码产品，电子设备与零部件，社会基础设施，家电事业领域都在中国有业务开展。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>温馨提示</span><span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">液晶电视保养小常识 不要随手关电视：不是让大家浪费电能，而是要注意权衡开启电源对电视寿命的影响。 荧光管：我们都知道，背光灯是液晶电视所有配件中寿命消耗最严重的一个部件，它和我们家中使用的荧光灯管是非常类似的。所以，它的使用寿命和点燃次数也是有很大关系的。启动的时候预热和高压脉冲式的阴极电子物质的溅射增大，缩短灯管寿命。如果您养成了随手关电视的习惯，以一天开四次计算，灯管的寿命将减少到原来的1/2。 避免长时间工作：这一条并不与上面的注意事项相冲突。在超长时间工作的情况下，热量会在液晶电视的机身内部存积，这对于其它电子元件还不够成太大的威胁，但是液晶面板是有可能烧毁，从而形成大面积坏点的。</div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:45', '2015-03-08 21:27:45');
