\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌介绍</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Introduction</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1054/17/9609881/26436/8a01866/54dc93d2Na9277614.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1018/328/9141770/150325/deede591/54dc93e3N4e5af7d1.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t793/363/10765755/36393/98d638ce/54dc93ffNc507601e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t565/224/1454955368/100547/1d713b8e/54dc940aN0435f421.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1249/86/12077321/79209/56e05a91/54dc9418N93479733.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t922/291/12360011/94213/1dd81e7/54dc9426Na111e9cb.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t985/30/9170845/44957/604238fb/54dc943bNd23dd3dc.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t814/113/10017061/92471/36f6b56f/54dc9456N66c25eb1.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:39', '2015-03-08 21:27:39');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1092889', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品特色</span><span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M08/1B/17/rBEhVlMzsbYIAAAAAAUCR-WTd5kAAK6DAM6e2sABQJf646.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品信息</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">S660</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">9.2mm超薄金属机身，防刮不留指纹；3000毫安电池超长待机！</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M05/10/1D/rBEhWVMzl0MIAAAAAAClf-qeNPEAAKwpgNmRnoAAKWX413.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">4.7英寸IPS屏幕，艳丽逼真的视觉享受！</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/02/19/rBEQYFMzma0IAAAAAAEn9gEYrioAADX9QLAfLUAASgO090.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">1.3GHz四核高性能处理器，1GRAM强劲性能，运行更加流畅！</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/02/19/rBEQYVMzmc8IAAAAAAEtZBWMC9UAADX9gPTRcoAAS18032.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">后置800万像素自动对焦高清摄像头+前置30万像素，记录生活精彩瞬间！</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M01/00/0C/rBEhUlMzmmEIAAAAAAETCMkFcJ4AAKydQCjLCYAARMg403.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">WCDMA+GSM双卡双待，工作生活两不误，自由接听，随意切换！</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M01/00/0C/rBEhU1Mzmm4IAAAAAAEwTfyTJUcAAKydQOd2D4AATBl963.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:29:39', '2015-03-08 21:29:39');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1093051', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t154/40/93283966/1743755/7c95e58b/537ef7e6Nb3809216.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:45', '2015-03-08 21:27:45');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1093056', '<div class=\"new_content\">\n <div class=\"cut1\">\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/02/18/rBEQYVMzhwwIAAAAAAGnXwQ92OoAADXjwMr6gYAAad3958.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <h2>UHD upscaling 画质增强技术</h2>\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M02/00/0B/rBEhU1MzhxMIAAAAAAEEHshL_QsAAKyDgFRemYAAQQ2130.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <h3>超高清画质适时提升</h3>\n  <p>　　UHD锐芯图像引擎，是三星UHD电视完美画质的原动力。即使信号源并非超高清内容，三星UHD锐芯图像处理引擎的画质增强技术，也能让您体验到近乎超高清品质的画质。全新的图像引擎不仅可以以4K分辨率显示超高清来源的内容，甚至可以对电视节目、电影及视频点播等一般分辨率的内容进行优化处理，使其转换成近乎超高清级的画质水平。</p>\n  <div class=\"blank_28\"></div>\n  <h2>UHD超高清局域控光技术</h2>\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M02/00/0B/rBEhVFMzhx4IAAAAAAEFJv0jNsQAAKyDgK5lWUAAQU-459.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <h3>深邃色彩 夺目绽放</h3>\n  <p>　　三星先进的UHD局域控光技术，为您带来最理想的对比度和色彩，让您获得更震撼的观影效果。更高的分辨率也意味会对图像进行更加细致的处理。三星UHD局域控光技术可以对虚拟区块中所有色彩进行优化处理，尤其是黑白两色，让黑色更深邃，白色更纯净。</p>\n  <div class=\"blank_28\"></div>\n  <h2>UHD超高清分辨率</h2>\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M0A/00/0B/rBEhVFMzhyUIAAAAAAFW88IBEnYAAKyDwEKVrsAAVcL033.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <h3>四倍于全高清分辨率 不错失每一处细节</h3>\n  <p>　　超高清分辨率意味着您可以比以往任何时刻，更清楚地看到屏幕上每一个错综复杂的细节。通过四倍于全高清分辨率的三星UHD电视，通过更为精准丰富的色彩，逼真传神的清晰细节，呈现前所未有的电视观看体验。</p>\n  <div class=\"blank_28\"></div>\n  <h2>面向未来的电视</h2>\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M05/00/0B/rBEhU1Mzhy8IAAAAAAB5tRIj7poAAKyEAAhFewAAHnN568.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <h3>让您的三星UHD电视 每年都是最新的</h3>\n  <p>　　技术总是在不断向前发展，三星UHD电视也是如此。您可以通过UHD智能升级卡升级您的超高清电视，以兼容未来尚未最终确立的UHD标准。<br />* UHD智能升级卡单独销售<br />* 该功能基于现有的UHD连接、播放标准和蓝光标准化方案。</p>\n  <div class=\"blank_28\"></div>\n  <h2>Aero Design 臻彩时空设计</h2>\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M05/00/0B/rBEhU1MzhzgIAAAAAAEJ05KcttAAAKyEAOCZEkAAQnr385.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <h3>浩瀚极简理念的艺术设计理念</h3>\n  <p>　　由于采用了浩瀚极简的设计理念，将让您感受前所未有的视觉效果。它继承了三星隐藏式底座设计，另电视宛若悬浮于空间，黑色的极窄金属边框可为您带来呼之欲出的临场感体验。 天然的材质和精美绝伦的细节设计元素， 底边框内置的前射式扬声器，将提供卓越的音频效果。</p>\n  <div class=\"blank_28\"></div>\n  <h2>一屏双享</h2>\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M00/00/0B/rBEhU1Mzhz8IAAAAAAC_zl117SgAAKyEQIOL00AAL_m115.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <h3>双重精彩 一屏享用</h3>\n  <p>　　三星的一屏双享功能可为您带来丰富多彩的视听新体验。利用该智能功能将一个屏幕分割成2个画面，可以在观看电视节目的同时显示互联网上搜索到的与该节目相关的信息，另外，您还可以在观看现场直播的同时欣赏与该节目相关的视频剪辑。在一台电视上畅享双重娱乐，精彩不再设限。</p>\n  <div class=\"blank_28\"></div>\n  <h2>智能触感遥控器</h2>\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M00/00/0B/rBEhUlMzh0oIAAAAAADZW4Pm-gAAAKyEgGBVqgAANlz439.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <h3>轻松便捷 一手搞定</h3>\n  <p>　　智能触感遥控器可让您获得更直观的电视使用体验。通过触摸板您可以随意在智能应用中心间翻转并且上下滚动浏览网页。此外，您还可以使用运动遥控功能在屏幕上移动光标以方便浏览或输入文本。利用视频控制键，您还可以按需播放下载的电影、电视等您喜欢的内容。</p>\n  <div class=\"blank_28\"></div>\n  <h2>智能浏览2.0 </h2>\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g14/M06/1B/15/rBEhV1Mzh1gIAAAAAAD0DANZt2YAAK5UQLYrUUAAPQk063.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <h3>不同设备间的多屏互动</h3>\n  <p>　　三星最新的智能浏览2.0应用程序让观看节目变得很简单，通过家庭网络，您可以通过无线传输方式，将直播电视节目发送到智能手机或平板电脑上，或把移动设备当成电视遥控器使用。或者，您还可以通过三星智能应用中心的智能视听中心，在智能电视上欣赏手机或个人电脑上的内容。简单易用，您只需尽情享受。<br />* 要求您的电视和移动设备处于同一个网络（AP）<br />* 支持的功能可能因操作系统和设备而有所不同</p>\n  <div class=\"blank_28\"></div>\n  <h2>四核处理器</h2>\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g14/M02/1B/15/rBEhVVMzh2IIAAAAAAEDNwzJOtYAAK5UgEhfYAAAQNP334.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <h3>性能强劲 流畅体验</h3>\n  <p>　　三星四核处理器让您拥有更为流畅自如的使用体验，更快的运行速度让各项操作都愈加灵活迅捷，不管是浏览网页，还是切换频道，都让您畅享有如行云流水般的操作体验。</p>\n  <div class=\"blank_28\"></div>\n  <h2>足球模式</h2>\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M07/10/1C/rBEhWFMzh2kIAAAAAAEd5r7auWEAAKwTQGJ0NUAAR3-170.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <h3>感受置身绿荫赛场的现场赛事</h3>\n  <p>　　足球模式为您带来了绿色的场地以及其他体育场色彩效果的增强。功能强大的立体声环绕效果营造了一种让人兴奋的现场氛围。一旦开启足球模式，您将可体验细节放大的功能，让您即使身在家中，也能体验到现场激动人心的得分盛况。<br />*若使用PVR功能录制足球赛事，需要连接DTV信号，且需要外接移动硬盘</p>\n  <div class=\"blank_28\"></div>\n </div>\n <div>\n  <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M07/10/1C/rBEhWFMzh3EIAAAAAAArScDFZfkAAKwTQN4zAgAACth414.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n  <br />\n </div>\n <div class=\"pic\">\n  <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M00/10/1C/rBEhWVMzh3cIAAAAAAdOsE-9eQgAAKwTgEy9NAAB07I381.gif\" alt=\"\" />\n  <br />\n </div>\n <div class=\"pic\">\n  <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M00/10/1C/rBEhWFMzh34IAAAAAAARGyIMgEAAAKwTgLvc4wAABEz166.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n  <br />\n </div>\n <div class=\"cut2\">\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M03/10/1C/rBEhWlMzh4MIAAAAAACKiXErRhUAAKwTwByI_IAAIqh646.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n   <br />\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"block1\">\n   三星集团创业于1938年。截止2011年11月，三星集团全球员工总人数390,000名，目前三星集团共有27家公司，横跨电子、金融、贸易服务、重工等四大领域。三星于1995年成立中国总部，中国三星员工数量达到10.2万名，已在23个相关领域中成立了15是研究所7个，分公司等70个)\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"cut5\">\n  <p><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M03/10/1C/rBEhWVMzh5MIAAAAAAAXSACwDCwAAKwUAB_mF8AABdg360.jpg\" alt=\"\" />三星有74年的品牌历史；2012年，三星在世界500强排名第20位，其中家电品牌第1位；三星电子在2011年 11月销售电视570万台创史上销量冠军纪录. 等于全世界范围每秒钟销售两台.三星电视连续6年全球销量第一；同时三星也是全球最大的液晶面板生产商；三星电视产品以品类全、尺寸全深受消费者喜爱。 </p>\n  <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"cut5\">\n  <p><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g14/M02/1B/15/rBEhVVMzh5kIAAAAAAAXYeRsTmEAAK5UgJT45sAABd5166.jpg\" alt=\"\" />三星拥有领先的LED背光源技术，是全球最大的面板供应商，还专门为三星电视设计了高集成度的靓芯图像引擎，与三星标准化液晶屏、背光源技术达到最完美的搭配，显示出最佳的效果。 </p>\n  <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"cut5\">\n  <p><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M03/10/1C/rBEhWFMzh6AIAAAAAAAXaAMSKcgAAKwUAK4kGoAABeA272.jpg\" alt=\"\" />三星全球有上千名顶级技术开发人员，像LED液晶电视,3D电视,智能电视都是三星首先推广的，在行业内也非常受认可。三星掌握了LED液晶电视面板，芯片及背光源等全产业链核心技术，目前只有三星在LED电视面板，芯片及背光源等围绕LED电视的特性进行整合研发，这能够最大程度发挥LED的优势，生产出最优质的LED电视</p>\n  <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n </div>\n <div>\n  <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g14/M03/1B/15/rBEhVVMzh6UIAAAAAAH-7kXZMAcAAK5UwBAGMkAAf8G975.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n  <br />\n </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"blank_28\"></div>\n<div class=\"blank_28\"></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:00', '2015-03-08 21:28:00');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1093083', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t262/45/512250353/180387/6c1f33fc/53ec7f0aN4c8f95d0.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-1\" name=\"detail-tag-id-1\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">Metro UI 白领商务人士的最爱</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t214/11/540708531/205998/73417dc/53ec8075Nd5fa0dc9.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">易UI&mdash;&mdash;为视频控电影达人设计</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t217/215/531332392/180279/bb870591/53ec80c7N94f8232d.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">KUI&mdash;&mdash;给青春时尚范的你打造</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t247/137/497738312/171160/613a628d/53ec8106Nac69a4c7.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">超强十核&mdash;&mdash;改变从&ldquo;芯&rdquo;开始</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t217/65/530838940/194200/ec72ec86/53ec8149Ndf5176f7.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">内存提升&mdash;&mdash;更多更自由</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t244/48/498631004/154548/98e47c73/53ec8167N5406c404.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">H.265解码&mdash;&mdash;2K电视变4K</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t427/218/658943675/168709/2259566/5427608dNfb70cb21.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">安卓4.3&mdash;&mdash;为大屏幕打造</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t268/225/502909053/157675/ac665c85/53ec8230Nb2cec13c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">强大接口&mdash;&mdash;传输无障碍</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t226/46/522964649/102312/28a0675/53ec8257N570e8a9b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">双频线wifi&mdash;&mdash;接受无界限</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t262/365/521765155/128433/5817cf17/53ec8289N04c4e3a3.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">WPS技术&mdash;&mdash;一键自动联网</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t223/51/520932605/166408/65c76927/53ec8a0aN1145246e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">大拇指易控&mdash;&mdash;尽在掌握</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t253/306/505178249/412048/65a260b6/53ec8322N0d4ea8be.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">IPS硬屏&mdash;&mdash;源自LG公司G+级液晶屏\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t235/94/534393676/245092/6f7887b5/53ec9707N781cf386.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">第二代色轮技术&mdash;&mdash;大自然的窗口</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t232/266/511763190/173803/adb7e426/53ec839cN5beaf25f.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">Mali450&mdash;&mdash;显示我最行</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t226/299/514075989/212364/ba4b56fe/53ec83d2N159de27a.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">蓝牙4.0&mdash;&mdash;无线互动</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t247/344/493266780/168254/87438685/53ec83f5Nb105bf7f.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">多频互动&mdash;&mdash;互联无止境</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t241/350/515375517/149372/62104a70/53ec842aN6591d1fa.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">快看学堂&mdash;&mdash;您孩子的家庭教师</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t256/48/516581888/176324/6f3e8fd6/53ec848cNd694d309.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">游戏天地&mdash;&mdash;大屏嗨翻天</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t214/174/511556719/141449/596c10b7/53ec84d2N1fae1e94.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">一体机&mdash;&mdash;向机顶盒说再见</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t247/168/519298469/112849/7d449886/53ec84feN96386bd3.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">地面数字一体机&mdash;&mdash;着眼未来</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t229/355/529614424/119750/d6c95d0d/53ec87c7N511ec076.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t244/303/525421439/109575/d2b56e8a/53ec87f8Nb1148862.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t214/158/514386566/54482/8365a01a/53ec882eNdd20d329.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t256/282/500256651/49134/31a2dfc3/53ec8866N7f96e342.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-45\" name=\"detail-tag-id-45\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t214/24/526214100/441834/8efca1aa/53ec8978N045b8818.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:08', '2015-03-08 21:28:08');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1094449', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"> \n <div class=\"formwork\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_img\"> \n   <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t754/83/483039978/242076/94325ba7/54b63433N562f48f6.jpg\" /> \n   <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t730/77/494894981/284214/99f433dc/54b63435N6ba8c19e.jpg\" /> \n   <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t721/77/491111623/258080/e698ff6c/54b63437Nc4c4e48d.jpg\" /> \n   <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t454/273/1166956274/293242/a20610e4/54b63438Nc7251a94.jpg\" /> \n   <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t550/358/1331107811/107021/8701f7e9/54b63438N22e46bad.jpg\" /> \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork_bt\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"> \n   <span>温馨提示</span> \n   <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span> \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_img\"> \n   <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t145/70/941524323/166375/5154990/539fd819N7da5399b.png\" /> \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork_bt\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"> \n   <span>保养与维护</span> \n   <span class=\"s2\">Maintenance</span> \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">\n    使用USB播放时请注意： \n  </div> \n  <div class=\"formwork_text\">\n    1.USB接口并非万能的，它可以支持绝大多数的硬盘、U盘等，若出现不识别情况，不属于本机故障，与设备的驱动有关。 \n   <br />2、本机的USB接口提供5V电压，最大电流为500mA。某些存储设备由于采用的接口规范与标准USB协议有差异，因而会影响到电视中播放器的正确识别，这属于正常现象； \n   <br />3、随着设备的不同，存储容量的不同，电视中播放器读取信息的时间也是不一样的，有可能出现信息读取速度的暂时变慢，请注意这并非本机故障； \n   <br />4、请避免在文件读取过程中插拔USB设备，否则有可能损害您的系统文件。 \n   <br />5、本机采用多系统工作，相当于一个复杂的电脑系统，所以在文件读取播放时，由于USB设备的兼容性和稳定性的差异，可能会出现画面停止或功能不作用现象。请尝试关闭电视机使系统重新初始化，从而恢复正常工作。 \n   <br />6、当系统出现长时间不响应操作或出现“系统异常”提示信息时，当前系统可能暂时处于非正常运行状态。您可以重试当前操作或关机后重新启动，使系统恢复正常运行； \n   <br />7、若出现硬盘不识别情况，请尝试通过外接电源给硬盘供电或更换线长小于65厘米的标准USB2.0硬盘线。 \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">\n    使用智能网络电视请注意： \n  </div> \n  <div class=\"formwork_text\">\n    1、长虹的智能网络电视是和中国电信、中国联通、中国网通、中国铁通联手合作的，所以除以上几种网络外，其它网络能否使用请用前咨询您所用宽带公司。 \n   <br />2、因网络电视有些功能需要升级后才可以使用，请您购买智能网络电视后，拨打长虹服务电话4008-111-666，请专业人员为您的电视升级，让您享受更丰富的网络资源。 \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:39', '2015-03-08 21:27:39');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1094930', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"> \n <div class=\"formwork\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_img\"> \n   <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t67/72/4785826595/1010824/237cc463/537c9027Nc34d23a1.jpg\" /> \n   <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t73/179/4910573160/874289/629d67c3/537c9040N5387f45c.jpg\" /> \n   <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t52/10/4887410821/946764/a6166c7a/537c9059N262d146a.jpg\" /> \n   <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t190/8/63034166/707209/777eaf84/537c906dNc333562d.jpg\" /> \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-27\" name=\"detail-tag-id-27\" text=\"品牌介绍\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"> \n   <span>品牌介绍</span> \n   <span class=\"s2\">Brand Introduction</span> \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_img\"> \n   <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M02/04/19/rBEhU1NHs6gIAAAAAAIrmMXO7WMAALpgQJV0FAAAiuw285.jpg\" /> \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_text\">\n    2005年，一群年轻的中国人踏上了欧洲这片热土。他们就是为了把CHANGHONG（长虹）—这个中国市场叱咤风云的彩电品牌打入向来挑剔的欧洲市场。他们在捷克建立了工厂，在法国、德国先后成立了分公司,这群黄色皮肤的年轻人以他们无与伦比的热情，以国际化视野整合全球资源、创新技术和营销理念，基于消费者根本需求的最新技术潮流、外观工艺和功能应用，战略性地提出“简单.潮流(easy. trend)”为核心理念，充分运用欧洲顶尖设计理念、严苛的质量管控体系，打造出科技、主流、优质的经典产品，就像是利用澳大利亚和非洲的矿石在欧州领先的精工技术雕琢而成的Opal（欧泊）宝石——Oboni欧宝丽璀璨出世，为CHANGHONG（长虹）开启了欧洲之门。 \n   <br />2012年，这群年轻人回到中国，在吸收当前电视技术的基础上，大胆整合欧洲前沿的工业设计技术资源，借鉴国内互联网电视研发制造的经验，另创渠道将Oboni品牌打造成为年轻、时尚、具有互联网特质的电视新星。 \n   <br />同时，Oboni成功地汲取CHANGHONG（长虹）电视在技术研发、生产制造、品质监控及售后服务方面的超高水平和丰富经验，CHANGHONG（长虹）对Oboni电视产品在研发、设计、制造等方面进行全程监控，并提供系统的售前、售中、售后服务。 \n   <br /> Oboni电视以“简约品味生活”为品牌主张，在产品设计和功能开发上去繁就简，让电视回归本真。以品质为根本，重点突出两大特征：第一，科技时尚品，Oboni 以国际化视野，整合全球资源，首倡“科技时尚品”的品牌模式和消费理念，走“快速时尚(Fast Fashion）”的路线，以消费者需求为中心，致力提供最新技术潮流、最精致的外观工艺、最全面的功能应用，缔造出完美的互联网智能视听产品。第二，最优性价比，Oboni电视秉承“更贴近客户”的服务理念和效率最大化的营运原则，积极创新家电商业模式；最大化缩小运营成本，让所有消费者都能够轻松拥有超高性价比的电视佳品。 \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-30\" name=\"detail-tag-id-30\" text=\"温馨提示\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"> \n   <span>温馨提示</span> \n   <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span> \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_img\"> \n   <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t208/173/1899878696/197732/4c778b69/53be3bacNde1fdac2.jpg\" /> \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-32\" name=\"detail-tag-id-32\" text=\"保养与维护\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"> \n   <span>保养与维护</span> \n   <span class=\"s2\">Maintenance</span> \n  </div> \n </div> \n <div class=\"formwork\"> \n  <div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">\n    使用USB播放时请注意： \n  </div> \n  <div class=\"formwork_text\">\n    1.USB接口并非万能的，它可以支持绝大多数的硬盘、U盘等，若出现不识别情况，不属于本机故障，与设备的驱动有关。 \n   <br />2、本机的USB接口提供5V电压，最大电流为500mA。某些存储设备由于采用的接口规范与标准USB协议有差异，因而会影响到电视中播放器的正确识别，这属于正常现象； \n   <br />3、随着设备的不同，存储容量的不同，电视中播放器读取信息的时间也是不一样的，有可能出现信息读取速度的暂时变慢，请注意这并非本机故障； \n   <br />4、请避免在文件读取过程中插拔USB设备，否则有可能损害您的系统文件。 \n   <br />5、本机采用多系统工作，相当于一个复杂的电脑系统，所以在文件读取播放时，由于USB设备的兼容性和稳定性的差异，可能会出现画面停止或功能不作用现象。请尝试关闭电视机使系统重新初始化，从而恢复正常工作。 \n   <br />6、当系统出现长时间不响应操作或出现“系统异常”提示信息时，当前系统可能暂时处于非正常运行状态。您可以重试当前操作或关机后重新启动，使系统恢复正常运行； \n   <br />7、若出现硬盘不识别情况，请尝试通过外接电源给硬盘供电或更换线长小于65厘米的标准USB2.0硬盘线。 \n  </div> \n  <div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">\n    电视开机前说明： \n  </div> \n  <div class=\"formwork_text\">\n    为避免用户误操作，本机开机电源设置在电源线接头下方，电视接通电源后将此开关打开，电视才能进入开机状态。 \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:39', '2015-03-08 21:27:39');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1096006', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">BRAVIA ENGINE 3图像处理引擎/Motionflow XR 100/清晰图像解像/低频反射扬声器/屏幕镜像/智能连接/USB增强媒体播放/*产品图仅为展示，具体以实物为主</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t523/227/1350836609/853735/c08d1ed4/54cb6898N57d9d11a.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">画质/音质</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/1B/12/rBEQWVNYjb8IAAAAAAgrkCUOlukAAFZuwC3q_EACCuo781.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">贴心功能</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/1B/12/rBEQWFNYjeEIAAAAAAKzXmhbgR4AAFZvgEWZAMAArN2267.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-7\" name=\"detail-tag-id-7\" text=\"使用说明\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>使用说明</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Instructions</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">*1在中国地区50赫兹的电视信号情况下，Motionflow XR100技术是在相邻两帧原图像之间插入1帧黑帧实现的。电脑信号除外，当收到NTSC制式信号时(60赫兹)，Motionflow XR 100为Motionflow XR 120。根据信号不同，节目内容不同，实际效果有所差异。\n*2视频质量可能受环境干扰而有所降低。\n*3手机系统为Android 2.3及以上版本或IOS 5.0及以上版本。\n*4具体规格请参考USB媒体播放相关内容。\n*5具体连接方式请参考说明书。</div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:35', '2015-03-08 21:27:35');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1096007', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">迅锐图像处理引擎PRO/Motionflow XR 400/主动式3D*1/长导管扬声器/醇音技术+/触控娱乐*2/社交评论/一触功能*2/智能连接/*产品图仅为展示，具体以实物为主</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">*1 标配3D眼镜\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">*2 需另购触摸遥控器 RMF-SD005</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/02/0B/rBEhVFM9GloIAAAAABEFu7UP6XYAALLQAKYaosAEQXT353.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">画质/音质</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/1B/07/rBEQWVNYaNcIAAAAABBPrHwJT2QAAFVhALihSYAEE_E838.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">智能互联</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/1B/07/rBEQWVNYaQQIAAAAAAeDaMesBSUAAFViACqS54AB4OA463.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">网络娱乐</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/1B/07/rBEQWVNYaTEIAAAAAAg595gp8VUAAFVjACjhOcACDoP476.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">贴心功能</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g10/M00/1B/07/rBEQWVNYaVIIAAAAAAKWLPwxEoYAAFVjgP9D-oAApZE013.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-13\" name=\"detail-tag-id-13\" text=\"使用说明\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>使用说明</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Instructions</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">*1要实现3D观看需佩戴3D眼镜。\n*2在中国地区50Hz的电视信号情况下，Motionflow XR 400技术是在相邻两帧原图像之间插入3帧新画面实现的。电脑信号除外，当收到NTSC制式信号时（60Hz）， Motionflow XR 400为Motionflow XR 480。根据信号不同，节目内容不同，实际效果有所差异。\n*3需另购触摸遥控器(RMF-SD005)\n*4需另购触摸遥控器(RMF-SD005)，视频质量可能受环境干扰而有所降低。\n*5视频质量可能受环境干扰而有所降低。\n*6如需连接互联网，需要另配置互联网连接。\n*7用户需自行准备互联网连接。该功能可浏览文字图像内容，但根据情况，有些网页可能无法正确显示。网页中音频，视频和Flash等内容无法播放。\n*8要实现此功能，用户需另行购买外接设备，具体连接方式和注意事项，参考产品说明书。\n*9具体规格请参考USB媒体播放相关内容。\n*10具体连接方式请参考说明书。</div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:39', '2015-03-08 21:27:39');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1096008', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">迅锐图像处理引擎PRO/Motionflow XR 400/主动式3D*1/低频反射扬声器/醇音技术+/触控娱乐*2/社交评论/一触功能*2/智能连接/*产品图仅为展示，具体以实物为主</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">*1 标配3D眼镜\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">*2 需另购触摸遥控器 RMF-SD005</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M08/02/0C/rBEhUlM9GzoIAAAAABG9FOZayMIAALLRgAr9tQAEb0s511.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">画质/音质</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M0A/06/14/rBEhU1NPrYoIAAAAABNK73hTa-gAAMAtQNL7H4AE0sH089.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">智能互联</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M02/1D/19/rBEhV1NPrbUIAAAAAAfCtmlmem0AAMJMQHdqjAAB8LO585.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">网络娱乐</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M08/17/09/rBEhWVNPrdQIAAAAAAg-TJ-plr8AAMAOAD3KK4ACD5k750.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">贴心功能</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M02/1D/19/rBEhVlNPrfMIAAAAAAKhykDwDLwAAMJMQN08fIAAqHi614.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-13\" name=\"detail-tag-id-13\" text=\"使用说明\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>使用说明</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Instructions</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">*1要实现3D观看需佩戴3D眼镜。\n*2在中国地区50Hz的电视信号情况下，Motionflow XR 400技术是在相邻两帧原图像之间插入3帧新画面实现的。电脑信号除外，当收到NTSC制式信号时（60Hz）， Motionflow XR 400为Motionflow XR 480。根据信号不同，节目内容不同，实际效果有所差异。\n*2在中国地区50Hz的电视信号情况下，Motionflow XR 200技术是在相邻两帧原图像之间插入1帧新画面实现的。电脑信号除外，当收到NTSC制式信号时（60Hz），实现240Hz的刷新频率。根据信号不同，节目内容不同，实际效果有所差异。。\n*3需另购触摸遥控器(RMF-SD005)\n*4需另购触摸遥控器(RMF-SD005)，视频质量可能受环境干扰而有所降低。\n*5视频质量可能受环境干扰而有所降低。\n*6如需连接互联网，需要另配置互联网连接。\n*7用户需自行准备互联网连接。该功能可浏览文字图像内容，但根据情况，有些网页可能无法正确显示。网页中音频，视频和Flash等内容无法播放。\n*8要实现此功能，用户需另行购买外接设备，具体连接方式和注意事项，参考产品说明书。\n*9具体规格请参考USB媒体播放相关内容。\n*10具体连接方式请参考说明书。</div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:35', '2015-03-08 21:27:35');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1097000', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t343/199/1848232307/312074/5b3ec6cb/54446fd8N7960f31c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t490/14/1106761870/521431/d1fa0060/54ae2decN14c67285.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t607/57/1121924561/441867/44ff0779/54ae2e0fNbab70f47.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t544/127/1057992142/476711/810bff40/54aa55e2N11bff062.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t478/363/800227693/295288/baee4b1b/54ab8c95N59ec9e5f.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t145/9/675201668/51093/32e3122/53952ffcN90dfff21.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:54', '2015-03-08 21:27:54');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1097503', '<div class=\"content_tpl\">    <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">    <span>产品信息</span>    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>   </div>  </div> <div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">沟通，因品质更贴近</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">细节感受，沟通品质 从您上手飞利浦E系列的那一刻起，就能从细节上感受到它的品质。比如，软硬适中的按键触感；首通电话就能体验到的清晰沟通质量；还有第一次使用时，就能知道如何使用的简易界面。真实好品质，真实存在。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t250/23/1037089973/269046/4686b80b/53f598bfN1735c17f.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div>    <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-3\" name=\"detail-tag-id-3\" text=\"产品功能\">   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">    <span>产品功能</span>    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>   </div>  </div> <div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">沟通，时时在线 </div><div class=\"formwork_text\">飞利浦E系列优质的移动生活品质，旨在减少您不必要的麻烦。无论是新号、旧号，还是想拥有两张SIM卡，双卡双待让所有通讯录同时存在一部手机里，方便您在工作、生活随意穿梭。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/04/01/rBEhU1NFK0EIAAAAAAOZ_wYdlgoAALgEQC1O2MAA5oX854.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">移动生活，样样精彩</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">配合您的心情变化，带上耳机，轻轻点击播放， MP3和FM收音机都是您的最佳伴侣。E130更自带摄像头，随时抓拍，记下生活万变精彩。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M05/14/14/rBEhWVNFK7YIAAAAAAP3VR-Sq8QAALfHAEkicgAA_dt789.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/06/12/rBEQYVNFK8oIAAAAAAMfzWWgnE8AAEG8ANSNO4AAx_l704.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/06/12/rBEQYFNFK9AIAAAAAAPX9ou_ZJIAAEG8AO7rL0AA9gO853.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/06/12/rBEQYVNFK-MIAAAAAANo_QeksyYAAEG8QLGvz0AA2kV219.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">多彩，让您好看</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">飞利浦E系列机身尺寸的恰到好处，除了使用时的精致手感，还包含携带时的精巧方便。同时，配合您个性化的需求，更有多款颜色供您挑选。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/04/01/rBEhUlNFLBAIAAAAAAMcRydxMR8AALgEwEC5F8AAxxf148.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:30', '2015-03-08 21:28:30');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1097507', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t628/219/1101308445/227542/88ff9531/54d46e11Nda5239fa.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t241/52/1011201887/44930/4f1bcb45/53f46bc2N62256389.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t259/306/1058885587/108657/49da812b/53f59a76Nfdbeae5b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-5\" name=\"detail-tag-id-5\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">5.5英寸全视角高清大屏</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\"><br>精彩&ldquo;大&rdquo;有不同\n<br>大屏幕让您在玩游戏时，更能带来身如其境的体验。\n<br>观赏视频时，IPS全视角可以让大家都感受同样的视觉冲击。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/1D/1E/rBEhVVM-I5UIAAAAAADD9ycufdkAALVegKGU-sAAMQP842.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-8\" name=\"detail-tag-id-8\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">搭配500万像素摄像头，支持自动对焦，闪光灯，更大范围的显示照片。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M03/1D/1E/rBEhVVM-JJkIAAAAAACpyZmGkhMAALVhQEsHWgAAKnh728.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-11\" name=\"detail-tag-id-11\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/05/02/rBEQYVM-JL8IAAAAAACJfyoxvQgAAD0GwHGpi4AAImX463.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/05/02/rBEQYVM-JM4IAAAAAAB8LSiderkAAD0HQD_PTQAAHxF549.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-14\" name=\"detail-tag-id-14\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M04/13/04/rBEhWlM-JPQIAAAAAABnit6kUl8AALMgQLiMNMAAGei601.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">本机支持联通3G/2G、移动2G，不支持电信。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M07/1D/1E/rBEhVVM-JYoIAAAAAAD6Loy2sh0AALVigM6704AAPpG298.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-18\" name=\"detail-tag-id-18\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">极速四核1.3GHz处理器</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\"><br>搭载MTK6582 TURBO 四核1.3GHz处理器；\n<br>采用CORTEX-A7超低功耗架构；\n<br>3D游戏也可以流畅运行。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/05/02/rBEQYFM-J5YIAAAAAACu9fOVYCAAAD0NQFmm5kAAK8N470.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-21\" name=\"detail-tag-id-21\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M01/02/12/rBEhUlM-LBcIAAAAAADb9fo9LWAAALN8wN44FIAANwN164.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-23\" name=\"detail-tag-id-23\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M02/02/12/rBEhUlM-LDsIAAAAAAD1c7tZAG8AALN9gDt4xgAAPWL943.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-25\" name=\"detail-tag-id-25\" text=\"产品细节\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品细节</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t565/285/1358495909/130546/14705f44/54d46f07N173261fb.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/09/12/rBEQYVNRDIsIAAAAAABgPd343RgAAEsfQPkvgEAAGBV802.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t262/192/1099947322/135933/4225b577/53f5ae32Nd25470a3.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-29\" name=\"detail-tag-id-29\" text=\"尺寸信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>尺寸信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Size Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t217/289/1099543723/87132/b57d74c0/53f5ad65N3145ee9c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/05/02/rBEQYFM-LKgIAAAAAABJlckHSl0AAD0XQBKDecAAEmt768.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M02/02/12/rBEhU1M-LLQIAAAAAABKLQHfyjYAALN9wMVoE4AAEpF014.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:55', '2015-03-08 21:28:55');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1097547', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/09/00/rBEQYVNPRm0IAAAAAAtwrA4sVacAAElbwKga4oAC3DE725.png\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">5.0英寸全高清炫丽屏</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">三星I9508V配置有全高清炫丽屏，清晰画质不错漏任一处细节，基于真实色彩的饱满色泽呈现，让视觉观赏成为贴心享受。5.0英寸大屏，让视界洞开，宽阔疆土给您游刃有余的操作体验</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/06/0D/rBEhUlNPRpwIAAAAAAZTqx8oGZUAAL9yQBo8xEABlPD836.png\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">四核2.3GHz处理器</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">三星I9508V搭载四核2.3GHz处理器，支持多任务处理，页面加载毫无卡顿之感。2GB的大内存带来完美高速的启动体验，让您体验畅游无极限的快感。其内置的Android&trade;4.3智能操作系统，更是为您带来灵敏的触控体验和更简洁的用户界面，让您的各项操作都得心应手，翻转自如</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M06/1D/11/rBEhVlNPRsUIAAAAAAYwg6PWCtgAAMGPgCFb7kABjCb031.png\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">1300万像素+200万像素摄像头</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">三星I9508V具有优质的成像效果，1300万像素主摄像头以及200万像素的前置摄像头，让成像颇近专业效果，更有多种拍摄模式可选，留声拍照、双镜头拍摄、轨迹拍照，让您尽情领略拍摄之美，任时光驻留</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M08/17/01/rBEhWVNPRuEIAAAAAAnIlwX78M4AAL9RQDYjVEACciv757.png\" /></div>\n</div><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">留声拍照，可以&ldquo;听&rdquo;的照片</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">三星I9508V的留声拍照功能可记录照片环境的声音，让照片更为生动。若干年后，当您重温当时的画面时，那同时被记录下的声音会带您穿越时光与回忆相遇</p></td>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M01/17/01/rBEhWVNPRvQIAAAAAAMKmvGq1wQAAL9RwHhDy0AAwqy587.png\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g12/M00/09/00/rBEQYFNPRxkIAAAAAAIRkDDsH1MAAElcwDBtRQAAhGo478.png\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">轨迹拍照，捕捉每个动作细节</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">三星I9508V的轨迹拍照功能，可连续拍摄多张运动物体的照片，继而合成为一张动感十足的照片</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">双镜头拍摄，捕捉双面精彩</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">三星I9508V的双镜头拍摄功能让主摄像头和前置摄像头可同步捕捉记录美好瞬间，拒绝缺憾。双镜头摄录功能，则让您的朋友和家人可随时随地亲身体会您所经历的一切</p></td>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M05/1D/11/rBEhVlNPRy0IAAAAAAKzytIsVrYAAMGQQE6qWQAArPi877.png\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">支持中国移动TD-LTE 4G网络</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">三星I9508V支持中国移动TD-LTE 4G网络，让您畅享移动过程中的高速联网服务，不论是观看视频，还是传送文件，4G的高速数据传输服务都给您前所未有的高速快感体验</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M06/06/0D/rBEhU1NPR1gIAAAAAAU3_9sgAG0AAL9zwE4oq0ABTgX050.png\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">Group Play，同分享 共快乐</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">三星I9508V拥有强大的Group play功能，可支持多个设备间的Group Play共享。能够让您与多位好友共同欣赏同一首歌，还可组合成完整的音效系统，让您尽情享受音乐的魅力。此外，您还能与好友一起进行游戏竞赛，共同体验游戏快感</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M02/06/0D/rBEhVFNPR3IIAAAAAAZaQCXw0MgAAL90wDsJT8ABlpY320.png\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">故事相册，专属于你的照片故事</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">还在为整理海量照片而烦恼？三星I9508V故事相册让您的记忆不再凌乱。您可按时间表创建个性化的故事相册，并且有多种主题可供选择，还可将相册打印出来，与亲朋好友共同分享美好瞬间</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M00/17/01/rBEhWlNPR4sIAAAAAAQ1OFLFYccAAL9SwGHLaEABDVQ171.png\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:37', '2015-03-08 21:27:37');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1099153', '&nbsp;&nbsp; \n<br /> \n<center> \n <div> \n  <img name=\"detail-tag-id-8\" id=\"detail-tag-id-8\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t700/281/164230577/10472/23996063/548f9383N5ff498e5.jpg\" text=\"温馨提示\" />\n  <br /> \n  <span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:black;text-align: justify; text-transform: none; line-height: normal; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">由于本产品为热销产品，暂不支持京东卡和京东</span>\n  <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black;text-align: justify; text-transform: none; line-height: normal; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">E</span>\n  <span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:black;text-align: justify; text-transform: none; line-height: normal; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">卡支付</span> \n  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t556/319/1100656343/78198/b5af8faa/54ae9a6eNe2dbf0ef.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 549px; position: relative;\"> \n   <div style=\"top: 182px; width: 432px; height: 120px; text-align: left; right: 267px; color: rgb(113, 112, 113); line-height: 20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px; position: absolute;\">\n     搭载真8核处理器，28nm HPM工艺 \n    <br /> 搭载2GB RAM + 8G ROM，运行速度流畅 \n    <br /> 低功耗：相比同级CPU功耗 \n    <br /> WiFi下用浏览器低60% \n    <br /> 在线高清H.264视频播放低50% \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t448/237/1091386863/70213/b0c8d868/54ae9a8dN27a2f0a8.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 582px; position: relative;\"> \n   <div style=\"top: 430px; width: 432px; height: 120px; text-align: left; right: 260px; color: rgb(113, 112, 113); line-height: 20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px; position: absolute;\">\n     1300万像素堆栈式传感器 \n    <br /> 5片式精密镜片，蓝玻璃滤光，防指纹镀膜设计，F2.2大光圈，低光高画质 \n    <br /> \"智像\"专业图像处理引擎，高画质拍摄 \n    <br /> 留声拍照，让你的照片讲故事 \n    <br /> 自动识别拍摄场景、人脸检测、20连拍、边录边拍、HDR等功能，轻松变身拍摄大师 \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t577/148/847350234/169588/86801e50/54ae9aa4N6452f769.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 547px; position: relative;\"> \n   <div style=\"top: 280px; width: 310px; height: 120px; text-align: left; right: 27px; color: rgb(113, 112, 113); line-height: 20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px; position: absolute;\">\n     1.4μm大像素感光，22mm大广角镜头，取景可达88度极致成像效果 \n    <br /> \"炯炯拍\"自拍预览小窗专利，拍出神采奕奕的自己 \n    <br /> 全景自拍技术，视角更大，精彩更多 \n    <br /> 智能美颜、美肤、去痘、增白等，让你更美丽和帅气视频聊天更清晰 \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t544/113/1104447575/94187/4f2574ab/54ae9abfN57e58137.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 627px; position: relative;\"> \n   <div style=\"left: 62px; top: 108px; width: 430px; height: 120px; text-align: left; right: 27px; color: rgb(113, 112, 113); line-height: 20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px; position: absolute;\">\n     播放主流视频格式，支持H.265解码，轻松播放全高清视频 \n    <br /> 支持ClearMotion技术，实现60帧/秒智能倍帧播放，运动画面流畅、清晰 \n    <br /> 8核CPU + 高达600MHz主频4核GPU，堪比台式电脑 \n    <br /> 渲染游戏画面逼真，游戏运行极速流畅 \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t763/168/425521309/98506/d921e908/54ae9ad7N351089a1.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 605px; position: relative;\"> \n   <div style=\"top: 105px; width: 400px; height: 66px; text-align: left; right: 146px; color: rgb(113, 112, 113); line-height: 20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px; position: absolute;\">\n     5.5英寸HD高清全贴合IPS大屏，全视角，视界更宽广 \n    <br /> 无边界\"悬浮屏幕\"设计，10点触控，突破束缚，无拘无束 \n    <br /> 贴心手套模式，寒冷冬日戴手套照样自如触控 \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t580/74/1111415011/61706/58caa1df/54ae9b3cN2a0dbad3.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 547px; position: relative;\"> \n   <div style=\"top: 176px; width: 432px; height: 120px; text-align: left; right: 260px; color: rgb(113, 112, 113); line-height: 20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px; position: absolute;\">\n     3000mAh超大容量锂聚合物电池，更安全 \n    <br /> 寿命更长 \n    <br /> \"智电\"省电技术，续航提升30%以上 \n    <br /> 重度用户使用1.6天，中度用户2.7天，轻度 \n    <br /> 用户3.7天 \n    <br /> *按华为功耗模型测试，实际时间取决于多种因素 \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t655/247/1089233343/49713/9c570778/54ae9b7dNa197213e.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 549px; position: relative;\"> \n   <div style=\"left: 95px; top: 130px; width: 430px; height: 120px; text-align: left; right: 27px; color: rgb(113, 112, 113); line-height: 20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px; position: absolute;\">\n     双卡双待，支持移动3G（TD-SCDMA）与移动、联通2G（GSM）网络 \n    <br /> 支持盲插，大小卡槽，都支持3G和2G网络 \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t553/219/1074526955/67094/a8b92bb/54ae9b93Na42d93fb.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 552px; position: relative; background-image: url(http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t565/129/1441950260/142061/57ea040/54dda11cN0e85a32b.jpg);\"> \n   <div style=\"top: 145px; width: 432px; height: 120px; text-align: left; right: 270px; color: rgb(113, 112, 113); line-height: 20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px; position: absolute;\">\n     天线接收能力比标准高3dB以上 \n    <br /> 相当于用户信号强度加倍，在弱信号 \n    <br /> 的环境下通话更稳定清晰 \n    <br /> 多项专业设计保证良好的3G和WiFi \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t757/226/428171194/55071/8c0b2c54/54ae9bb7N310d6fd8.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 541px; position: relative;\"> \n   <div style=\"left: 67px; top: 200px; width: 432px; height: 120px; text-align: left; right: 270px; color: rgb(113, 112, 113); line-height: 20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px; position: absolute;\">\n     集影院式逼真环绕声、稳定音量和清晰语音于 \n    <br /> 一体的终极音频体验 \n    <br /> 双硅麦降噪，纤毫毕现的水晶音质 \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t532/112/1113720054/89292/9b3b6e57/54ae9bc9Nd903fe62.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 570px; position: relative;\"> \n   <div style=\"left: 67px; top: 140px; width: 432px; height: 120px; text-align: left; right: 270px; color: rgb(113, 112, 113); line-height: 20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px; position: absolute;\">\n     超过100项系统优化 \n    <br /> 更全面的保护：手机管家 更贴心的分享和共享：多屏互动、云照片、拖动应用图标分享等 \n    <br /> 更自我的展现：各种拍摄 \n   </div> \n  </div> \n  <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t553/251/1124445738/41353/1c45bcc3/54ae9c19N42c319f8.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 531px; position: relative;\"> \n   <div style=\"top: 112px; width: 400px; height: 66px; text-align: center; right: 175px; color: rgb(113, 112, 113); line-height: 20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 13px; position: absolute;\">\n     完整的测试体系，只为更稳定、更可靠、更安全、更健康 \n   </div> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</center>', '2015-03-08 21:27:37', '2015-03-08 21:27:37');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1099192', '<table cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td><iframe marginheight=\"0px\" marginwidth=\"0px\" src=\"http://cloud.letv.com/bcloud.html?uu=82abd5491f&vu=84e7ecd74d&width=750&height=422&auto_play=0\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"422px\" width=\"750px\"> </iframe></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/erpWareDetail/nfda67aH5UbSj0ZR.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"44\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWFFjjNkIAAAAAAEQDjaxouwAADsxgJVudEAARAm338.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/erpWareDetail/UIbzsEuXAelXrMQN.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"44\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWVFjjMsIAAAAAAGQ7doz-PkAADsxgFpEJsAAZEF383.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWVFjjMwIAAAAAAF-0A5kRgcAADsxgGOur0AAX7o326.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/erpWareDetail/nQTYErDwzk5CYU4X.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"44\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td height=\"559\" background=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWFFjjNAIAAAAAAES0aSO66kAADsxgEdoMkAARLp128.jpg\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">      <tbody>       <tr>        <td>         <div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 13px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 305px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 15px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          <strong>·</strong>在一段视频（5秒）录制前选定焦点，来完成生动的记录某对象的愿望          <br />          <strong>·</strong>一旦焦点选定，其他周围一切就变成静态的背景，使得这段视频极具特色和艺术性          <br />         </div></td>       </tr>      </tbody>     </table></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td height=\"296\" background=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWFFjjOIIAAAAAAC1WDl6xwwAADsxgNkBMsAALVw574.jpg\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">      <tbody>       <tr>        <td>         <div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 15px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 20px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          创新非接触式操作方式         </div></td>       </tr>       <tr>        <td><div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 480px; PADDING-LEFT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 13px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 15px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 5px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          <strong>·</strong>手指只需接近手机屏幕，无需触碰，即可感应手指所指位置，展开文件夹预览、全文显示、快速拨号等功能。（即便戴手套也能实现）。         </div></td>       </tr>      </tbody>     </table></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td height=\"268\" background=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWFFjjOMIAAAAAAB99k2F1ZkAADsxgOj5zkAAH4O969.jpg\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">      <tbody>       <tr>        <td>         <div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 15px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 20px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          创新非接触式操作方式         </div></td>       </tr>       <tr>        <td><div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 480px; PADDING-LEFT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 13px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 55px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 5px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          <strong>·</strong>手掌无需接触屏幕，只需面对手机凌空上下或左右挥动，即可进行如接听电话、页面滚动、翻页等操作。          <br />         </div></td>       </tr>      </tbody>     </table></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td height=\"558\" background=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWVFjjN4IAAAAAAEM0TQsZJ4AADsxgPHmIMAAQzp117.jpg\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">      <tbody>       <tr>        <td>         <div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 15px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 5px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 20px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          智能关注：响应您的一举一动         </div></td>       </tr>       <tr>        <td><div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 13px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 320px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 5px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          <strong>·</strong>当你阅读长文章或者浏览长网页时，只要面对手机，稍稍上下倾斜手机角度，即可自动向上或者向下滚动屏幕，方便进行阅读。          <br />         </div></td>       </tr>      </tbody>     </table></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td height=\"560\" background=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWVFjjN8IAAAAAAEAI1YkvoMAADsxgPdliMAAQA7358.jpg\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">      <tbody>       <tr>        <td>         <div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 15px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 5px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 20px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          智能关注：响应您的一举一动         </div></td>       </tr>       <tr>        <td><div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 13px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 335px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 5px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          <strong>·</strong>当你面对手机，观看视频时，如果暂时转头看别处，手机就会自动暂停播放，直至你将头转回，才继续进行播放。          <br />         </div></td>       </tr>      </tbody>     </table></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/erpWareDetail/xHABUGrQhf9Xi3EX.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"44\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td height=\"554\" background=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWVFjjOEIAAAAAAFKm8RQ8p0AADsxgP7YvsAAUqz933.jpg\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">      <tbody>       <tr>        <td width=\"376\">         <div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 5px; FONT-SIZE: 24px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 5px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 1px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'; color: #FFFFFF;\">          工作         </div>         <div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 5px; FONT-SIZE: 13px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 150px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 5px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'; color: #FFFFFF;\">          <strong>·</strong>Air View/ Air Gesture 浮窗预览/手势感应: 打开相册，使用浮窗预览浏览照片，然后向用户演示如何使用手势操作快速浏览照片，请用户进行尝试。          <br />          <strong>·</strong>Samsung Smart Scroll/ Samsung Smart Pause智能滚屏/智能暂停: 智能滚屏: 从网站上打开一篇文章，让用户体验智能滚动屏幕          <br /> 智能暂停：视频播放过程中暂停和继续，无需触摸屏幕，让用户进行体验          <br />          <strong>·</strong>S Voice? Drive : 让用户体验S Voice语音助手功能，          <br /> 建议他们尝试体验天气预报或者发短信等          <br />         </div></td>        <td width=\"374\"><div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 5px; FONT-SIZE: 24px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 5px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 5px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          关怀         </div>         <div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 5px; FONT-SIZE: 13px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 234px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 5px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          <strong>·</strong>S Health: 打开S Health软件，让用户探索体验，同时进行讲解，并让他们体验配件如何辅助使用。例如，通过HRM心率监视器监测运动过程中心跳变化。          <br />          <strong>·</strong>Samsung Adapt Display: 打开一本电子书，向用户演示自动设置显示模式如何通过背景变化，提升易读性。          <br />          <br />         </div></td>       </tr>      </tbody>     </table></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td height=\"559\" background=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/12/1E/rBEQWVFjjOwIAAAAAAEPFAC5HQkAADsxwE6pa8AAQ8s769.jpg\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">      <tbody>       <tr>        <td>         <div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; PADDING-LEFT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 13px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 220px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-TOP: 5px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'\">          <p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">·</span>紧凑型人体工学设计(使用方便)<br /> <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">·</span>每个耳机都有两个扬声器 (低音& 高频扬声器)<br /> <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">·</span>高分辨动态厚重低音& 清晰高音<br /> <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">·</span>全频段平衡音效<br /> <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">·</span>纤细扁平耳机线(摆脱耳机线纠缠的困扰)<br /> </p>          <br />         </div></td>       </tr>      </tbody>     </table></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table>', '2015-03-08 21:28:01', '2015-03-08 21:28:01');
