http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t196/355/1536196969/216959/2f92c0c9/53b2679bNf26084be.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t733/184/6479703/1893071/5a177e9d/547c2fd1Nc15b4370.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t178/109/1559369588/154896/b8da12e5/53b267b1N17758d67.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t151/17/1559070856/152045/b95417c8/53b267bcNe6cf0d34.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t598/182/977631575/1573964/2dab91d7/549d2c7aN3b62087c.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t178/237/1582766882/206580/8848daed/53b267daNb2bfe04d.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:49', '2015-03-08 21:27:49');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1122232', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t649/323/1387007419/310549/da7ff0ec/54d46756Nf0c5448c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">X1560是X130的第二代升级版产品性能更加优于X130</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\"><br>充电无须设置，即插即充\n<br>原X130是Mini usb+标准USB接口，而X1560是Micro usb+标准USB ，接口更加通用\n<br>待机时长更久，配备2900毫安大电池\n<br>机器本身充电和对外充电都是1A,充电时间更快速\n<br>屏幕更大，从2.0扩大为2.4寸\n<br>键盘金属工艺，彰显机身质感，大键盘便于操作\n<br>更大一倍机身内存（128Mb+64mb ），可以存储短信200条、电话本1000个</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-3\" name=\"detail-tag-id-3\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M04/00/14/rBEhU1NnKZkIAAAAAAKB8ZmEjV4AAM1eQFRv0gAAoIJ941.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">飞利浦待机超长的手机可达100天之久</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\"><br>2900毫安电池容量\n<br>\n<br>理论待机：待机时间最长可达100天\n<br>\n<br>理论通话：通话时间最长可达40小时\n<br></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-6\" name=\"detail-tag-id-6\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M04/00/14/rBEhVFNnKaYIAAAAAAIAyZZTx9wAAM1egNlovAAAgDh201.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">双 SIM 卡，2 组联系人列表</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">使用 2 个不同的手机号码，分开不同联系人，让您的生活更有条理。有双 SIM 卡，不必随身携带 2 个手机。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-9\" name=\"detail-tag-id-9\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M01/05/0E/rBEhV1HksqkIAAAAAAZdRXcxoEkAABELgMbdWAABl1d420.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">X1560沙漠中的绿洲</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">飞利浦X1560手机，可随时随地为其他智能手机、数码产品补充电量，瞬间转化为移动电源。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-12\" name=\"detail-tag-id-12\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M06/00/14/rBEhU1NnKcQIAAAAAAMATWNoCF0AAM1fwHRnpwAAwBl727.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">通过扬声器大声播放收音机中的音乐</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">使用飞利浦手机的内置天线和扬声器功能，您不必始终插上耳机收听收音机。现在您可以根据心情或环境，通过扬声器大声播放或插上耳机欣赏您喜爱的电台节目。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-15\" name=\"detail-tag-id-15\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M06/00/14/rBEhUlNnKc4IAAAAAAGYv2khKLYAAM1gAJzYFQAAZjX876.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:44', '2015-03-08 21:28:44');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1122233', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t538/188/1390648623/176035/bc3a6610/54d47919N385bb969.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">设计由内而外</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\"><br>沿袭飞利浦卓越工艺设计传统，唯美简约外形与人体工程学完美结合，设计由内而外。 \n<br>基于人体工程学原理，机身边沿处以精准63度圆弧设计，让机身与手贴合，即使长时间握着也能手感舒适。 \n<br>安卓4.2 轻灵而愉悦的视觉体验，操控由内而外的精彩。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-3\" name=\"detail-tag-id-3\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1195/327/49340677/247370/23d87f21/54f3e555Nb046c845.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">4 英寸 WVGA TFT 电容式触摸屏</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">轻触或轻击便可享受鲜活色彩和明艳图像。手机具有高度灵敏的 4 英寸 WVGA TFT 电容式触摸屏，让您体验空前流畅的导航。无论您是在快速浏览文件图像或互联网网站，还是在菜单和应用程序间自由穿梭，该触摸屏都能让您赏心悦目。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t907/253/45223717/230993/bd82d19a/54f3e589Nabc114d2.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">500 万像素相机</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">得益于手机的 500 万像素摄像头，尽情欣赏清晰逼真的图像，享受每一个美好瞬间。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1138/43/48466397/33682/54c1e40e/54f3e5c9N1c1c423a.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">飞利浦手机省电技术 续航提升30%以上</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">1400mAh锂离子聚合物电池，更安全，寿命更长 。飞利浦手机省电技术，优化软件设置与用户界面，减少不必要的耗电和内存占用，让续航提升30%以上 。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-10\" name=\"detail-tag-id-10\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1237/53/46023762/233501/b1686297/54f3e61bNdf361019.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">双卡双待 玩转工作生活</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\"><br>支持GSM/WCDMA网络，让你24小时随享3G网络。 \n<br>双SIM卡设计，让工作、生活都能畅快体验。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t625/339/1487944177/249205/abed6f1b/54f3e679Nb055fb4c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1195/39/44908851/283456/94a29a7c/54f3e693N7b6613ea.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">Android 4.2</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">您的飞利浦手机现在运行 Android 操作系统，成为具有可定制的、集合各种智能应用程序和功能的手机平台 - 掌上电脑、游戏机和电话自此合为一体。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t685/269/1458367131/224983/e608835e/54f3e6d2Ncf7402d5.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">1GHz 双核处理器带来流畅的手机性能体验</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">得益于 1GHz 双核处理器，您现在即可在飞利浦手机上体验更为流畅的智能手机性能。有了此功能，所有手机应用程序间的多任务操作都将轻而易举。不但如此，您还可以获得极速的网页浏览、出色的画质以及顺畅的游戏视觉体验。</div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:33:18', '2015-03-08 21:33:18');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1123356', ' <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"750\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"154\"><a href=\"http://sale.jd.com/act/rpKslAwU7uN2.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M00/1D/1D/rBEhUlMntW4IAAAAAADB6emP1osAAKT1gFbAwwAAMIB279.jpg\" width=\"750\" height=\"150\" /></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"750\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M09/0C/10/rBEhWlJFAS8IAAAAAABmm3i9iZcAADlFAHv5zMAAGaz896.jpg\" width=\"750\" height=\"383\" /></td></tr></tbody></table><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" width=\"750\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td><iframe height=\"422\" marginheight=\"0\" src=\"http://yuntv.letv.com/bcloud.html?uu=82abd5491f&vu=aa84ca6350&width=750&height=422&auto_play=0\" frameborder=\"0\" width=\"750\" marginwidth=\"0\"></iframe></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M01/0B/05/rBEhWlI6ynsIAAAAAACSp1x6NQgAADUJAGp7zMAAJK_605.jpg\" /></span><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 23px; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 14px\" class=\"formwork_img\"></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 23px; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 14px\" class=\"formwork_img\"><table class=\"                                                                                                                                     \" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"750\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><div style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM: 5px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-LEFT: 7px; PADDING-RIGHT: 5px; FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-TOP: 5px\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\">尊敬的顾客：<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 在选购手机的同时可参加京东商城与中国电信合作推出购机送话费活动（新入网用户）：该手机属于电信定制机，3G网络制式为电信CDMA2000，您只需点击“购机入网送话费”按钮加入购物车选择套餐、赠费档位、号码后即可享受当地电信的高额话费赠送，订单提交后京东相关人员会为您办理入网，手机和号卡一同配送，具体赠费明细可加入购物车后查看：</span></div></td></tr><tr><td align=\"middle\">&nbsp;</td><td align=\"middle\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t418/18/410755153/9695/8779e608/541bd97eN0fa493a2.png\" alt=\"\" /></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 23px; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 14px\" class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><br /></span><br /><div style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\">&nbsp;注：选择购机入网送话费的方式购买合约，话费为赠品不开具发票</span></div></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 23px; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 14px\" class=\"formwork_img\"><div style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#ffffff;\"></span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\">艺术设计</span></div><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"formwork_text\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">匠心独具的设计</span><br />流畅简洁的机身线条，纹理触感设计的后盖，彰显经典与永恒韵味的侧面齿状花纹，外加精心的拼接处理，凝铸为匠心独具的GALAXY Note3。简约而不简单的制作工艺，带来卓尔不群的外形和手感。5.7英寸全高清炫丽大屏，让精彩内容一览无余；分辨率高达1920×1080，屏幕更大的同时显示更细腻更自然，让您的视界更宽广、视觉体验更丰富。GALAXY Note3，让功能和艺术设计完美平衡，完美绽放。</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M02/0B/05/rBEhWFI6yvoIAAAAAACeQ3KdpkcAADUJQA5rpcAAJ5b541.jpg\" /></span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\">S Pen浮窗指令</span></div><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"formwork_text\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">魔法生活的开始<br /></span>GALAXY Note3的S Pen浮窗指令宛如神奇的魔法，助您瞬间完成各项指令。您只需将S Pen悬浮于手机屏幕上方的任何位置，轻点笔杆的按钮，屏幕上就会自动弹出S Pen浮窗指令的5个常用的强大功能：智能备忘录、随剪随贴、截屏编写、S搜索和随笔窗口。S Pen浮窗指令可随时开启，省去了反复切换屏幕的麻烦，让您的任务处理更加轻松便捷。</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M02/0B/05/rBEhWVI6y3IIAAAAAABl3s9T4BUAADUJQHnXgUAAGX2845.jpg\" /></span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\">智能备忘录</span></div><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"formwork_text\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">下笔即来的便捷</span><br />GALAXY Note3的智能备忘录，能将您的笔迹直接连至7个常用的功能指令：通话、保存联系人信息、发信息、发邮件、搜索网页、地图搜索位置和添加任务。只需手写便条，即可为您执行相应指令，或是将您的手写信息转化为格式化的内容。当您记下某个目的地的名称，就能立即进入地图并找到相应位置；当您手写一个电话号码，就能直接转入通话或存储功能。</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M02/0B/05/rBEhWlI6y7IIAAAAAACbq0NfkSoAADUJQK-E48AAJvD721.jpg\" /></span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\">随剪随贴</span></div><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"formwork_text\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">随手创建资料库</span><br />GALAXY Note3的随剪随贴，让您轻松收集和组织各种不同种类的内容。无论是网页还是视频内容，它都能灵巧准确地为您剪出所需，并轻松创建专属于您的个性化资料库。任何您需要的信息，只需轻按S Pen按钮，选择随剪随贴功能，用笔圈出内容并进行编辑，然后保存到剪贴库即可。同时您也可以自行创建文件夹，依照主题分门别类。</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M02/0B/05/rBEhWVI6y94IAAAAAACXApdg8B8AADUJQN__LsAAJca478.jpg\" /></span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\">S搜索</span></div><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"formwork_text\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">随时搜索轻松找到</span><br />GALAXY Note3的S搜索，可随时根据您的指令进行最大范围的搜索，找出手机中的各种内容。只需点击S Pen 的按钮, 您可从任何界面直接到达S搜索功能，进行个人内容的导航和搜索。无论是相册主题还是聊天内容，甚至是您手写的符号，都能为您轻松找到。</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M05/0C/0C/rBEhUlI6zAEIAAAAAACb1YxBZBYAADT7QKn8AQAAJvt241.jpg\" /></span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\">随笔窗口</span></div><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"formwork_text\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">随心绘制开启窗口</span><br />想要快速启动常用应用程序，又不想来回切换窗口？GALAXY Note3令人惊叹的随笔窗口功能，助您轻松快捷地开启新的应用。您只需在屏幕的任意位置画一个任意尺寸大小的窗口，即可选择您想要开启新的应用。现在，您可以在写邮件时开启计算器功能，或是在浏览网页时拨打电话，在同一屏幕中尽享多种精彩。</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M06/0C/0C/rBEhU1I6zC0IAAAAAACRhNKJUU4AADT7gA7WqQAAJGc509.jpg\" /></span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\">多窗口多任务</span></div><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"formwork_text\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">运用自如游刃有余</span><br />GALAXY Note3的超强性能和超大屏幕，为您轻松实现多任务。您可以同时处理两项任务，或是开启两个不同的应用，还可以直接将文本、图片等内容拖拽到另一个窗口。无需关闭窗口或打开新页面，您就能在应用程序之间进行无缝切换。在浏览网页的同时，您可以发送短信给朋友，您甚至可以在两个窗口上运行同一个应用程序(如：网络浏览器、ChatON)。让您跟上快节奏的生活步伐，成为一名游刃有余的工作专家。</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g15/M03/0B/05/rBEhWVI6zFkIAAAAAACBGeFiHzAAADUJgB7GdUAAIEx451.jpg\" /></span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\">我的资讯中心</span></div><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"formwork_text\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">海量资讯时尚阅读</span><br />GALAXY Note3的超大屏幕让您在浏览画面时，获得翻看时尚杂志般的新鲜视觉体验，满足您的需求。个性化的界面，让所有菜单一目了然。独特的界面设计，让您不仅可以轻松浏览新闻、社交媒体内容，还能畅享一键开启最常用功能的便捷。</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g14/M02/11/05/rBEhVlI6zH4IAAAAAACXayBgbMoAADWgwAvCMQAAJeD005.jpg\" /></span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\">全新S Note</span></div><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"formwork_text\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">绘写精彩如您所愿</span><br />带上它，便拥有了一款性能完备的全新笔记本。S Note不仅具有笔记本式的简单界面，同时还提供丰富的制作模板。它能将快速潦草的笔记和素描编辑得非常美观，也能将您画出的形状和手写内容即时变成完美的图形和数字文本。全新升级的S Note如您所愿，打造精彩生活。</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g14/M02/11/05/rBEhV1I6zKsIAAAAAAB1ZSx4iw0AADWgwF7wYcAAHV9919.jpg\" /></span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:32px;\">随笔输入</span></div><div class=\"formwork_titleleft\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size:24px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"formwork_text\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">手写替代键盘输入</span><br />GALAXY Note3 具备进一步升级更加先进的手写识别技术，打破了之前只有<br />S Note功能才可进行手写识别的限制。现在，无论是日历、闹钟，还是发短信、拨打电话都可通过手写识别实现。</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M06/0C/0C/rBEhUlI6zNkIAAAAAACB5vkZcP0AADT7gGd19sAAIH-086.jpg\" /></span></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:42', '2015-03-08 21:27:42');
