" width=\"750\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t193/59/3225647887/64663/866e6c17/53e2137dNc664fc12.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"92\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>  </tbody></table><div class=\"content_tpl\">  <div class=\"formwork_bt\">   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">    <span>产品展示</span>    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_img\">    <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M06/13/16/rBEhVVMQQykIAAAAAABpT2gxwlQAAJV1ABytUcAAGln118.jpg\" /></p>   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork_bt\">   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">    <span>产品信息</span>    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">    采用高通MSM8628四核1.6GHz处理器   </div>   <div class=\"formwork_text\">    高通骁龙400四核1.6GHz处理器MSM8628采用Cortex-A7架构，在超低功耗的同时拥有强劲处理性能。    <br />搭载Adreno 305图形处理器，流畅播放高清视频，轻松运行最新大型3D游戏。   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_img\">    <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M03/13/16/rBEhVlMQQ7kIAAAAAABd9CxfsMsAAJV1wB3vigAAF4M024.jpg\" />   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">    全新升级8GB高速闪存   </div>   <div class=\"formwork_text\">    可存储更多应用、音乐、视频及照片   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_img\">    <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M00/18/0D/rBEhU1MQQ_oIAAAAAABUilTsmxMAAJPLQLI3GUAAFSi401.jpg\" />   </div>  </div>  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">   <tbody>    <tr>     <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">千元屏幕神器</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">夏普/友达 (苹果供应商) 4.7英寸IPS视网膜屏<br />分辨率高达1280 x 720，显示精度高达312PPI。<br />可显示1600万种颜色的IPS屏，拥有更广的可视角度，和极佳的色彩与反应速度。</p></td>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M09/13/16/rBEhVVMQRH0IAAAAAACK03-vCZoAAJV2wIrfrIAAIrr269.jpg\" /></td>    </tr>   </tbody>  </table>  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">   <tbody>    <tr>     <td>&nbsp;</td>     <td>&nbsp;</td>    </tr>   </tbody>  </table>  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\">   <tbody>    <tr>     <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">三星/OV 背照式 800万像素相机</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">F2.2大光圈 28mm广角镜头支持1080P高清视频录制<br />相机传感器感光面积为1.4?m，显著提升低光下的拍摄效果，28mm大广角，F2.2大光圈还能拍摄出柔美的虚化背景。内含五组滤光镜片，成像效果更加真实！前置160万像素相机，支持720P准高清摄像。</p></td>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/18/0E/rBEhUlMQRkoIAAAAAABlDLnX_ZUAAJPPQCXTkoAAGUk101.jpg\" /></td>    </tr>   </tbody>  </table>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">    千元音乐神器   </div>   <div class=\"formwork_text\">    米音HiFi系统，源自瑞典专业Dirac声学系统    <br />米音所采用的瑞典 Dirac 技术，广泛用于宝马、宾利、劳斯莱斯汽车音响系统。    <br />它根据不同耳机的声学特点深度定制优化，声音还原更真实、更有临场感。   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_img\">    <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M01/08/1F/rBEhWFMQRrcIAAAAAAC6d7gBFIMAAJNewJtyykAALqP604.jpg\" />   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">    流畅运行MIUIV5   </div>   <div class=\"formwork_text\">    基于Android 4.3深度定制，全球3000万用户共同选择！    <br />在全球，MIUI系统拥有3000万用户！贴心的电话短信功能，稳定省电的系统内核，千变万化的主题和百变桌面。完美支持原生 Android 应用和游戏，每周升级。   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_img\">    <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/18/0E/rBEhU1MQRwcIAAAAAAIEGQE4HMMAAJPRALenMAAAgQx141.jpg\" />   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">    更多功能   </div>   <div class=\"formwork_text\">    为发烧而生，就是让千元机也具备更多可玩功能。   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_img\">    <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M00/18/0E/rBEhU1MQR3EIAAAAAACqrLv6MbYAAJPRQEWlXwAAKrE220.jpg\" />   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">    严格工艺 小米标准   </div>   <div class=\"formwork_text\">    10万次按键敲击测试、7500次微跌测试，这就是小米质量标准   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_img\">    <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M01/13/17/rBEhV1MQSAUIAAAAAADSFkxQzBMAAJV9QKYeBQAANIu398.jpg\" />   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">    多彩后盖   </div>   <div class=\"formwork_text\">    更多好看的多彩及百变后盖即将推出，可更换式后盖让手机更加个性！   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_img\">    <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M02/08/1F/rBEhWFMQSFQIAAAAAAEPi7Ba2KMAAJNhgNlYQIAAQ-j295.jpg\" />   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">    高强度环保包装   </div>   <div class=\"formwork_text\">    正面可承受300斤冲压，使用可回收材质制成。   </div>  </div>  <div class=\"formwork\">   <div class=\"formwork_img\">    <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M07/13/17/rBEhVVMQSIIIAAAAAADHLBL_1hkAAJV9wCwxrsAAMdE592.jpg\" />    <br />    <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g17/M00/00/07/rBEbSFNprwYIAAAAAAAZHgfe-xAAAADCgGPT6YAABk2682.gif\" alt=\"\" />    <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g16/M00/00/07/rBEbRVNprxIIAAAAAAC9Dn6vmRcAAADCwHz37QAAL0m998.jpg\" alt=\"\" />    <br />   </div>  </div></div></div><div class=_abcde_B_ERPFUSE_9303142 id=\"abdis_B\">					<span id=\"_xhe_cursor\"></span> \r\n<span id=\"_xhe_temp\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\"></span> \r\n<table style=\"background-image:url(http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t259/119/1014363886/174576/1dbd5495/53f48a17N9c1d4823.jpg)\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\"> \r\n <tbody> \r\n  <tr> \r\n   <td align=\"center\" height=\"763\"> \r\n    <div style=\"font-size:20px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; padding-left: 40px; padding-bottom: 450px; color: #FFF; line-height: 2em;\">\r\n      联通版采用高通骁龙400 四核1.6GHz处理器 \r\n     