div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">震撼双电池，电源超级持久</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">长待机：超过1026小时(42天）\n长通话：通话时间超过23小时\n长上网：上网时间超过16小时\n具备快速充电功能</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-10\" name=\"detail-tag-id-10\" text=\"产品细节\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品细节</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t193/275/1491624373/425310/7653fc99/53b129bbN51b7ddf1.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">双3G跨越中国移动和中国联通双网</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">中国联通WCDMA 900/2100MHzINSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1163156', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M0A/18/07/rBEhUlMP6XYIAAAAAACkku7BWmgAAJM1QHL9PkAAKSq151.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-1\" name=\"detail-tag-id-1\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M02/13/10/rBEhVVMP6b8IAAAAAACVBxNC3nMAAJTfgGDXUEAAJUf388.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">5英寸大屏</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">5英寸大屏配搭纤薄轻巧机身，让您轻松随声携带，极窄边框设计，单手亦可舒适掌握，强大的文字和图片显示，为您带来无比震撼的视觉冲击享受</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">500万像素主摄像头</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">支持全景拍摄，支持人像，风景，夜景等多种拍摄模式，多种测光模式，极大增强了拍摄体验，让万千世界尽收眼底</p></td>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M03/13/10/rBEhVlMP6gcIAAAAAABtAeIm6G0AAJTfwLcDAcAAG0Z946.jpg\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M08/13/10/rBEhV1MP6owIAAAAAABTrbCHfwcAAJTggNLPwYAAFPF022.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">双卡双待  +   双GPS搜索</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">双卡双待保持沟通无限畅快，双GPS系统搜星，快捷迅速定位，即可搜星，大大提高搜星速度</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-5\" name=\"detail-tag-id-5\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/13/10/rBEhVVMP6r4IAAAAAABeby0GlPEAAJThAJDFA8AAF6H397.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">四核处理器  畅快体验！</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">W96\n采用博通BCM23550四核芯片，博通Cortex-A7 架构的四核处理器BCM23550，主频可达1.2GHz，支持HSPA+，最高支持21Mbps的下载和5Mbps的上传速度\n</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">安卓4.2系统</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">预装WPS Office办公软件、有道词典、搜狐视频、搜狐新闻、手机邮箱、装机必备、百度浏览器、梦坊国际、天语商城以及沃商店、手机营业厅等联通专用应用</p></td>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M03/18/08/rBEhU1MP7J4IAAAAAAAn_wq7k4sAAJM5ABS660AACgX672.jpg\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M08/18/08/rBEhVFMP7WUIAAAAAAAq4gACJCAAAJM6QDJTQUAACr6181.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">极速网络，尽情驰骋！</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">无时无刻都能感觉到连接Wifi的感觉。\n极速的下载体验，尽在支持联通21M网络的天语W96\n理论下载速度可以达到2.7MB/S，提供媲美固定宽带的网速体验</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">500万像素主摄像头+30万像素前置摄像头</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">支持全景拍摄\nAndroid4.2更新触摸选择\n风景、人像、夜景、海滩等多种模式\n定时器、感光度、多种测光模式\n极大的增强了拍摄体验</p></td>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M03/08/19/rBEhWVMP7twIAAAAAAAyLBfn-EMAAJLMANmlYIAADJE535.jpg\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M0A/13/10/rBEhV1MP7c0IAAAAAACHVPvfDtsAAJTlADVL18AAIds682.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-11\" name=\"detail-tag-id-11\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M0A/18/08/rBEhU1MP7jAIAAAAAADR848b4KwAAJM7QKmNssAANIL960.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:29:27', '2015-03-08 21:29:27');
