\', \'微软雅黑\', \'黑体\'; text-align: right; padding-right: 50px;\">超强防水，800万自动对焦AF+200<br />      万前置摄像头和FF，让画面唯美流<br />      动，数字防抖，侧键快捷自定义快<br />    门，游刃自如的实现水下潜拍。</div></td>  </tr>      <tr><td><img alt=\"云弧手机\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t304/222/64001860/101649/2b387673/5400790aN672f0458.jpg\" height=\"312\" width=\"750\" /></td></tr>      <tr>    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"background-image: url(http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t343/306/63855431/82557/987b9162/54007917N7a23e4e0.jpg); height: 552px\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 26px; color: #333333; padding-top: 120px; font-family: \'宋体\', \'微软雅黑\', \'黑体\'; padding-left: 408px;\">后置800W+前置200W高清摄像头，支持自动对焦、<br />      数字防抖，更有全景拍摄、多视角拍摄、笑脸自动检<br />      测等功能助力，户外美景跃然屏幕。</div>      <div style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 26px; color: #333333; padding-top: 179px; font-family: \'宋体\', \'微软雅黑\', \'黑体\'; padding-left: 43px;\">专门设计侧键快捷自定义快门，使水中操作更便<br />          捷，水下拍摄游刃有余。</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"background-image: url(http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t211/72/1899502152/115034/80c4c2f8/54007924Na72dd89a.jpg); height: 366px\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: #333333; padding-top: 113px; font-family: \'宋体\', \'微软雅黑\', \'黑体\'; padding-left: 378px;\">高效四核处理器，突破传统户外四防手机单双核<br />        的壁垒，极致体验，一触即达，有你掌握！</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td><img alt=\"云弧手机\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t343/341/71604324/94667/482d0836/54007932N6419e5fc.jpg\" height=\"308\" width=\"750\" /></td>      </tr>  <tr>    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"background-image: url(http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t235/6/1915770163/126111/dda077a4/54007943N4c2670c5.jpg); height: 597px\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: #333333; padding-top: 113px; font-family: \'宋体\', \'微软雅黑\', \'黑体\'; padding-left: 33px;\">机身采用军工品质设计，高品质原材料航天<br />      级钢化玻璃铸造，全素材电火花纹机体，具有<br />        MIL-STD-810G美国军标抗冲击测试认证，进口<br />        GE材料双色双料注塑工艺，有效防刮，且不变<br />        型，适合在户外恶劣环境中使用的超强悍智能<br />        装备。</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"background-image: url(http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t283/28/67370442/61016/ccb10a9d/54007956Nc417acee.jpg); height: 272px\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: #FFFFFF; padding-top: 122px; font-family: \'宋体\', \'微软雅黑\', \'黑体\'; padding-left: 33px;\">心无终点，行无止境。在山之巅峰、密之临海、沙漠之腹<br />        、极地之寒，享受极致的自然，云狐A5伴你前行！</div></td>      </tr>  <tr>    <td><img alt=\"云弧手机\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t352/349/62443721/101780/734e518c/54007969Nf9e96116.jpg\" height=\"259\" width=\"750\" /></td>      </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"background-image: url(http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t211/208/1935577609/46122/8aa76b78/54007978N5b8df7b1.jpg); height: 363px\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: #333; padding-left: 22px; padding-top: 117px; font-family: \'宋体\', \'微软雅黑\', \'黑体\'; text-align: center;\">严格的质检体系，从原辅材料进货验证、检验，到产品生产合格，全程产品内控，<br />      通过国际权威机构SGS专业认证，拥有目前全球最高的防护能力，<br />      保障呈现最佳效果和品质质量。</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td><img alt=\"云弧手机\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t283/110/63957528/77877/3a3c752f/54007987N013f0cea.jpg\" height=\"310\" width=\"750\" /></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"background-image: url(http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t295/86/61094262/70092/ebd3dbff/540079bdN18ed44ab.jpg); height: 426px\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: #333333; padding-top: 114px; font-family: \'宋体\', \'微软雅黑\', \'黑体\'; text-align: center; padding-right: 33px;\">画质清晰鲜艳，即使恶劣天气，也能开阔掌上视界；<br />      摒弃传统户外手机惯有的笨重感，打造轻盈纤薄机身，与户外运动便携完美结合。</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td><img alt=\"云弧手机\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t295/155/67262943/60384/3e3a97b6/540079f8N85184b13.jpg\" height=\"350\" width=\"750\" /></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"background-image: url(http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t331/168/63789040/111879/b543919a/54007a06Nc6d9e1f8.jpg); height: 659px\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: #333333; padding-top: 144px; font-family: \'宋体\', \'微软雅黑\', \'黑体\'; padding-left: 378px;\">高度计、指南针、气压计、计步器、手电筒、放大<br />      镜、GPS、SOS；为挑战设计，轻松应对恶劣环境。</div></td>  </tr><tr>    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"background-image: url(http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t355/181/57441488/101625/80c4e3c9/54007a13N40baf7d3.jpg); height: 561px\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: #333333; padding-top: 95px; font-family: \'宋体\', \'微软雅黑\', \'黑体\'; padding-left: 378px;\">云弧浏览器、云弧卫士、云弧输入法、美美相机、<br />      随手玩等多种应用，专为户外运动设计。</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td><img alt=\"云弧手机\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t295/193/62144030/88466/dcc2c11/54007a21Nfd2bd6f3.jpg\" height=\"612\" width=\"750\" /></td>  </tr></tbody></table><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t253/163/1249825291/206660/ce949411/53f8605bNb405525b.jpg\" alt=\"云狐手机J5\" /><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t220/49/1292124268/153877/ac6a4a74/53f86070Na927ce50.jpg\" alt=\"云狐手机J5\" /><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t268/3/1338792778/196887/4f76e690/53faa3c9Ne0b2bd69.jpg\" alt=\"云狐手机J5\" width=\"750\" height=\"800\" /><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t250/72/1313303902/162159/181e960a/53fa858fN58ab5a10.jpg\" alt=\"云狐手机J5\" width=\"750\" height=\"507\" /><br /></div>', '2015-03-08 21:29:54', '2015-03-08 21:29:54');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1196423', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t790/91/50790629/376215/aa32948c/54f583c2N593db04c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-1\" name=\"detail-tag-id-1\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t616/228/1489838983/284607/2f8cb168/54f583ceN4eb37fd8.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1189/165/46950593/452771/ef6357f5/54f58412Nc9e7b0ba.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1138/176/52630521/225448/ce3163a1/54f58421N4c076fe2.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t853/76/59090369/211715/f2e1fc52/54f58430N9072c1af.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">完美8核 超高性价比 芯片为双核CPU+四核GPU+双核VPU结构 VPU是一种专业视频处理器，更加擅于修复运动画面中损伤的信号，保证影视、游戏画面在4K电视上更加流畅稳定。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1159/278/51362101/184920/c9ff712d/54f58440N804239dc.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">4K好传输 引领新科技 HDMI1.4、USB3.0使得信号在传输中更快、更稳定，无损传输，达到4K级传输标准</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t931/354/50876131/410159/7794abb2/54f58450N42c44266.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-10\" name=\"detail-tag-id-10\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t718/340/814842909/205208/24da9261/54f58460N887213e6.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1000/54/57671050/365179/53afeb54/54f5846fNfe4d8871.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t949/67/48508741/243022/35722073/54f5847eN1cecf89b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t742/13/825416225/360031/45ff1ed2/54f5848eN588c0af6.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t907/74/52120133/252032/c09b747e/54f5849eNb5c68319.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">电视设置中扫描二维码，即可下载传屏应用&ldquo;电视派&rdquo;或者关注公众号&ldquo;酷开电视派&rdquo;在同一WIFI环境下，绑定手机和电视，就可轻松实现多屏互动、语音遥控等功能，让电视更懂你</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-17\" name=\"detail-tag-id-17\" text=\"产品细节\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品细节</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t742/24/794691852/173952/c9a3d273/54f584b1Nfb570c85.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t646/174/1493790540/292270/efc4f750/54f584d4Na215bee1.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1066/322/56816773/268361/f270fed5/54f584e2Nbb9c0465.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\"