INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1209087', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t673/127/266533904/96332/fdb40a5d/545a168eN88e9f816.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t568/64/617337061/166307/68239bca/547801deN4fd3f9cc.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t604/328/451007515/72386/64c2b13c/5469c52bN9d1a6404.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-3\" name=\"detail-tag-id-3\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t487/29/1468081377/882330/2dea38af/54f96978Ncfecb8a1.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    哎哟TV内置海量爱奇艺VIP大片，供你免费观看，不用每部电影都去电影院，不用每部电影都付费点播，带给您超级影院的享受。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t814/154/79171832/929499/f7dcca70/54f96988Naba1e693.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    只要你拥有哎哟TV，就能比爱奇艺普通会员多看至少2.5倍的1080P超高清视频，30000多集电视剧，5000多部电影、25000万集动漫、纪录片尽情观看，每天更新，不断增加。还支持自由安装第三方影视软件，如优酷、土豆、腾讯、PPS等，绝对让你大饱眼福。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t601/364/458027080/525984/b7a81691/5469c5e6Nea8afdb7.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    我们知道个性的你对特权的钟爱，所以我们为A810系列定制专属爱奇艺通道，将成熟的互联网视频预加载技术成功运用在电视领域，实现在线高清视频0缓冲快速播放。无需多言，一切已准备就绪。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t556/183/471422283/271928/65e15af3/5469c621Nf724e865.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    哎哟TV拥有爱奇艺1080P高清专区，由爱奇艺独家提供，是行业最多的1080P清晰度影视资源，每天更新，不断增加！同时，电影院超过80%的影片，各大卫视超过90%的电视剧都能够在哎哟TV找到1080P高清版本。 </div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t577/176/194879887/399246/25ff34e3/5469c699Na0c1b786.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    画面的魅力在于它可以提供一次感同身受的旅行，有些地方即使不能亲自到往，一个优质的画面也能让你身临其境。所以，对TV而言，画质，尤为重要。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t562/36/473857216/690870/250c2e3e/5469c6e9N251fe96e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    好的音效在一部电影中起到画龙点睛的作用，不仅能准备表达主人公的心理活动，还能调动起观众的情感，从而产生共鸣。好的音质，必不可少。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t568/40/461965565/610441/8a399636/5469c727N4c7478f0.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    在Minimalism的理念下，A710系列搭载Android4.0+系统和爱奇艺六页极简UI，整个界面呈现扁平化设计风格，将推荐、影视、电视、应用、设置和搜索完全无缝融合在一个界面，开机即上网，实现直播频道和网络视频点播的无缝切换（翻页速度快）与互动。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t553/40/458045506/305716/c66d765c/5469c773N1884879e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    便捷，即方便而迅速，是效率的核心体现。我们想尽办法让你尽可能快的能查询到你想要的任何信息，因为我们明白，时间是你最宝贵的财富。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t619/63/450657099/423877/f09cd671/5469c7a7N352002e7.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    TCL多屏互动可以把手机（安卓系统&苹果IOS系统）上的图片、音乐、视频、投射到电视上播放，这样，你手机里精彩就可以全家共享了，同时，还可以实现手机当遥控器操控电视。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t493/78/482736846/316701/f024f85a/5469c8e0N3d29d554.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    哎哟TV A710系列采用高贵典雅，靓丽时尚还经久耐脏的黑色前框，不断流露艺术的美感与科技的力量，放在客厅绝对会让众多亲友啧啧称赞。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t451/356/469790591/394801/9480308c/5469cb79Nfd4da8fe.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    说他是艺术品绝不为过，你看它的黑色前框，你看边框的超窄设计，你看它国际范儿十足的身姿，处处洋溢着艺术的光圈。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t460/196/479806396/60675/9d02762/5469ccb0N82e4a03f.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">    从90&deg;方向望去，哎哟TV的设计非常简洁，又极具空间感，为客厅增添一分时尚元素。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t517/300/456479760/130205/fb0bd00e/5469cdbaN86658fdd.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">       背部层叠设计增添了空间感和轮廓感，极具个性。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-30\" name=\"detail-tag-id-30\" text=\"品牌介绍\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌介绍</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Introduction</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t238/101/1726976446/26436/8a01866/53fd87edNd02959e0.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t214/11/1746482083/150325/deede591/53fd933bNae579879.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t232/153/1707084185/36393/98d638ce/53fd9340Nb76a577f.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t226/8/1593107072/100547/1d713b8e/53fc6410N2d43c0cd.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t232/237/1783427815/115726/5e039767/53fda65cN9bdc58c5.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t226/147/1576174722/79209/56e05a91/53fc642dNc2ab94f2.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t211/221/1584832504/94213/1dd81e7/53fc6438N06684b01.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t217/220/1530404977/44957/604238fb/53fc6442N0c93ae21.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t226/331/1580275437/92471/36f6b56f/53fc644fN1552066e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:35', '2015-03-08 21:27:35');
