上几种网络外，其它网络能否使用请用前咨询您所用宽带公司。 \n   <br />2、因网络电视有些功能需要升级后才可以使用，请您购买智能网络电视后，拨打长虹服务电话4008-111-666，请专业人员为您的电视升级，让您享受更丰富的网络资源。 \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:39', '2015-03-08 21:27:39');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1222587', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t241/230/1072209775/264754/6f1bd29d/53f59f71Ne00ab998.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\"><br>X3560是飞利浦续航手机,\n<br>拥有超长电池续航能力，提供2个月超长待机和30小时通话时长\n<br>双卡双待\n<br>采用不锈钢金属材质，外观坚毅时尚,助您畅享沟通乐趣\n</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-3\" name=\"detail-tag-id-3\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M0A/0B/1F/rBEhWlMeaS0IAAAAAAR7G--eiXcAAJy7QM_dKIABHsz871.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-5\" name=\"detail-tag-id-5\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t457/143/1407223247/233851/d77b9288/54d461f6Nfdfc8041.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-7\" name=\"detail-tag-id-7\" text=\"适用范围\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>适用范围</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Heritage</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M04/0B/1F/rBEhWlMeaV4IAAAAAAYY3QsBgowAAJy7wK-jKcABhj1071.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-9\" name=\"detail-tag-id-9\" text=\"产品细节\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品细节</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t343/252/538179125/316647/9e16f0f4/54164986Nb173204b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">X3560是飞利浦续航手机,它的电池容量为2000毫安时,同时,飞利浦手机节电技术,使这款手机待机时间长达2个月,连续通话时间达30小时,它也是目前市场上当之无愧的超长待机,让您从此沟通无极限,高枕无忧.\n</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-12\" name=\"detail-tag-id-12\" text=\"产品细节\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品细节</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M09/0B/1F/rBEhWlMeabUIAAAAAAJGUwBW2qkAAJy8AFssmUAAkZr092.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">X3560是一款双卡双待手机,让您轻松切换双重角色,工作生活两不误.\n</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-15\" name=\"detail-tag-id-15\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M0A/16/17/rBEhVVMeafwIAAAAAAcv8DsX_1cAAJ7vgFEftAABzAI879.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">X3560拥有至酷金属机身,它的前壳装饰件和电池盖均为不锈钢材料,拥有这款手机,更能凸显您的气宇非凡.\n</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-18\" name=\"detail-tag-id-18\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </di