INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1242386', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t682/38/262215940/96332/fdb40a5d/545a1870N799e4c7b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-1\" name=\"detail-tag-id-1\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t883/112/77166810/343155/a57e54fb/54f96117N7b757321.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">哎哟TV实现国内外院线最新大片全部免费观看，不用每部电影都去电影院，不用每部电影都付费点播，带给您超级家庭影院的享受。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t1180/364/76395639/363260/8fdd2743/54f96124N7c244f8c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">只要你拥有哎哟TV，就能比爱奇艺普通会员多看至少2.5倍的1080P超高清视频，30000多集电视剧，5000多部电影、25000万集动漫、纪录片尽情观看，每天更新，不断增加。还支持自由安装第三方影视软件，如优酷、土豆、腾讯、PPS等，绝对让你大饱眼福。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t694/172/244820663/233133/706727e7/545866ebNd16f7cbe.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">我们知道个性的你对特权的钟爱，所以我们为A810系列定制专属爱奇艺通道，将成熟的互联网视频预加载技术成功运用在电视领域，实现在线高清视频0缓冲快速播放。无需多言，一切已准备就绪。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t631/299/231345171/115583/d73f6d2/545866f3N265e1610.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">哎哟TV拥有爱奇艺1080P高清专区，由爱奇艺独家提供，是行业最多的1080P清晰度影视资源，每天更新，不断增加！同时，电影院超过80%的影片，各大卫视超过90%的电视剧都能够在哎哟TV找到1080P高清版本。 \n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t496/185/225263326/163709/fe588ad2/545866f9N8f3e5fde.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">画面的魅力在于它可以提供一次感同身受的旅行，有些地方即使不能亲自到往，一个优质的画面也能让你身临其境。所以，对TV而言，画质，尤为重要。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t457/200/226949993/299238/7e5d6290/54586700N5938d090.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">好的音效在一部电影中起到画龙点睛的作用，不仅能准备表达主人公的心理活动，还能调动起观众的情感，从而产生共鸣。好的音质，必不可少。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t649/262/218192389/266725/70ebe18f/54586708Nfff2d734.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">在Minimalism的理念下，A810系列搭载Android4.0+系统和爱奇艺六页极简UI，整个界面呈现扁平化设计风格，将推荐、影视、电视、应用、设置和搜索完全无缝融合在一个界面，开机即上网，实现直播频道和网络视频点播的无缝切换（翻页速度快）与互动。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t493/222/217412212/129339/9367f301/54586710Nc2e5f2d3.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">便捷，即方便而迅速，是效率的核心体现。我们想尽办法让你尽可能快的能查询到你想要的任何信息，因为我们明白，时间是你最宝贵的财富。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t622/82/227652927/183479/6406f881/54586717N059b7511.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">手机的优势是方便，电脑的优势是存储，电视的优势是大屏。而家庭云功能则可以让您轻松实现电视、手机、PAD和电脑家庭娱乐设备的互相访问、互相下载、互相推送。在电脑和手机里各下载安装家庭云软件，然后与电视置于同一局域网内，从此就可以轻松在沙发上点播电脑上的视频到电视上播放了。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t502/21/237538932/109809/b8cb498b/5458671cNf67909f5.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-21\" name=\"detail-tag-id-21\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t643/234/237549105/139493/787535aa/54586724Nbc6f09fd.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t670/308/233164839/60428/f897a4e9/5458672aN6ebd9b98.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-24\" name=\"detail-tag-id-24\" text=\"品牌介绍\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌介绍</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Introduction</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t220/283/2088290851/26436/8a01866/5406ef9fN43c1b493.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t211/232/1748838396/150325/deede591/53fda647Nc147d57b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t229/273/1698880094/36393/98d638ce/53fd8870N44270c53.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t226/8/1593107072/100547/1d713b8e/53fc6410N2d43c0cd.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t232/237/1783427815/115726/5e039767/53fda65cN9bdc58c5.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t226/147/1576174722/79209/56e05a91/53fc642dNc2ab94f2.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t211/221/1584832504/94213/1dd81e7/53fc6438N06684b01.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t217/220/1530404977/44957/604238fb/53fc6442N0c93ae21.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t226/331/1580275437/92471/36f6b56f/53fc644fN1552066e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:45', '2015-03-08 21:27:45');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1242910', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t349/203/1456512186/1861758/a1720268/543b4793N8375b668.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t292/39/1455104026/524697/47f563cf/543b48e0N35667750.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t340/56/1466883034/566943/e19249f2/543b48f5Nf64d536d.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t274/64/1456549456/1149620/f2b6abca/543b4923N9e7e0a8e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t277/353/1464454213/264747/2f2b8460/543b4927N0e7ee277.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M05/05/0F/rBEhWlIRweIIAAAAAAAVx3qJcykAACNGwMTgV4AABXf797.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">东芝 REGZA高画质引擎</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">东芝是所有电视品牌中唯一一家使用自己研发、生产、制造芯片的品牌，它保证了东芝电视所有技术的无缝对接，使图像处理速度更快，画质更清晰、细腻，颜色过渡更自然。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M08/06/16/rBEhU1IRwkwIAAAAAAAVf1ItuosAACNIgP_6FoAABWX983.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">东芝 火箭炮音响系统</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">东芝电视的火箭炮音响系统融合了杜比音效技术，采用5+1立体式环绕，可以在极短时间营造极其震撼的立体环绕效果。新增的低音扬声器和大功率复合增频系统，保证音质的完美呈现，给您不一样的听觉感受。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-8\" name=\"detail-tag-id-8\" text=\"品牌介绍\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌介绍</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Introduction</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M02/05/14/rBEhWVIS4kAIAAAAAACv6ENgKucAACO-AKoKS0AALAA263.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">东芝在日本东京都的总部大楼东芝（TOSHIBA），是日本最大的半导体制造商，亦是第二大综合电机制造商，隶属于三井集团旗下。到今年，东芝在中国的事业已经开展了38年，始终不变的是&ldquo;与中国共同发展&rdquo;的决心与努力。现在东芝所涉足的数码产品，电子设备与零部件，社会基础设施，家电事业领域都在中国有业务开展。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-11\" name=\"detail-tag-id-11\" text=\"温馨提示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>温馨提示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">液晶电视保养小常识 不要随手关电视：不是让大家浪费电能，而是要注意权衡开启电源对电视寿命的影响。 荧光管：我们都知道，背光灯是液晶电视所有配件中寿命消耗最严重的一个部件，它和我们家中使用的荧光灯管是非常类似的。所以，它的使用寿命和点燃次数也是有很大关系的。启动的时候预热和高压脉冲式的阴极电子物质的溅射增大，缩短灯管寿命。如果您养成了随手关电视的习惯，以一天开四次计算，灯管的寿命将减少到原来的1/2。 避免长时间工作：这一条并不与上面的注意事项相冲突。在超长时间工作的情况下，热量会在液晶电视的机身内部存积，这对于其它电子元件还不够成太大的威胁，但是液晶面板是有可能烧毁，从而形成大面积坏点的。</div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:45', '2015-03-08 21:27:45');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1243135', '	<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t451/315/1419874269/692575/cc1053d2/54d438f9N1613f997.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"5568\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; text-align: center;\" /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:10', '2015-03-08 21:28:10');
