验全新的极速网络快感<br /> ·双卡双待，双卡槽均支持4G网络，随心切换，流量无忧</span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t289/46/1945411935/73939/ffbde497/544869ecN52cea510.jpg); width:750px; height:356px; line-height:12px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><div style=\" margin-top:20px; margin-left:0px; color:#2b2b2b; width:700px; font-size:14px; color:#727171;\">      <span style=\"color:#19aafd;font-size:14px; line-height:10px;\">采用高通骁龙极速64位处理器</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#ff5f9c;line-height:18px;\">游刃有余，动力加倍</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;\">·强劲高通骁龙64位极速处理器，与超强的GPU结合，发挥出超强的处理能力，轻松应对大型3D游戏、视频及多任务<br /> ·采用A53架构64位四核处理器，性能提升15%，运算能力提升<br />最高达40% ·28nm低功耗工艺，系统耗电量下降30%<br /> ·配备Adreno 306图形处理器，更快的图形性能<br /></span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t331/206/1950389674/63707/f3731127/544757a6N46e2858d.jpg); width:750px; height:383px;\" valign=\"top\"><div style=\"float:left; margin-left:70px; color:#2b2b2b; width:350px; font-size:14px; color:#fff; margin-top:20px;; text-align:left;\">      <span style=\"color:#ff4d79;font-size:14px; line-height:12px;\">2G极速64位LP-DDR3，16G高速闪存</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1ab3ff;line-height:18px;\">配置升级，性能倍增</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#727171;line-height:15px;\">·配备全新LP-DDR3高速内存，移动终端上最高速的内存，流畅<br />感提高不止一倍<br /> ·DDR3增加了温度传感器，通过控制温度达到省电的目的<br /> ·2GB超大内存配16G的高速闪存，配置较上一代提升了一倍！轻<br />松驾驭游戏、视频<br /> ·32GB高速扩展，可储存更多照片、音乐、电影和游戏</span>     </div></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table width=\"750\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t337/104/1940301436/84443/d6e67e99/5444fef8Nd662334b.jpg); width:750px; height:352px; line-height:20px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><div style=\" margin-top:20px; margin-left:0px; color:#2b2b2b; width:700px; font-size:14px; color:#727171;\">      <span style=\"color:#19aafd;font-size:14px;\">5.5英寸全视角高清显示屏</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"color:#a6ce00;font-size:26px;\">高清屏幕，更大视野</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:10px;line-height:16px;\">·5.5英寸HD大屏幕，画面更大，视野更开阔，70.58%超高屏占比，阅读更舒适<br /> ·全贴合IPS电容屏，全方位可视角度</span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t517/48/17242689/63138/e7fb48cb/544757a6N0e28e03a.jpg); width:750px; height:351px;\" valign=\"top\"><div style=\"float:right; margin-top:5px; margin-right:10px; color:#2b2b2b; width:330px; font-size:14px; color:#fff; text-align:left;\">      <span style=\"color:#fef306;font-size:14px; line-height:12px;\">1300万主摄像头+500万前置摄像头</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"color:#fef306;font-size:26px;\">拍照机皇，千元顶配</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:10px;text-align:left; line-height:16px;\">·后置1300万+前置500万摄像头，突破性地提高至少30%<br />的感光能力，画质更佳，噪点更低<br /> ·前置500万BSI背照式传感器。88度超广角镜头里可以留住<br />更多欢笑<br /> ·配合F2.2大光圈，无惧弱光环境 </span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t280/263/1892953022/76683/e2949dab/5444fef8N31c707e2.jpg); width:750px; height:344px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><div style=\" margin-top:10px; margin:0; color:#2b2b2b; width:750px; font-size:14px; color:#727171; line-height:15px\">      <span style=\"color:#fb659e;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;\">引入了nubia全新NeoVision 4.0的众多核心功能和体验</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"color:#1ab3ff;font-size:23px; line-height:18px;\">专业功能 易用体验</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:10px;line-height:15px;\">·采用全新NeoVision 4.0 V5定制版<br /> ·首次加入了电子光圈、手动调焦等专业摄影功能，配合测光与对焦分离，带给你前所未有的专业拍照体验<br /> ·预置了星轨、星云模式，拍星星已经不再是专业天文摄影师的专利<br /> ·120帧高速录像，可快放慢放，助你发挥更多创意 </span>     </div></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table width=\"750\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t334/315/1909272444/124010/860c1453/5444fef9N1ad614e3.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"346\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"font:22px/1.3 \'\\5FAE\\8F6F\\96C5\\9ED1\',\'\\5b8b\\4f53\';color:#333\" height=\"32\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/0A/12/rBEQYFGixPYIAAAAAAApsmGaiwAAACEFgHIF8AAACnK214.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t544/43/27469231/78280/78ff10f4/54487085N388b8702.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"238\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t328/361/2000394744/120246/6ff893bd/54487081Ne795df78.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"237\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t331/40/1974802740/102607/46d35ddb/54487081N42a8b139.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"237\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t613/194/32916940/92044/9305dd94/54487081N2fb65585.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"237\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t592/39/29023288/115592/8eb5e227/54487082Na6568b13.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"237\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t550/83/123179781/89684/515585b3/54487081N0e4a495e.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"236\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table width=\"750\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td style=\"font:22px/1.3 \'\\5FAE\\8F6F\\96C5\\9ED1\',\'\\5b8b\\4f53\';color:#333\" height=\"32\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g13/M00/06/0D/rBEhUlKMcsQIAAAAAAApXVbUAMYAAFuCgJHW1oAACl1467.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t271/177/1907423053/97622/29cb1fb3/5444ff06N8e9401da.jpg); width:750px; height:367px;\" valign=\"top\"><div style=\"float:left; margin-top:120px; margin-left:70px; color:#2b2b2b; width:400px; font-size:14px; color:#fff; text-align:left;\">      <span style=\"color:#ff4d79;font-size:14px; line-height:14px;\">时尚设计，挑战美学与握持感极限</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1ab3ff;line-height:16px;\">“一抹蓝”设计，简约不简单</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#727171;line-height:15px;\">·在黑白经典的两件式设计之间，“一抹蓝”呼之欲出，惊喜而不浮夸，<br />尽显青春的明快干脆<br /> ·高端镜面研磨工艺，确保屏幕听筒与肌肤接触的平滑感<br /> ·巧妙的呼吸灯设计，不但保留了息屏美学，更与nubia UI一脉相承，<br />一见倾心<br /> ·多彩青春，多彩能量。四种炫彩后壳，随心更换，<br />释放多彩青春正能量</span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t331/164/1908547403/52771/d34a97ef/5444ff06N7bb7aabe.jpg); width:750px; height:372px;\" valign=\"top\"><div style=\"float:right; margin-top:90px; margin-right:30px; color:#2b2b2b; width:300px; font-size:14px; color:#fff; text-align:left;\">      <span style=\"color:#55b3fc;font-size:14px;\">完美的通话体验</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#ff5f9c;line-height:18px;\">现场感还原 释放青春旋律</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#727171;line-height:16px;\">·双麦降噪，完美的通话体验<br /> ·DTS音效，结合高清立体录音，身临其境的环绕体验</span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t481/336/67349391/48681/2555e5fa/544ba7e5Nda140ee6.jpg); width:750px; height:337px;\" valign=\"top\"><div style=\"float:left; margin-top:35px; margin-left:20px; color:#2b2b2b; width:350px; font-size:14px; color:#fff; text-align:left;\">      <span style=\"color:#ccfd00;font-size:14px; line-height:14px;\">续航全面升级，随时随地随心所欲</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1ab3ff;line-height:16px;\">青春不打烊 能量更无限</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#ffffff;line-height:16px;\">·采用高能量密度的聚合物电芯工艺的3100mAh可拆卸式电池，续航持久，能量无限<br /> ·日系精工IC和mos管和PTC二级可恢复保护电路，安全性极高<br /> ·nubia电工提供强劲节电方案</span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t289/124/1938230331/55119/f442a4fe/5445c38cN0c5e2ef7.jpg); width:750px; height:353px;\" valign=\"top\"><div style=\"float:right; margin-top:35px; margin-right:30px; color:#2b2b2b; width:300px; font-size:14px; color:#fff; text-align:left;\">      <span style=\"color:#55b3fc;font-size:14px;\">搭载全新的nubia UI 2.5</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#a6ce00;line-height:20px;\">nubia UI，更懂你的UI</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#727171;line-height:16px;\">·专门为V5系列定制的基于Android 4.4的全新nubia UI 2.5， 带来全新体验，提高易用性，传达出纤细轻薄、年轻时尚的 视觉感<br /> ·支持OTG，随心连接各种娱乐拓展设备<br /> ·人性化的触摸手势操作，不仅减少使用按键，增加物理按键的寿 命，操作也更快捷<br /> ·双击亮屏，息屏时手指轻轻双击屏任意位置，即可亮屏<br /> ·手掌锁屏，任一界面只要手掌张开，轻轻搭在屏幕上，即可 锁屏与息屏</span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t292/55/1909491824/71595/6badb563/5445c0b7N2a871462.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"334\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table>', '2015-03-08 21:29:19', '2015-03-08 21:29:19');
