60buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t571/195/205502350/27469/70aae560/545710b4Ne097a574.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t529/100/211523505/20705/14549550/545710bfN7d2a8f61.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t520/71/194606221/33550/252f33f8/545710c9N9c121a46.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:32:38', '2015-03-08 21:32:38');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1270564', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t661/24/172459750/1978658/4b092ada/54545b80N139983f1.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t334/123/2106961079/1509000/ffb19494/54545dd9Nab24e567.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t505/143/177286142/1059232/971cc079/54545f08N65a0c2e3.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M07/06/16/rBEhVFIRuz4IAAAAAAAVx3qJcykAACNBAP_YkUAABXf404.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">东芝 REGZA高画质引擎</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">东芝是所有电视品牌中唯一一家使用自己研发、生产、制造芯片的品牌，它保证了东芝电视所有技术的无缝对接，使图像处理速度更快，画质更清晰、细腻，颜色过渡更自然。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><table width=\"750\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/06/16/rBEhU1IRvEQIAAAAAAAVf1ItuosAACNCQJh140AABWX039.jpg\" /></td>\n    <td><p class=\"formwork_titleleft\">东芝 火箭炮音响系统</p><p class=\"formwork_titleleft2\">东芝电视的火箭炮音响系统融合了杜比音效技术，采用5+1立体式环绕，可以在极短时间营造极其震撼的立体环绕效果。新增的低音扬声器和大功率复合增频系统，保证音质的完美呈现，给您不一样的听觉感受。</p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-6\" name=\"detail-tag-id-6\" text=\"品牌介绍\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌介绍</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Introduction</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M06/0B/13/rBEhVVIS4WoIAAAAAACv6ENgKucAACRSwGD2zcAALAA699.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">东芝在日本东京都的总部大楼东芝（TOSHIBA），是日本最大的半导体制造商，亦是第二大综合电机制造商，隶属于三井集团旗下。到今年，东芝在中国的事业已经开展了38年，始终不变的是&ldquo;与中国共同发展&rdquo;的决心与努力。现在东芝所涉足的数码产品，电子设备与零部件，社会基础设施，家电事业领域都在中国有业务开展。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-9\" name=\"detail-tag-id-9\" text=\"温馨提示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>温馨提示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">液晶电视保养小常识 不要随手关电视：不是让大家浪费电能，而是要注意权衡开启电源对电视寿命的影响。 荧光管：我们都知道，背光灯是液晶电视所有配件中寿命消耗最严重的一个部件，它和我们家中使用的荧光灯管是非常类似的。所以，它的使用寿命和点燃次数也是有很大关系的。启动的时候预热和高压脉冲式的阴极电子物质的溅射增大，缩短灯管寿命。如果您养成了随手关电视的习惯，以一天开四次计算，灯管的寿命将减少到原来的1/2。 避免长时间工作：这一条并不与上面的注意事项相冲突。在超长时间工作的情况下，热量会在液晶电视的机身内部存积，这对于其它电子元件还不够成太大的威胁，但是液晶面板是有可能烧毁，从而形成大面积坏点的。</div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:45', '2015-03-08 21:27:45');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1270603', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t628/336/77211424/82581/efee5ae4/54605268N6a1766a3.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-1\" name=\"detail-tag-id-1\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">4.85英寸Super AMOLED联想,炫丽画质 冰纷生活</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">4.85英寸Super AMOLED显示屏，色彩更加艳丽，图像更加明亮，无论在强光还是暗光环境下，都能给你舒适的视觉体验。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t640/26/341594929/65683/fb31c09/546052aeN3431e7a0.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-4\" name=\"detail-tag-id-4\" text=\"产品功能\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品功能</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_titleleft\">广阔视界 多彩人生</div>\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">800W+500W像素高分变率摄像头，带给你高品质画面。其中前置摄像头配备了广角镜头，为自拍提供更广阔的拍摄视野。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t598/191/352744254/41823/d949bcd3/54605565N63d9969c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t646/145/380845747/95448/e3b1189e/54631be9N5ef7cf2b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t472/314/360650293/31395/463bdf2a/54605612Nb4a33497.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-9\" name=\"detail-tag-id-9\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t508/150/363936221/161772/ed049708/54605649N1d194846.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:54', '2015-03-08 21:27:54');
