\"246\" width=\"750\" /></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t607/32/541994995/123547/b73213f4/547295caNffa1b926.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"496\" width=\"750\" /></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t655/92/569449137/103911/b3c80634/547295d0N078f7cd5.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"444\" width=\"750\" /></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody><tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/jfs/t481/303/581861202/128172/1450edb8/547295d6N4d446cd1.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"386\" width=\"750\" /></td>  </tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">  <tbody>    <tr>      <td height=\"93\" width=\"750\"><div style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM: 15px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5em; PADDING-LEFT: 15px; PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; FONT-FAMILY: \'微软雅黑\'; FONT-SIZE: 12px; PADDING-TOP: 15px; color: #666666;\">法律免责声明 <br />        1需要使用数据计划。4G LTE 功能适用于特定国家或地区的特定运营商。速度会因现场状况而可能有所差异。有关 4G LTE 支持的详情，请联系你的运营商并查看 www.apple.com/iphone/LTE。<br />      2电池使用时间依使用状况和设置可能有所差异。详情请参阅 www.apple.com/cn/batteries。</div></td>    </tr>  </tbody></table>', '2015-03-08 21:28:10', '2015-03-08 21:28:10');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1274285', '	<div class=\"_00000_A_ERPFUSE_1486592\" id=\"abdis_A\">  <div width=\"750\" align=\"center\">   <img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/g16/M00/0B/1C/rBEbRlOC9bQIAAAAAAEcQNzVRDkAACUMANFuyAAARxY839.jpg\" />  </div>  <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">   <tbody>           <tr>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/0A/12/rBEQYFGiw_4IAAAAAAAp4J-ptK0AACEDgOO5BAAACn4809.jpg\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/g14/M08/1E/1B/rBEhVVNDauQIAAAAAAIBini1QRcAALg6QHktdgAAgGi280.jpg\" height=\"810\" width=\"750\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 24px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(88, 189, 255); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\">采用高通骁龙极速四核处理器</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 14px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"36\">采用高通骁龙四核处理器，超强的处理能力，使得大型游戏、视频、多任务运行等操作轻松流畅。</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td height=\"268\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/g13/M08/03/0F/rBEhVFNDbzQIAAAAAABA5-PCtDEAALZEwNWiaEAAED_157.jpg\" height=\"258\" width=\"750\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 24px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(88, 189, 255); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"0\">?</td>    </tr>   </tbody>  </table>  <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">   <tbody>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 24px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(88, 189, 255); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\">5吋夏普高清显示屏</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 14px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\">采用5吋CGS显示屏，1280x720高清分辨率，全方位的可视角度，采用全贴合技<br /> 术，视频、游戏、图像显示更细腻，视效更惊艳。</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/g14/M08/1E/1B/rBEhV1NDauQIAAAAAAGCKj65TJMAALg6QHnsXQAAYJC356.jpg\" height=\"483\" width=\"750\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 24px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(88, 189, 255); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"53\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/0A/12/rBEQYFGixPYIAAAAAAApsmGaiwAAACEFgHIF8AAACnK214.jpg\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 24px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(88, 189, 255); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ebf2f5\" height=\"45\">多彩青春 多彩能量</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 14px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ebf2f5\" height=\"44\">四种炫彩后壳，随心更换，释放多彩青春正能量!</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/g14/M08/1E/1B/rBEhV1NDauQIAAAAAAEE1cUpxSwAALg6QHg9_kAAQTt069.jpg\" height=\"415\" width=\"750\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td align=\"center\">&nbsp;</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 24px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(88, 189, 255); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"53\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g12/M00/0A/12/rBEQYFGiw-wIAAAAAAApunEpnisAACEDgF4U-4AACnS829.jpg\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 24px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(88, 189, 255); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"59\">nubia全新NeoVision 3.0 手机中的单反机</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 14px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"76\">拍照硬件配置：后置1300万+前置500万摄像头搭配。<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; 拍照功能：支持独立对焦，独立测光与独立白平衡功能。<br /> 引入了nubia全新NeoVision 3.0的众多核心功能和体验。</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td align=\"center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/g14/M08/1E/1B/rBEhVlNDaugIAAAAAAC5OU7JIW4AALg6QP7vvkAALlR442.jpg\" height=\"575\" width=\"750\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/g14/M08/1E/1B/rBEhV1NDaucIAAAAAAC5GLuw_IoAALg6QP5wasAALkw695.jpg\" height=\"488\" width=\"750\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/g14/M07/1E/1B/rBEhVVNDaucIAAAAAADeR88aPLgAALg6gAAhw8AAN5f369.jpg\" height=\"393\" width=\"750\" /></td>    </tr>   </tbody>  </table>  <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">   <tbody>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 24px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(88, 189, 255); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"73\">照片拍照效果</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/g14/M07/1E/1B/rBEhVlNDaugIAAAAAAMQ1q2TAZwAALg6gAEikoAAxDu358.jpg\" height=\"529\" width=\"750\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 24px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(88, 189, 255); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"67\">全新UI 全新体验</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 14px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"63\">采用专门为V5定制的nubia全新UI，为您带来全新体验。整套UI在秉承扁平化设计理念的同时，极大地提升了易用性。在保证实用性的前提下，UI控件样式传承了品牌设计理念，传达出纤细轻薄、年轻时尚的视觉感受。</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/g14/M08/1E/1B/rBEhVVNDaucIAAAAAAFEBhhY8F8AALg6QP6etsAAUQe504.jpg\" height=\"431\" width=\"750\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 24px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(88, 189, 255); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"52\">可升级双卡 内存可扩展</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 14px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"36\">可升级双卡，支持micro SD卡扩充，不用为容量担忧，视频、游戏、音乐、照片想装就装。</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/g14/M07/1E/1B/rBEhV1NDauoIAAAAAAChxpW_rmQAALg6gDIUhwAAKHe304.jpg\" height=\"377\" width=\"750\" /></td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 24px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(88, 189, 255); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"51\">可拆卸电池</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td style=\"font: 14px/1.3 \'微软雅黑\', \'宋体\'; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\" align=\"center\" height=\"33\">针对续航问题，V5将采用2400mAh的可拆卸电池，能量无限！</td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/g14/M07/1E/1B/rBEhVVNDauoIAAAAAAC3lpPTf2MAALg6gDSELkAALeu872.jpg\" height=\"405\" width=\"750\" /></td>    </tr>   </tbody>  </table> </div> <br />', '2015-03-08 21:27:37', '2015-03-08 21:27:37');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1274311', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t658/8/951425389/709556/91e595cc/549d13f9N2e3c750c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t616/265/968932818/161412/727c4cba/549d141aN42e9fac1.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t625/204/961251789/284073/32ccf81f/549d193cNa00c4630.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">卓越4K  超清体验     飞利浦超高清电视拥有3840&times;2160屏幕分辨率，带来惊人的830万像素分辨率的全新境界，可呈现4倍于全高清（Full HD）的画面效果，8倍于高清（HD）的分辨率，展现生动细节，让您享受栩栩如生的靓丽电视图像效果。																																			</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t724/304/288587817/259769/f7073f9e/549d16e8Na8100cfb.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">4K 引擎  智能优化  搭载卓越画质引擎---飞利浦4K逐点精晰，拥有优异的画质处理能力，大幅提升画面表现，再通过超高清面板进行细致还原，为您呈现令人惊叹的高清视觉体验。																																			</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t682/339/927872667/270552/b2b69004/549d1771N0e86b98a.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">优化画质   身临其境   飞利浦先进4大画质处理技术，对比度优化、智能降噪、色彩增强、锐度提升、带来更高水准的色彩、对比度和清晰度，呈现非凡画质和性能，让每一个画面，都宛如真境。																																			\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t457/31/944117911/324801/57eabddb/549d1789N491d8fcf.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">八核引擎  迅捷精彩    采用先进八核处理器----高效利用四核CPU运算，后台运行速度更快；四核GPU显著提升图形渲染能力，使得画面更加清晰、色彩还原更加逼真。通过八核处理，畅快淋漓的完美视效瞬间跃然眼前。 																																			\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t736/149/281752924/206246/840ab59/549d17f3Ncac1a2c5.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">Smart TV  Android 4.3平台   主流智能开放式平台  拥有更好的兼容性和稳定性    飞利浦专为电视定制的海量应用系统，给您更丰富精彩地应用体验。无论您是游戏控、炒股王、游戏狂还是社交达人，都能找到至爱。																																			\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t610/121/955674125/288931/141ed9b7/549d181eN6dc71bd5.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">ICNTV 在线视频   ICNTV内容平台拥有海量正版视频资讯，每日更新片库，为您提供最新最酷的影视资讯和新闻内容。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t547/127/930671102/344363/753aa130/549d184dN08902b76.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">360度 环绕     震撼心灵  飞利浦不断开创领先业界的音频技术，运用超宽环绕立体声、晶晰声效和自动音量调衡技术，创造层次丰富的立体声和环绕音效，令您欣赏到无与伦比的强劲音效，感受身临其境般的虚拟环绕立体声。																																			\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t622/346/974749748/206183/1f0b144f/549d188dN7c6bdd35.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">欧风时尚设计  窄边镂空底座  源自欧洲经典的时尚窄边设计，简约线条一气呵成。时尚金属镂空底座，低调不失华贵，与家居环境相得益彰。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t538/313/310415887/213174/97053673/545c9429N96b58e45.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">完美支持4K影片USB播放。\n</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-22\" name=\"detail-tag-id-22\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t676/224/46293225/338320/fa6e105b/545c94c7Nef5bf855.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-24\" name=\"detail-tag-id-24\" text=\"尺寸信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>尺寸信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Size Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t655/300/296120418/53738/66f85105/545c94e5Nc38ffd84.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-26\" name=\"detail-tag-id-26\" text=\"实景展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>实景展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Virtual show</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t586/241/302510588/183170/10e93aea/545c9506N3d6ca66a.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-28\" name=\"detail-tag-id-28\" text=\"售后服务\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>售后服务</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">After-Sales Service</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t235/187/1390656867/152469/4322fedb/53faeeddNb7f67892.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t232/356/1410641305/56742/65dced7e/53fae1caNf7d65488.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t211/49/1426143270/58304/f8979f0/53faef91N73eec6d8.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-32\" name=\"detail-tag-id-32\" text=\"品牌荣誉\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌荣誉</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Awards</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t439/10/313749165/330856/86911ad9/54167c00N518d4694.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-34\" name=\"detail-tag-id-34\" text=\"温馨提示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>温馨提示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t544/187/198856235/708795/100f1a1a/5456fd66N31343e87.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:39', '2015-03-08 21:27:39');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1274744', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t679/315/126171037/377231/419621ec/545056b9N492d7f19.gif\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t493/232/123387845/81976/842e1044/545056daNaaaee84e.gif\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t601/135/121388277/117679/c5b99fd4/545056f1N8f904d50.gif\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">极致4K  超清体验     飞利浦超高清电视拥有3840&times;2160屏幕分辨率，带来惊人的830万像素分辨率的全新境界，可呈现4倍于全高清（Full HD）的画面效果，8倍于高清（HD）的分辨率，展现生动细节，令您享受极致的电视图像效果。																																			</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t547/155/120617968/192453/22f571e4/54505800N248e21f5.gif\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">4K 引擎  智能优化  飞利浦超高清电视特有画质引擎---4K锐腾核芯，拥有超凡的运算能力，能够处理包括超高清信号在内的各类视频信号，对画面进行优化提升，呈现优异、清晰的超高清视频。																																			</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t334/307/2055005554/119601/cab445d1/5450582aN955dabbe.gif\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">优化画质   身临其境   飞利浦先进4大画质处理技术，对比度优化、智能降噪、色彩增强、锐度提升、带来更高水准的色彩、对比度和清晰度，呈现非凡画质和性能，让每一个画面，都宛如真境。																																			</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t469/356/122281695/193282/9cf1bda8/54506433N39c6aa3d.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">六核引擎  迅捷精彩    采用先进六核处理器----高效利用四核CPU运算，后台运行速度更快；双核GPU显著提升图形渲染能力，使得画面更加清晰、色彩还原更加逼真。通过六核处理，畅快淋漓的完美视效瞬间跃然眼前。 																																			</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t490/331/122146864/205071/4f1e3d8e/54505948Naedb0620.gif\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">出色音箱  天籁之音   内置双音腔设计，采用&ldquo;隐身扬声器&rdquo;设计，能模拟出影院般逼真的环绕效果，营造非凡卓越的影音体验。																																			</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t601/102/123993655/180848/726de65b/54505dc0N46f64eb3.gif\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">360度 环绕     震撼心灵  飞利浦不断开创领先业界的音频技术，运用超宽环绕立体声、晶晰声效和自动音量调衡技术，创造层次丰富的立体声和环绕音效，令您欣赏到无与伦比的强劲音效，感受身临其境般的虚悄环绕立体声。																																			</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t646/148/118133318/258725/db6852f5/5450644fN8f9425cd.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">Smart TV  Android 4.2平台   采用市场主流智能开放式平台  拥有更好的兼容性和稳定性  飞利浦应用商城   飞利浦专为电视定制的海量应用系统，给您更丰富精彩地应用体验。无论您是游戏控、炒股王、游戏狂还是社交达人，都能找到至爱。																																			</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t289/365/1999785733/190571/37b77051/5450620bNd64d77bd.gif\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">ICNTV 在线视频   ICNTV内容平台拥有海量正版视频资讯，每日更新片库，为您提供最新最酷的影视资讯和新闻内容。\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t307/219/2035078273/110251/5eae4096/545062a4Nf9061333.gif\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">小屏传大屏   通过无线传屏功能，即可实现智能手机向智能电视同步屏幕，分享照片，视频，游戏等，幸福一刻，全家分享。（注：部分手机适用）																																			</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-22\" name=\"detail-tag-id-22\" text=\"产品细节\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品细节</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t613/78/122354602/131522/2caa96ca/545062f1N2c7b4607.gif\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-24\" name=\"detail-tag-id-24\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t649/72/119332700/169997/dea8748c/54506389N62310624.gif\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t484/17/118921170/154828/f07883b5/545063aeN7a35ab30.gif\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-27\" name=\"detail-tag-id-27\" text=\"尺寸信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>尺寸信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Size Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t448/250/125730542/156420/d0e92b29/545063e4N39c89b84.gif\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-29\" name=\"detail-tag-id-29\" text=\"售后服务\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>售后服务</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">After-Sales Service</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t235/187/1390656867/152469/4322fedb/53faeeddNb7f67892.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t211/49/1426143270/58304/f8979f0/53faef91N73eec6d8.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t232/356/1410641305/56742/65dced7e/53fae1caNf7d65488.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-33\" name=\"detail-tag-id-33\" text=\"品牌荣誉\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌荣誉</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Awards</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t439/10/313749165/330856/86911ad9/54167c00N518d4694.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-35\" name=\"detail-tag-id-35\" text=\"温馨提示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>温馨提示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t220/23/1395580235/398346/9896ab0/53faf206Nd9cb6d40.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:08', '2015-03-08 21:28:08');
