</span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t532/166/354943849/236446/87201fbc/5460ce3fNe1323e1a.jpg); \" height=\"433\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"750\" align=\"center\"><div style=\" font-size: 28px; color: #ff4c76; padding-top:90px;\">      FUN模式功能     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t640/247/366716626/208547/cf435b0f/5460ce42N7bc57dbf.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"365\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\'\" width=\"750\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t607/264/369042235/149328/e0dbb305/5460ce40Ne1665994.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"470\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t607/287/359840434/188477/657392a0/5460ce62N52be1edd.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"472\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t556/80/394326506/147036/b3be518c/5460ce62Nb0e06c3c.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"451\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t595/261/369795789/179367/e65bbf7c/5460ce64N18e416d1.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"512\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t661/265/378982146/192624/117c29a3/5460ce62Nf905756e.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"483\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\'\" width=\"750\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t604/144/362921087/192321/1a68e48d/5460ce78Nbd555606.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"527\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t592/279/359052009/266691/5d2ada50/5460ce7aN801d3b38.jpg); \" height=\"686\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"750\" align=\"center\"><div style=\" width: 750px; font-size: 16px; color: #fff;\">      <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ff4bd9;line-height:14px;\">匠心独具的设计</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"color:#d6f211;font-size:28px;line-height:16px;\">时尚，简约</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;\">·在黑白经典的两件式设计之间，大弧面手感结合不同颜色炫彩后壳，让青春更有质感，把个性握在手中<br /> ·高端镜面研磨工艺，确保屏幕听筒与肌肤接触的平滑感<br /> ·巧妙的呼吸灯设计，不但保留了息屏美学，更与nubia UI一脉相承，一见倾心<br /> ·多彩青春，多彩能量。四种炫彩后壳，随心更换，释放多彩青春正能量</span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t451/350/375419146/212234/63c122e2/5460ce7aNdc18f048.jpg); \" height=\"358\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"750\" align=\"left\"><div style=\" width: 400px; font-size: 18px; color: #fff; padding-left:30px;\">      <span style=\"color:#028ffd;\">完美的通话体验</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"color:#ff4c76;font-size:28px;line-height:18px;\">现场感还原 释放青春旋律</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;\">·双麦降噪，完美的通话体验<br /> ·DTS音效，结合高清立体录音，身临其境的环绕体验</span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t592/276/365744017/102026/3a25034b/5460ce77Naa9c8247.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t544/168/377127978/198665/967d5978/5460ce78N4010901c.jpg); \" height=\"319\" valign=\"top\" width=\"750\" align=\"left\"><div style=\" width: 350px; font-size: 18px; color: #fff; float:right; padding-right:22px; padding-top:40px;\">      <span style=\"color:#028ffd;line-height:14px;\">续航全面升级，随时随地随心所欲</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"color:#ff4c76;font-size:28px;line-height:16px;\">可拆式电池 能量无限</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:14px;line-height:16px;\">·锂离子聚合物2400mAh可拆卸式电池，能量无限<br />·nubia电工提供强劲节电方案</span>     </div></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table> <table style=\"font-family:\'微软雅黑\'\" width=\"750\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">  <tbody>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t520/261/378563367/178703/f39c509f/5460ce86N1d13e80e.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"318\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"background-image:url(http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t625/60/387553846/247831/fe8756a5/5460ce87N9ca4968a.jpg); \" height=\"426\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"750\" align=\"left\"><div style=\" width: 300px; font-size: 18px; color: #fff; float:left; padding-left:20px;\">      <span style=\"color:#028ffd;line-height:14px;\">搭载全新的nubia UI 2.5</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"color:#c2ff15;font-size:28px;line-height:20px;\">nubia UI，更懂你的UI</span>      <br />      <br />      <span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;\">·专门为V5系列定制的基于Android 4.4的全新nubia UI 2.5， 带来全新体验，提高易用性，传达出纤细轻薄、年轻时尚的 视觉感<br /> ·超人性化双卡操作界面，上网、通话随心选择<br /> ·易读式：重新定制人机交互模式以及电话、短信等功能，配合大字体，时尚，不仅仅是年轻人的专利<br /> ·全新的桌面主体市场，海里免费主体随心换<br /> ·人性化的触摸手势操作，不仅减少使用按键，增加物理按键的寿 命，操作也更快捷<br /> ·双击亮屏，息屏时手指轻轻双击屏任意位置，即可亮屏<br /> ·手掌锁屏，任一界面只要手掌张开，轻轻搭在<br />屏幕上，即可锁屏与息屏</span>     </div></td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td><img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t628/323/82706420/117863/6b9449c/5460ce87N44e9136e.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"425\" width=\"750\" /></td>   </tr>  </tbody> </table>', '2015-03-08 21:31:50', '2015-03-08 21:31:50');
