class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t655/132/777977677/102335/448f196c/5487e8c3Nd6e521f9.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t661/54/774308134/115403/4bec8d41/5487e8d2N3a0030c9.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t748/131/98324557/78665/f73d9d01/5487e8deN7974dd60.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t652/21/788455479/92504/a52b3ee1/5487e8e9N3e12d973.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t721/146/109455775/113227/d94e29e7/5487e8f3Ne2dfc74c.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:55', '2015-03-08 21:28:55');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1297797', '<div class=\"content_tpl\">    <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品特色\">   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">    <span>产品特色</span>    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>   </div>  </div> <div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t151/307/937540484/43579/eb97bc67/539e5498N0431beb1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div>    <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品细节\">   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">    <span>产品细节</span>    <span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span>   </div>  </div> <div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t145/87/937034179/11688/7bb253fe/539e54b3N63ec921b.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星G3586V支持中国联通TD-LTE 4G网络，让您畅享移动过程中的高速联网服务，不论是观看视频，还是传送文件，4G的高速数据传输服务都给您前所未有的快感体验。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t172/158/912594489/20331/16579838/539e54dfN46808d5a.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t163/149/980608947/11398/caf6af7d/539e54f3Nf3ba81ad.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星G3586V配置4.7英寸高分辨率显示屏，画质清晰，色彩真实而饱满，细腻的细节呈现带来畅快观感，让您无论是网上冲浪还是观看视频，均享广阔视界。搭配精致的皮质感设计，手感舒适，更彰显您的时尚品位。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t169/39/976946264/29192/c3891743/539e5510N4d693051.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t151/108/952087625/14670/7e62cfbf/539e55aaN50159183.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星G3586V搭载四核处理器，支持无缝多任务处理，页面加载和应用启动都顺畅自如，毫无卡顿之感，让您无论是处理工作事务还是网上冲浪都有快捷流畅的操作体验。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t190/271/920181250/52360/2a0aaaaf/539e56c3N1041c3db.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t157/157/912844855/7666/f40c2a6a/539e56d7N8976ee5f.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星G3586V配置有500万像素摄像头，轻松捕捉眼前美景，清晰的成像效果让您领略拍摄之美，更支持1080p 30fps视频播放，让您不仅可以抓取精彩瞬间，还能录制下此情此景。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t184/157/927370278/38600/f440b6c8/539e5715N5d0be55c.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:16', '2015-03-08 21:28:16');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1298447', '<center> <!-- Save for Web Slices (SIM卡安装指南.jpg) --><img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t601/342/1437805828/102739/aea4779c/54ee7f8bNff8b5b83.jpg\" width=\"750\" height=\"375\" alt=\"\" /><!-- End Save for Web Slices --> <div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t625/287/1180171482/96298/82833ac9/54b7238fN0c6d27b3.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 400px; position: relative;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t547/23/870320626/98908/f1792c49/5493c9bfNbffa7e03.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 476px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 334px; width: 442px; height: 48px; text-align: left; right: 51px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     后置平行双八百万镜头设计，搭载数十项专利的3IE算法引擎系统，具备最快0.1秒快速对焦和记录全景深信息的能力，成像分辨率可达1300万像素，带来前所未有的智能手机拍照体验     <br />    </div>    <div style=\"top: 382px; width: 442px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 51px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     拍摄时双镜头同时捕捉画面，进光量和感光面积是单镜头的两倍，有效Pixel Size     <br /> （像素尺寸）提升到1.98um（比普通手机增加60%感光度），弱光成像更清晰透亮     <br />    </div>    <div style=\"top: 415px; width: 442px; height: 16px; text-align: left; right: 51px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     单反级的独立ISP，全面提升的智像2.5专业图像处理引擎，更卓越的画质表现    </div>    <div style=\"top: 436px; width: 442px; height: 16px; text-align: left; right: 51px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     坚固的锌合金保护支架，93道主要制程工序，毫厘不差的精湛工艺尽显科技之美    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t649/254/886364023/84879/437c41e7/5493c9d2Nea4bb7ca.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 601px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 131px; width: 522px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 73px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     拍所未拍：独具F0.95数码大光圈，配合70mm到无穷远的全景深信息，拍出单反级的背景虚化照片    </div>    <div style=\"top: 154px; width: 522px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 73px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     具有超越单反的强大后处理能力，比肩光场相机的\"先拍照，后对焦\"，见所未见    </div>    <div style=\"top: 177px; width: 522px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 73px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     拍照后，可重新调整光圈大小（F0.95到F16），获得背景虚化程度不同的新照片，乃至全清晰的     <br /> EDoF（扩展景深技术）照片    </div>    <div style=\"top: 214px; width: 522px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 73px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     利用双摄像头和对焦物体之间三角测距原理，配备闭环对焦（Close-Loop Focus）马达，支持最快0.1秒极速对焦，不错过任何一个精彩瞬间    </div>    <div style=\"top: 251px; width: 522px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 73px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     基于深度信息的移轴、素描、单色等多组完全不同以往的滤镜，让照片更具可玩性    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t736/175/215603912/81323/520fde1c/549585a9N120ace65.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 511px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 128px; width: 522px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 41px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     拍摄时双镜头同时捕捉画面，进光量和感光面积是单镜头的两倍，有效Pixel Size     <br /> （像素尺寸）提升到1.98um（比普通手机增加60%感光度），弱光成像更清晰透亮    </div>    <div style=\"top: 170px; width: 522px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 41px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     通过双摄像头多重迭代曝光、3IE算法引擎的多帧降噪算法和Vision Camera技术，     <br /> 夜拍细节更清晰，让黑夜从此明亮起来    </div>    <div style=\"top: 209px; width: 522px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 41px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     超级夜景模式，采用专有的多帧定时合成算法，支持智能计算或手动设置较长的曝光     <br /> 时间，抓住人眼看不清的细节    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t460/171/860136127/181146/a2a855d7/5493c9f5Nfd6721c2.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 493px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 98px; width: 405px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 127px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     双镜头并行双工曝光，使得HDR拍照速度提升几乎一倍，拍照更快更轻松    </div>    <div style=\"top: 122px; width: 407px; height: 35px; text-align: left; right: 125px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     在逆光等光线高反差环境中，双镜头HDR能够有效降低手机抖动或拍摄对象     <br /> 运动带来的不良影响，大幅消除鬼影，成像更清晰稳定    </div>    <div style=\"top: 157px; width: 408px; height: 35px; text-align: left; right: 124px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     双镜头HDR能够有效增加照片的宽容度，极大地提升高光区域和暗部区域的     <br /> 细节呈现能力    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t589/197/874086346/296776/d00ce77a/5493ca0bN39dff3e6.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 531px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 125px; width: 339px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 283px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     EDoF熄屏快拍，熄屏状态下双击音量下键，随时随地     <br /> 极速捕获精彩瞬间    </div>    <div style=\"top: 160px; width: 340px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 282px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     地图相册，一路走，一路