0px; color: rgb(147, 147, 147); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     普通用户使用时间2.81天以上，重度用户使用时间1.25天以上    </div>    <div style=\"top: 296px; width: 345px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 30px; color: rgb(147, 147, 147); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     （按华为功耗模型测试，实际时间取决于多种因素）    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t709/10/467708974/129634/47a7b1a4/54b662ffN2d0cd3a1.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 719px; position: relative;\"></div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t634/200/867464021/117423/2ffd899a/5493ca93N6931885a.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 520px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 152px; width: 341px; height: 50px; text-align: left; right: 255px; color: rgb(172, 172, 172); line-height: 15px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     搭载超八核麒麟925芯片，集成big.LITTLE构架和     <br /> 智能八核异构算法，根据社交、游戏、视频等不同     <br /> 场景，智能调配，实现性能与功耗的平衡    </div>    <div style=\"top: 201px; width: 276px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 320px; color: rgb(172, 172, 172); line-height: 15px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     i3运动协处理器+双Sensor Hub技术，对每项传感     <br /> 器进行精密管理，响应更快，功耗更低    </div>    <div style=\"top: 239px; width: 343px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 253px; color: rgb(172, 172, 172); line-height: 15px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     GPU采用高性能Mali T628MP4，性能显著提升     <br /> 4倍，带来更佳游戏兼容性和流畅体验    </div>    <div style=\"top: 275px; width: 345px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 251px; color: rgb(172, 172, 172); line-height: 15px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     双通道3GB LPDDR3超大RAM，主频800MHz，     <br /> 多任务高效流畅，大型游戏轻松跑    </div>    <div style=\"top: 309px; width: 345px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 251px; color: rgb(172, 172, 172); line-height: 15px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     32GB eMMC5.0大容量机身存储，最大支持128GB     <br /> SD卡扩展    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t667/172/892639646/117290/27d29191/5493caacNab148dc1.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 582px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 126px; width: 392px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 204px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     独立红外遥控芯片，预置全球顶级供应商的红外码库，无需联网下载    </div>    <div style=\"top: 147px; width: 392px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 204px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     可遥控电视、机顶盒、DVD、空调等家电，匹配准确性高达99%    </div>    <div style=\"top: 168px; width: 395px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 201px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     结合强大自学习功能，红外设备一网打尽，告别各种红外遥控器    </div>    <div style=\"top: 189px; width: 397px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 199px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     支持超过950个厂商设备，支持超过10189个产品型号，可控型号相比     <br /> 智控2.0增加了17%    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t751/13/201865272/105864/c83b56e6/5493cac0Na960b07b.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 514px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 180px; width: 301px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 206px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     远距离高动态录音，采用高灵敏双mic和高动态录     <br /> 音算法，支持超过5米的高保真清晰录音    </div>    <div style=\"top: 216px; width: 302px; height: 50px; text-align: left; right: 205px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     卡拉OK2.0，50ms超短音频环回延迟，更有人声     <br /> 美化效果的特殊处理，支持KTV、小剧场、音乐厅     <br /> 3种混响效果，尽情释放音乐激情    </div>    <div style=\"top: 266px; width: 303px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 204px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     全面支持主动降噪耳机，主动降噪，闹中取静，独     <br /> 享宁静空间（*需要搭配华为主动降噪耳机使用）    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t556/176/917480251/82459/ed49699f/5493cad3N9105f2a8.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 475px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 120px; width: 494px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 86px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     移动联通双4G：双卡槽均可支持4G，支持移动/联通SIM卡混插    </div>    <div style=\"top: 139px; width: 558px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 22px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     创新性的SIM卡和SD卡复用方案，与至薄至美的外观设计相得益彰    </div>    <div style=\"top: 158px; width: 572px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 8px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     LTE Cat6最高支持300Mbps的下载速度，畅游极速4G网络    </div>    <div style=\"top: 176px; width: 572px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 8px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     比同类手机天线接收能力高3dB，信号强度加倍，在弱信号的环境下通话更稳定，上网更流畅    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t490/347/858180362/215478/6dc2424d/5493cae6Ne7dbd69e.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 848px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 149px; width: 558px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 21px; color: rgb(198, 198, 198); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     以点和圈为基本形式并贯穿始终，把信息简洁地呈现出来，圆圈与点的结合，形成EMUI 3.0     <br /> 独特的视觉语言    </div>    <div style=\"top: 186px; width: 558px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 21px; color: rgb(198, 198, 198); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     时间轴的设计，以时间为轴串起短信、通话记录、通知提醒、图库照片等，让你的历史信息清晰明了，     <br /> 操作记录有迹可循    </div>    <div style=\"top: 221px; width: 572px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 7px; color: rgb(198, 198, 198); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     3D UI主题和控件，采用先进3D 引擎实时渲染，辅以灵敏度和功耗皆领先的陀螺仪，带来细腻流畅     <br /> 的3D体验    </div>    <div style=\"top: 257px; width: 456px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 123px; color: rgb(198, 198, 198); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     熄屏快录，双击音量上键，后台迅速启动高动态录音，熄屏抢录精彩点滴    </div>    <div style=\"top: 282px; width: 456px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 123px; color: rgb(198, 198, 198); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     魅影触控，酷炫黑屏手势唤醒，支持预唤醒应用自定义    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t679/343/893510511/93955/7e884071/5493cafeNb124e333.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 553px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 129px; width: 558px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 21px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     方便的银行卡管理功能，支持空中开卡、卡信息查询、充值等便利操作    </div>    <div style=\"top: 149px; width: 558px; height: 35px; text-align: left; right: 21px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     内置的安全芯片，采用运行在芯片层级的加密算法，同时与银行开展从方案到产品的深度合作，提供满足金融支付要求的安全保护    </div>    <div style=\"top: 187px; width: 559px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 20px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     支持在带QuickPass标识的POS上刷手机免密消费，支持在招商银行ATM机办理业务，线下也能畅快使用    </div>    <div style=\"top: 211px; width: 559px; height: 37px; text-align: left; right: 20px; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     支持线上主流平台的支付方式，更有独家的\"惠生活\"特惠    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t586/14/879231946/285404/97cd8aab/5493cb10N3c9c3121.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 795px; position: relative;\">    <div style=\"top: 141px; width: 558px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 21px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     支持2.4GHz和5GHz双频WiFi，更少干扰，更快更稳定的上网体验    </div>    <div style=\"top: 167px; width: 558px; height: 30px; text-align: left; right: 21px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 15.5px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     荣耀WLAN专享免费WiFi服务再升级，国内热点增至700万，另新增覆盖全球120     <br /> 多个国家的100万个海外热点    </div>    <div style=\"top: 204px; width: 559px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 20px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     国际移动数据服务，独创海思SoftSIM技术，无需SIM卡自动接入当地运营商网络    </div>    <div style=\"top: 226px; width: 559px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 20px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     一机在手，畅游18个主要旅游国家，轻松享有国际移动数据服务    </div>    <div style=\"top: 248px; width: 559px; height: 17px; text-align: left; right: 20px; color: rgb(210, 210, 210); line-height: 14.4px; font-family: \'微软雅黑\'; font-size: 12px; position: absolute;\">     (国际WLAN、国际移动数据功能将于2015年第一季度在双4G版上提供)    </div>   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t580/86/1076847156/139160/ab1ebc2a/54add65eN49433c8e.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 862px; position: relative;\">   </div>   <div style=\"background: url(\'http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t562/110/869415910/84005/d09956f2/5494032aNd356702f.jpg\'); width: 750px; height: 1000px; position: relative;\">   </div>  </div> </center>', '2015-03-08 21:27:37', '2015-03-08 21:27:37');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1299781', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t517/95/801701967/187849/5f7c5506/5489663bNfa921223.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t706/254/121713162/262619/9cbcb7ae/54896642N245c65a1.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t712/263/124350767/166442/ee50c081/54896649N8257666e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t700/69/156014863/114976/a64c4a0/54901c88N5f170284.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t460/243/785213357/195484/fdb62eee/54896659N1af580c6.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t643/259/792761194/110422/8f985399/5489665fN3eaca0e2.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-8\" name=\"detail-tag-id-8\" text=\"产品细节\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品细节</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t463/40/1362037292/78340/c3bdef9f/54d42c3eN3c22a57e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t448/38/796593589/212792/9f143993/54896674N8b562725.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t748/221/280230574/95337/d9c8a8a2/549d1f33N5e0ae4de.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t526/1/544175806/92209/56efd399/5489669fNdc512f9d.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t508/238/793487442/45396/4bf90c14/548966a6Nbd94f002.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t556/204/808221414/135413/60132856/548966afNbe8c6cdd.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t733/92/112095702/154678/bb4dcb1b/548966daN2f7ec7cd.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:37', '2015-03-08 21:27:37');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1299917', '<table width=\"750\" align=\"center\" style=\"empty-cells: show;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"> \n <tbody> \n  <tr> \n   <td><img width=\"750\" height=\"33\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M09/09/0B/rBEhV1IBoN8IAAAAAABac9Spzg8AAB1HwLDLR8AAFqL831.jpg\" /> <br /> <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/0B/1D/rBEhVlIUd8QIAAAAAAHaxuUPMocAACU4AJZDNoAAdre886.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"248\" width=\"750\" /> <br /> \n    <div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 15px 15px 7px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"> \n     <br />1、魅族 MX4 需要使用 Micro-SIM卡,也就是通常所说的小卡。 \n     <br />2、京东商城销售的魅族品牌手机，均为全新机，非RE。 \n     <br />3、魅族手机全国联保，如您需要维修时，可到当地魅族授权服务中心维修或魅族专卖店协助送修， \n     <br /> 详情可电话联系魅族客服：400-788-3333咨询。 \n     <br /> \n    </div></td> \n  </tr> \n </tbody> \n</table> \n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\"> \n <tbody> \n  <tr> \n   <td><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M09/09/0B/rBEhVVIBoOUIAAAAAABa1mAm21MAAB1HwNfJ1sAAFru702.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"33\" width=\"750\" /></td> \n  </tr> \n </tbody> \n</table> \n<div align=\"center\"> \n <div> \n  <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t511/233/776535569/382340/f85fa237/5487a4d9N7bc55c4d.png\" alt=\"\" /> \n </div> \n <div> \n  <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t745/313/101915318/288247/a997adeb/5487a4e1Ne147a586.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n </div> \n <div> \n  <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t475/45/766876834/284708/d275b713/5487a500Ne1fbd23e.png\" alt=\"\" /> \n </div> \n <div> \n  <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t712/302/102044562/234437/67119123/5487a512N926c5431.png\" alt=\"\" /> \n </div> \n <div> \n  <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t631/111/948655792/435683/bb88488/549cbd0bNf00eb4d0.png\" alt=\"\" /> \n </div> \n <div> \n  <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t775/346/92866823/223463/366aa870/5487a5