60buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t769/342/181365019/59063/51664afa/5490f6d1N52672dee.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t592/281/842849612/75531/49492da3/5490f6d7N3dbce28f.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t664/233/847052769/141286/ead0595d/5490f6e0Na2564e6c.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:29:27', '2015-03-08 21:29:27');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1301718', '<div style=\"width:750px;margin:25px auto 10px;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/18/03/rBEhV1Jt1UQIAAAAAABjM405sxAAAEtcgFh9C8AAGNL548.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3307 智能手机 产品特色\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t514/123/938801419/49086/1968b5a/54990ba4N3a166cb4.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能操控手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t703/193/252249442/138381/fcd47735/54990ba8N7fc184c0.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 800万像素 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:50px;top:600px;color:#5f6371;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:650px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">OPPO 3007采用IMX179感光芯片，搭配SONY800万像素背照式传感器，感光面积高达1/3.2英寸，单个像素面积达1.4微米，F/2.0大光圈、5P镜头和蓝玻璃滤光片，感光更灵敏、解析力更高、有效阻隔红外光，无论白天还是夜晚，画质都更清晰。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t709/199/255687358/140077/fb069f40/54990ba9N349db764.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机 闪拍\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:45px;top:860px;color:#4e4c2e;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:650px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">凭借先进的PI2.0+，OPPO 3007推出全景深拍照功能“闪拍”，省略繁琐的对焦环节，同时按住音量加减键，黑屏状态下即可完成拍照，帮助你轻松拍摄，快速记录美好瞬间。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t586/175/889459242/176566/b6d2f0fd/54990baaNc5e13826.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机 双重曝光\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:50px;top:230px;color:#eaeaea;font-size:18px;line-height:34px;width:400px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">将两次拍照的底片重叠在一起，让“写实派”变得“艺术范”，图片如幽灵般似梦似幻，视觉效果妙不可言。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t601/233/894663634/131453/c2bb33bf/54990bacNef714808.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:45px;top:210px;color:#4e4c2e;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:650px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">每种妆彩，都蕴含一种心情和格调，美颜3.0就是要把不同的心情和状态表达出来。我们内置了6种不同的美颜模式，自然、白皙、红润……按你的心情选择美颜，拍出更美的自己。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t622/279/929179914/139606/a33f28cf/54990badN37439d2c.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:45px;top:210px;color:#4e4c2e;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:650px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">超过200天的经验积累和成长进化，作为相机大脑的PI原画引擎全新升级。体贴的平台化设计更是让相机功能变成插件，随心搭配，轻装上阵。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto 10px;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/18/03/rBEhVlJt1VEIAAAAAABntPrlt1UAAEtcgOHtM4AAGfM974.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机 产品功能\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t652/123/914138558/137235/f060f2a9/54990bafNf45262c6.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:45px;top:600px;color:#fff;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:650px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">OPPO 3007背部采用经典的波点纹理设计，实现精确的0.5毫米原点压纹，经过10道印刷，立体成型，表面喷涂耐划伤UV予以保护，最终成就通透立体的3D纹理效果，大气中蕴含细腻。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t592/240/952934218/302387/b8ce9d01/54990df7N95b81d54.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:45px;top:200px;color:#4e4c2e;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:650px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">OPPO 3007使用和iPhone 6一样恰到好处的4.7英寸，再加上专门为3007打造的背侧面弧形过渡，手机自然地贴合手掌，轻轻一握，手感难以言喻。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t613/250/908456843/92698/4f514a66/54990bb0N6a5788d6.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:45px;top:250px;color:#fff;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:410px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">OPPO 3007内置新一代智能遥控2.0+，支持与红外接收设备的传输协议，遥控家里电视、空调等支持红外协议的家用电器。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t586/177/921208795/56009/aa777333/54990bb1N59bb0e05.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:440px;top:90px;color:#4e4c2e;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:300px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">新一代智能遥控2.0+，完美延续前两代智能遥控的学习功能，遥控知识一学就会，让您面对万千电器，都能够做到全能操控，随心所欲。同时新增节目导航功能，与电视机顶盒匹配后，便能让你随时随地联网查看电视节目表，直接锁定最钟爱的电视节目，追剧追影，无往不利。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t502/104/928063236/108403/513cfcfc/54990bb1N95be1ba2.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:45px;top:210px;color:#4e4c2e;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:650px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">OPPO 3007支持全新的NFC功能，使用NFC支付、刷公交卡、打印照片、分享文件、连接音响，轻轻一碰，即可完成。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t547/72/907059110/140603/4738157f/54990bb2N7c6ce521.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:45px;top:210px;color:#4e4c2e;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:650px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">采用5V-2A充电器，并依托OPPO在充电领域的深厚积淀，OPPO 3007可在90分钟快速满电，比一般充电速度快60%，让你告别漫长等待。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t613/252/915063446/40634/2f30c1a5/54990bb3Na30dc145.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:45px;top:210px;color:#4e4c2e;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:400px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">OPPO 3007搭载高通骁龙64位处理器，强劲的4核心，主频1.2GHz，完美应对各类大型游戏，更快的运行速度，更流畅的操控体验。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t751/240/260150088/96330/e9e918e6/54990bb4Nf4f7fbfe.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:440px;top:190px;color:#4e4c2e;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:320px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">全新通讯网络时代，OPPO 3007支持最新的4G网络。内置双卡+T卡卡槽，手机可随时保持双卡双待状态，工作生活两不误。</p> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t448/316/910180825/160179/6ffeb17c/54990bb7Ncb05e0ce.jpg\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" /> \n <p style=\"position:absolute;left:45px;top:210px;color:#4e4c2e;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;width:650px;font-family:Microsoft YaHei;\">全球2000万用户的共同选择，优化视觉与层级方案，整合黑屏、隔空等多种手势操作，新增屏幕悬停、自由截屏，带来更轻、更快的操作体验。更有心情点唱机、O-Video等趣味亮点，点点惊喜，好玩入手，体贴入心。</p> \n</div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:16', '2015-03-08 21:28:16');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1301767', '<div style=\"width:750px;margin:10px auto 10px;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t547/167/1267623265/38696/d3ff27f/54c0c04eN53870228.png\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:10px auto 10px;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/18/03/rBEhV1Jt1UQIAAAAAABjM405sxAAAEtcgFh9C8AAGNL548.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t517/282/1058589953/300204/69f57d09/54ab438bN4efff911.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t622/117/1066789964/247785/2c94c7fb/54ab438bNece50a1e.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t649/112/1076381831/305185/80698fff/54ab438cN9fdae8c8.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t739/76/389578429/283848/d7a2492f/54ab438dNe89ff1a2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t739/77/386168396/288181/a4d7b224/54ab438eN70ab9fae.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:10px auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t181/64/712245458/46545/8be80232/5396d6c9Ncefc663a.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t577/198/974773245/66403/11794cf2/54c0d724N335d2ae9.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t163/300/700753165/84594/8aba03cb/5396d702Nc81524d2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t202/300/713056590/71974/326fdd23/5396d70fNa1411fad.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t190/203/716197260/110533/8718af4e/5396d71eNc70a7e34.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:10px auto;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/18/03/rBEhVlJt1VEIAAAAAABntPrlt1UAAEtcgOHtM4AAGfM974.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t184/305/719857138/50766/24264b4e/5396d72eN105b274a.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"text-align:center;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:370px;left:168px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">1/3.06英寸Sony感光元器件，感光度更高，暗光下也能出色发挥</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t151/83/719782690/61158/be412c5a/5396d73eNf15b109a.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t193/70/713510346/18218/83c99239/5396d74fN893d2302.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"text-align:center;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:195px;left:180px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">增加镜头透光率，减少偏差成像更精确</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t202/72/740078314/49733/45ca0cf6/5396d762N863e274d.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t190/342/734628249/29132/c0b9e6d/5396d770N1bf5893e.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:135px;left:180px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">比普通镜头多一片镜头，<br />拍出真实的世界</p> \n </div> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:135px;left:405px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">进光量更大，照片亮度更高</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t670/185/1230786827/201688/d1cae0b0/54be3722Ne9c27f23.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:280px;left:60px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">N1 mini 搭载OPPO核心影像技术——PI原画引擎2.0，<br /> 实现更精准的对焦、更智慧的曝光、更准确的色彩平衡；<br />画面真实还原，带给你所见即所得的极致拍照体验。</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t178/147/713911490/87297/1426d89a/5396d791N59f982c2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:255px;left:60px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">N1 mini 通过PI2.0技术从连续六张照片中抽取最好部分，<br />合成一张2400万像素的超高清照片，<br />纤毫毕现，画质从不止于摄像头。</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t160/150/740392608/221421/d511d61f/5396d7a9Nde0b7f09.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t190/118/743435237/104687/e1a7321f/5396d7c2N21f787f3.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:255px;left:60px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">N1 mini 放大拍照自动开启超级变焦模式，<br />4倍无损变焦，细节更震撼，放大依旧清晰。</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t208/249/733379655/78088/a6973b59/5396d7dbNcb6ed4ca.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t205/46/739103092/178585/36a62d89/5396d7ecN49f8b174.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:255px;left:60px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">N1 mini 通过智能多帧择优合成算法，能有效清除噪点、提升照片亮度和色彩饱和度。<br />不再受制于黑夜，让夜拍也能明晰动人。<br />* 图片由N1 mini拍摄于北京银河SOHO</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t199/180/747976478/200792/ef6e1193/5396d7ffN237bd1a2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t193/27/743582081/203623/912e97cf/5396d80fN18fbdaae.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t166/298/745118699/150245/5a70e5ea/5396d820N24a1c849.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"text-align:center;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:10px;left:170px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">N1 mini 将屏幕浓缩至5.0英寸，轻松掌控的同时，让你携带更方便。<br />150g的机身重量，更轻盈，更精致。</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t166/323/709835789/95088/8e9e7202/5396d830Nd1f73554.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t178/79/702500536/74689/3f03873/5396d842Nb4e93db7.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"text-align:center;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:10px;left:190px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">双线缠绕，独具简洁时尚的曲线美。珠光白底漆，闪亮通透；<br />独特香槟金，精致耀目；点点滴滴只为与你更相配。</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t178/103/748246105/34626/682d43/5396d853N2aa60291.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t205/247/741993982/83133/d6560aad/5396d864N7c809d9b.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"text-align:center;color:#f67c64;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:205px;left:265px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">雪晶白，清柠黄，冰幻蓝。<br />N1 mini 向世界秀出个性多彩的你。</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t175/201/759346375/29391/88255f4c/5396d878Nfe014894.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:255px;left:60px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">N1 mini 完美支持移动4G网络，前所未有的畅快上网体验，上传下载即刻完成。<br />用N1 mini，百兆网速，任你驰骋，随时随地看直播。</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t163/358/1120256270/89300/cd5cdcd5/53a2be73Nbd6ba558.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:12px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:475px;left:70px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">备注：在网络环境支持下，最高下载速度达100Mbps</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t175/360/736782206/150595/9f24eea/5396d8d4N67f64a99.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:280px;left:60px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">N1 mini 涵盖了更多的趣味拍照软件，让照片妙趣横生，<br />把你生活中的点滴小事变成故事；<br />有了N1 mini，你的生活更加丰富多彩;<br />带上N1 mini趣味相机去拍吧！</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t208/329/720645993/258623/8440bfaa/5396d8e7N8d535c95.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t172/244/741904730/66749/962947d1/5396d8f7Nd6257a02.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:160px;left:60px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">极致美颜，极致提升。美颜3.0清晰记录美的瞬间，让每一张自拍照片都完美无瑕。</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t205/156/726515760/206913/1d164e9c/5396d905N7f19b521.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:335px;left:60px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">N1 mini 慢速快门华丽升级，支持32秒超长曝光时间。<br />抓住时光穿梭，留下动感光影。</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t145/228/703314030/52397/79ab982c/5396d914N39756fe5.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:165px;left:188px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">让照片加上你的印记</p> \n </div> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:150px;left:564px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">动态图片串联瞬间，<br />乐拍生活</p> \n </div> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:505px;left:188px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">嵌入语音留住快乐心情</p> \n </div> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:470px;left:560px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">O-Band + N1 mini <br />释放双手，<br />发挥奇思妙想<br />*注：O-Band需另外购买</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t151/223/708232974/120951/dcfca36e/5396d94aNaa87a25c.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:285px;left:60px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">N1 mini 搭载全新升级的Color OS 1.4，<br />加入更多令人怦然心动的未来科技。<br />N1 mini 不仅是你智在生活的工具，<br />更是你智能贴心的伴侣。</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t145/258/757703989/22297/e29d7d6b/5396d927Nc4d04f11.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:155px;left:60px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">智能启动。自定义你的手势，黑屏状态下划出特定手势即可启动指定应用。<br />操作更快速更方便。</p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t148/165/736558575/70971/aeda53bc/5396d95bNfb2837d0.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t145/27/941324607/121988/4f22cb9d/539ec354N4683277e.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;position:absolute;top:155px;left:60px;font-family:\'微软雅黑\';\"> \n  <p style=\"margin:0;padding:2px 0;\">贴心设计，不需要触摸屏幕，在手机上方挥手即解锁；<br /></p> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div style=\"width:750px;margin:0 auto 150px;position:relative;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t184/175/726430716/112052/72408900/5396d982N7a9697f2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:10', '2015-03-08 21:28:10');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1301772', '	<div style=\"margin: 25px auto 10px; width: 750px;\">&nbsp; <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3307 智能手机 产品特色\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/18/03/rBEhV1Jt1UQIAAAAAABjM405sxAAAEtcgFh9C8AAGNL548.jpg\" /> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能操控手机\" src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t514/123/938801419/49086/1968b5a/54990ba4N3a166cb4.jpg\" /> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 800万像素 智能手机\" src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t703/193/252249442/138381/fcd47735/54990ba8N7fc184c0.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 50px; top: 600px; width: 650px; color: rgb(95, 99, 113); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">OPPO 3007采用IMX179感光芯片，搭配SONY800万像素背照式传感器，感光面积高达1/3.2英寸，单个像素面积达1.4微米，F/2.0大光圈、5P镜头和蓝玻璃滤光片，感光更灵敏、解析力更高、有效阻隔红外光，无论白天还是夜晚，画质都更清晰。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机 闪拍\" src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t709/199/255687358/140077/fb069f40/54990ba9N349db764.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 45px; top: 860px; width: 650px; color: rgb(78, 76, 46); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">凭借先进的PI2.0+，OPPO 3007推出全景深拍照功能“闪拍”，省略繁琐的对焦环节，同时按住音量加减键，黑屏状态下即可完成拍照，帮助你轻松拍摄，快速记录美好瞬间。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机 双重曝光\" src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t586/175/889459242/176566/b6d2f0fd/54990baaNc5e13826.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 50px; top: 230px; width: 400px; color: rgb(234, 234, 234); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 18px; position: absolute;\">将两次拍照的底片重叠在一起，让“写实派”变得“艺术范”，图片如幽灵般似梦似幻，视觉效果妙不可言。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t601/233/894663634/131453/c2bb33bf/54990bacNef714808.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 45px; top: 210px; width: 650px; color: rgb(78, 76, 46); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">每种妆彩，都蕴含一种心情和格调，美颜3.0就是要把不同的心情和状态表达出来。我们内置了6种不同的美颜模式，自然、白皙、红润……按你的心情选择美颜，拍出更美的自己。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t622/279/929179914/139606/a33f28cf/54990badN37439d2c.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 45px; top: 210px; width: 650px; color: rgb(78, 76, 46); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">超过200天的经验积累和成长进化，作为相机大脑的PI原画引擎全新升级。体贴的平台化设计更是让相机功能变成插件，随心搭配，轻装上阵。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto 10px; width: 750px;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机 产品功能\" src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M00/18/03/rBEhVlJt1VEIAAAAAABntPrlt1UAAEtcgOHtM4AAGfM974.jpg\" /> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t652/123/914138558/137235/f060f2a9/54990bafNf45262c6.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 45px; top: 600px; width: 650px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">OPPO 3007背部采用经典的波点纹理设计，实现精确的0.5毫米原点压纹，经过10道印刷，立体成型，表面喷涂耐划伤UV予以保护，最终成就通透立体的3D纹理效果，大气中蕴含细腻。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t592/240/952934218/302387/b8ce9d01/54990df7N95b81d54.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 45px; top: 200px; width: 650px; color: rgb(78, 76, 46); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">OPPO 3007使用和iPhone 6一样恰到好处的4.7英寸，再加上专门为3007打造的背侧面弧形过渡，手机自然地贴合手掌，轻轻一握，手感难以言喻。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t613/250/908456843/92698/4f514a66/54990bb0N6a5788d6.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 45px; top: 250px; width: 410px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">OPPO 3007内置新一代智能遥控2.0+，支持与红外接收设备的传输协议，遥控家里电视、空调等支持红外协议的家用电器。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" src=\"http://img13.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t586/177/921208795/56009/aa777333/54990bb1N59bb0e05.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 440px; top: 90px; width: 300px; color: rgb(78, 76, 46); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">新一代智能遥控2.0+，完美延续前两代智能遥控的学习功能，遥控知识一学就会，让您面对万千电器，都能够做到全能操控，随心所欲。同时新增节目导航功能，与电视机顶盒匹配后，便能让你随时随地联网查看电视节目表，直接锁定最钟爱的电视节目，追剧追影，无往不利。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t502/104/928063236/108403/513cfcfc/54990bb1N95be1ba2.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 45px; top: 210px; width: 650px; color: rgb(78, 76, 46); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">OPPO 3007支持全新的NFC功能，使用NFC支付、刷公交卡、打印照片、分享文件、连接音响，轻轻一碰，即可完成。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t547/72/907059110/140603/4738157f/54990bb2N7c6ce521.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 45px; top: 210px; width: 650px; color: rgb(78, 76, 46); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">采用5V-2A充电器，并依托OPPO在充电领域的深厚积淀，OPPO 3007可在90分钟快速满电，比一般充电速度快60%，让你告别漫长等待。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" src=\"http://img12.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t613/252/915063446/40634/2f30c1a5/54990bb3Na30dc145.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 45px; top: 210px; width: 400px; color: rgb(78, 76, 46); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">OPPO 3007搭载高通骁龙64位处理器，强劲的4核心，主频1.2GHz，完美应对各类大型游戏，更快的运行速度，更流畅的操控体验。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" src=\"http://img14.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t751/240/260150088/96330/e9e918e6/54990bb4Nf4f7fbfe.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 440px; top: 190px; width: 320px; color: rgb(78, 76, 46); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">全新通讯网络时代，OPPO 3007支持最新的4G网络。内置双卡+T卡卡槽，手机可随时保持双卡双待状态，工作生活两不误。</p> </div> <div style=\"margin: 0px auto; width: 750px; position: relative;\">  <img title=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" alt=\"OPPO 3007 智能手机\" src=\"http://img11.360buyimg.com/cms/jfs/t448/316/910180825/160179/6ffeb17c/54990bb7Ncb05e0ce.jpg\" />  <p style=\"left: 45px; top: 210px; width: 650px; color: rgb(78, 76, 46); line-height: 34px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei; font-size: 20px; position: absolute;\">全球2000万用户的共同选择，优化视觉与层级方案，整合黑屏、隔空等多种手势操作，新增屏幕悬停、自由截屏，带来更轻、更快的操作体验。更有心情点唱机、O-Video等趣味亮点，点点惊喜，好玩入手，体贴入心。</p> </div>', '2015-03-08 21:29:12', '2015-03-08 21:29:12');
