INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1307796', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品信息</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M05/14/0F/rBEhU1L7PXQIAAAAAACrU89nKioAAIdqQPw-MsAAKtr479.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><table class=\"                                                                                                                                                         \" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" width=\"750\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><div style=\"padding: 5px 5px 5px 7px; line-height: 1.5em; font-size: 14px;\">               <span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\">尊敬的顾客：<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 在选购手机的同时可参加京东商城与中国电信合作推出购机送话费活动（新入网用户）：该手机属于电信定制机，3G网络制式为电信CDMA2000，您只需点击“购机入网送话费”按钮加入购物车选择套餐、赠费档位、号码后即可享受当地电信的高额话费赠送，订单提交后京东相关人员会为您办理入网，手机和号卡一同配送，具体赠费明细可加入购物车后查看：</span>              </div></td>            </tr>            <tr>             <td align=\"center\">&nbsp;</td>             <td align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.360buy.com/knowledge/1-55-1449.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"err-product\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g10/M00/17/05/rBEQWFFxNNkIAAAAAAA4vfAW_P4AAEh1wKE4W0AADjV789.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"57\" width=\"252\" /></a></span></td>            </tr>           </tbody>          </table>                  <div class=\"formwork_img\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 23px;\">          <span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size: 14px;\"><br /></span>          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img class=\"err-product\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/jgsq-productsoa/g14/M05/1A/10/rBEhVlJ7aQwIAAAAAAG1EouAC-gAAFLowP9is0AAbUq864.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"250\" width=\"730\" /></span>          <br />          <div style=\"text-align: right;\">           <span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>           <span style=\"font-family:\'Microsoft YaHei\';\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:10px;\">注：选择购机入网送话费的方式购买合约，话费为赠品不开具发票</span></span>          </div>         </div><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>产品功能</span><span class=\"s2\">Product Function</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">清新时尚外观设计 雅致淡然 如影随形</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星G3509I以雅然成趣的清新外形配以精湛工艺，呈现纤薄时尚的视觉美感。其符合人体力学的设计让握感更为舒适，便于一手掌握，更因其纤巧造型可随身携带，与您如影随形。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g14/M07/0F/17/rBEhV1L7PnAIAAAAAACoF7ZekcIAAIkOALfuzcAAKgv039.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">4.3英寸大显示屏 大视界 优画质</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星G3509I配置4.3英寸高分辨率显示屏，画质清晰、色彩真实，纤毫毕现的细节呈现给您以视觉舒适感。其4.3英寸的显示屏让您无论是网上冲浪还是观看视频，均享广阔视界。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g15/M03/05/00/rBEhWlL7PpEIAAAAAABdHvo8x7kAAIb7QOYEGUAAF02192.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">双核1.2GHz强劲处理器 性能强劲 流畅自如</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星G3509I搭载双核1.2GHz处理器，支持多任务处理，无论是页面加载还是应用启动，都更加快捷流畅，全方位满足您多任务的操作需求。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M09/14/0F/rBEhVFL7PrEIAAAAAACwIzjjeUgAAIdrQGxwY8AALA7199.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_titlecenter\">Android?4.3智能操作系统 灵敏触控 疾速体验</div><div class=\"formwork_text\">三星G3509I内置Android?4.3智能操作系统，为您带来灵敏的触控体验和更简洁的用户界面，让您的各项操作都得心应手。</div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/g13/M00/14/0F/rBEhU1L7PskIAAAAAACrWeQi-wgAAIdrgHzBLcAAKtx291.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork_bt\"><div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\"><span>温馨提示</span><span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_text\">* Android为谷歌公司商标。* G3509I为CDMA2000网络终端,仅国际漫游时支持GSM。</div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:30:57', '2015-03-08 21:30:57');
