INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1327056', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t511/6/1262516976/554897/7bd909d1/54c5a2a5Nb03bac6b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t448/122/1157990259/165308/d26c6dc7/54b6295eNc2af5f6e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">什么是短波蓝光？短波蓝光（波长380nm-450nm）是来自于各种屏幕中的一种可见光，科学研究表明，短波蓝光波长短、能量高，会对眼睛、身体健康造成损害，造成各种&ldquo;蓝光病&rdquo;，是时候警惕蓝光了。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t742/172/607581838/156702/238db1b0/54c5a332Nca7838eb.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">看得见的蓝光 看不见的伤害！你还在忽视身边的蓝光病？长时间面对各种屏幕，你是否感到眼睛红肿、眼酸流泪、眼睛干涩、头痛头晕？这正是&ldquo;蓝光病&rdquo;的症状。而被短波蓝光长时间照射后，会造成危害最大的一种&ldquo;蓝光病&rdquo;--黄斑病，这种眼科疾病一旦发生，往往不可逆转。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t472/151/1258740414/101964/9df2028f/54c5a568N463df403.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t532/24/1147308893/226599/21291e58/54b62d59Na7f830d0.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">你还在忽视孩子脆弱的视力？由于孩子的水晶体清澈透明，无法滤掉蓝光，故孩童接触屏幕时，大约60-70%的短波蓝光直射孩子的视网膜，造成每年约有三百万幼童戴上眼镜。世卫组织WHO 爱眼协会公布：2006年至2008年因蓝光、辐射每年导致全球超过30000人失明，并在2009年底发出橙色预警：&ldquo;蓝光、辐射对人类的潜在隐性威胁将远远超过苏丹红、三聚氰胺、SASI、HINI的破坏性，无形中吞噬人的双眼。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t466/94/1290214282/232786/3880afe5/54c5a72fN29cc1388.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">面对蓝光伤害 我们怎么办？飞利浦专利舒视蓝 真正呵护双眸健康 飞利浦经过数年研发，前沿专利舒视蓝，用独一无二的发光二极管技术，改变了短波蓝光强度峰值分布，使得峰值波长从444nm变为460nm，从而能净化90%以上的短波蓝光产生，真正保护双眸。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t556/99/1397161897/270017/33553865/54d42628N7763a108.gif\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">实验证明 真正护眼 实验证明，飞利浦专利舒视蓝，能真正从源头解决蓝光危害问题，真正杜绝短波蓝光危害，健康护眼！</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t589/274/1145022013/367744/5f1455e/54b63011N4a3a758b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">亮度不减 色彩靓丽 飞利浦前沿专利舒视蓝，在净化了90%以上的短波蓝光（波长380-450nm）伤害，保护双眼的同时，使得亮度不减，色彩保真，为您呈现更贴近真实世界的颜色。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t544/192/1273554431/287485/3c6be223/54c5e69dN68e4292a.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t502/335/1297616946/351313/ae69641b/54c5e6ffNa83aea38.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">运算加速 画质更靓 飞利浦锐腾核芯引擎，带来不可思议的清晰度。画面的每个像素值均被修正，更好地匹配周围的像素，从而产生真实自然的画面。您最终将感受到高清晰度、真实细节、生动色彩、卓越对比度以及流畅动感的独特完美统一。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t544/272/1303907762/251705/d848f9db/54c5e71eN7fa5fb1f.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">1080P全高清 卓越享受 全高清1920&times;1080液晶屏分辨率，带来高清晰度影像，使电视画面细节真实还原，一览无余。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t472/206/1174548133/346025/17344c48/54b632c1N07fd2ce6.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">优化画质 身临其境 飞利浦先进的4大画质处理技术带来更高水准的色彩、对比度和清晰度，呈现非凡画质和性能，让每一个画面，都宛如真境。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t739/74/609902273/200288/ef49336/54c5e77dNf5b70578.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">八核引擎 迅捷精彩 采用先进八核处理器&mdash;&mdash;高效利用四核CPU运算，后台运行速度更快；四核（GPU*2+VPU*2）显著提升图形渲染能力，使得画面更加清晰、色彩还原更加逼真。通过八核处理，畅快淋漓的完美视效瞬间跃然眼前。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t742/195/620165347/312144/36877135/54c5e83dN80e740fe.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">360&deg;环绕 震撼心灵 飞利浦不断开创领先业界的音频技术，运用超宽环绕立体声、晶晰声效，创造层次丰富的立体声和环绕音效，令您欣赏到无与伦比的强劲音效，感受身临其境般的虚拟环绕立体声。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t697/348/490960042/328482/c3a7329d/54b63713N498ee3b7.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">采用市场主流智能开放式平台 拥有更好的兼容性和稳定性 飞利浦应用商城 飞利浦专为电视定制的海量应用系统，给您丰富精彩地应用体验。无论您是游戏控、炒股王、音乐狂还是社交达人，都能找到至爱。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t592/98/1132019546/311551/3b240a7/54b637d0N08c3b05f.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">ICNTV在线视频 ICNTV内容平台拥有海量正版视频资讯，每日更新片库，为您提供最全最酷的影视资讯和新闻内容。 </div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t592/293/1172557013/264489/a1c1fd48/54b638b3N59c0f64e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">完美支持 影片本地播放 飞利浦PFF5650系列拥有强悍的本地视频播放能力，只需将U盘或移动硬盘连接电视，即可播放其中存储的内容，支持几乎所有流行格式，如 MKV、AVI、MP4、MOV、RMVB等。多功能接口 全面满足需求 飞利浦PFF5650系列正面和侧面共有1个HDMI高清接口、2个USB接口，以及VGA、AV输入，AV、数字音频输出、以太网等必备接口，帮助你连接电脑、音箱、游戏机等各种影音设备。</div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-33\" name=\"detail-tag-id-33\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t475/362/1193067584/271208/b24c88a6/54b63a2dN0f27f85b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t760/319/478217889/219231/8418cad1/54b63ac0Na1f90212.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-36\" name=\"detail-tag-id-36\" text=\"尺寸信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>尺寸信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Size Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t514/356/1140517979/48656/14457812/54b63ae6N305b9047.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-38\" name=\"detail-tag-id-38\" text=\"售后服务\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>售后服务</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">After-Sales Service</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t634/244/759226018/152469/4322fedb/5486c674N8b19a100.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t691/97/1142956686/243333/6c949e97/54b63b71N349d51bb.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-41\" name=\"detail-tag-id-41\" text=\"品牌荣誉\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌荣誉</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Awards</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t664/74/1176206138/366588/a39b270c/54b63bb5N8343c2ed.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-43\" name=\"detail-tag-id-43\" text=\"温馨提示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>温馨提示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t631/85/1151635236/772674/bfbf7497/54b63beaNe407c3a0.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:45', '2015-03-08 21:27:45');
