oducts Exhibition</span>   </div>  </div> <div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t643/227/1375730137/147951/9a06a489/54d1bf7fNa8bbe63b.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t775/355/701692228/76450/6605578/54d1bf8dN965914f8.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t535/216/1373170532/38181/13fcae75/54d1bf9bNb43deca2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div>    <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-24\" name=\"detail-tag-id-24\" text=\"产品信息\">   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">    <span>产品信息</span>    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>   </div>  </div> <div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t511/262/1348594715/43332/9205ed58/54d1bfbdN1f746adb.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t688/184/1388301415/48482/56885c03/54d1bfc9N7b058d60.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t463/194/1362494247/37696/e1203bd9/54d1bfdaNc34ffd6c.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t700/131/705072803/53744/d4e570f1/54d1bfe9N44d27bbf.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t523/30/1373287043/42719/3aaa51bf/54d1bff7N7319ea13.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div><div class=\"formwork\"><div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t646/163/1347369698/55487/6f11981/54d1c00aN89ca9998.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div></div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:28:44', '2015-03-08 21:28:44');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1331405', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t595/144/1168476288/333107/906761a4/54b8de77N58a1e4ba.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t745/235/508131267/165135/ec605553/54b8de98N8d2cf53e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">什么是短波蓝光？短波蓝光（波长380nm-450nm）是来自于各种屏幕中的一种可见光，科学研究表明，短波蓝光波长短、能量高，会对眼睛、身体健康造成损害，造成各种&ldquo;蓝光病&rdquo;，是时候警惕蓝光了。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t460/103/1214690983/251742/492fac1a/54bc5cfbN7030e227.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">看得见的蓝光 看不见的伤害！你还在忽视身边的蓝光病？长时间面对各种屏幕，你是否感到眼睛红肿、眼酸流泪、眼睛干涩、头痛头晕？这正是&ldquo;蓝光病&rdquo;的症状。而被短波蓝光长时间照射后，会造成危害最大的一种&ldquo;蓝光病&rdquo;--黄斑病，这种眼科疾病一旦发生，往往不可逆转。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t670/116/1205988487/232409/f01fd576/54bc5d5eNd81c476a.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">你还在忽视孩子脆弱的视力？由于孩子的水晶体清澈透明，无法滤掉蓝光，故孩童接触屏幕时，大约60-70%的短波蓝光直射孩子的视网膜，造成每年约有三百万幼童戴上眼镜。世卫组织WHO 爱眼协会公布：2006年至2008年因蓝光、辐射每年导致全球超过30000人失明，并在2009年底发出橙色预警：&ldquo;蓝光、辐射对人类的潜在隐性威胁将远远超过苏丹红、三聚氰胺、SASI、HINI的破坏性，无形中吞噬人的双眼。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t751/217/525511594/233895/f9c2eb65/54bc5db8N35780618.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">面对蓝光伤害 我们怎么办？飞利浦专利舒视蓝真正呵护双眸健康 飞利浦经过数年研发，前沿专利舒视蓝，用独一无二的背光源发光鳞粉，改变了短波蓝光强度峰值分布，使得峰值波长从444nm变为460nm，从而能净化90%以上的短波蓝光产生，真正保护双眸。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t550/187/1359615817/157110/14fd7e1c/54bc5df0Ne1731e84.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">实验证明，飞利浦专利舒视蓝，能真正从源头解决蓝光危害问题，真正杜绝短波蓝光危害，健康护眼！</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t550/11/1355945085/367744/c9e8beef/54b78efdNd141fb76.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">亮度不减 色彩靓丽 飞利浦前沿专利舒视蓝，在净化了90%以上的短波蓝光（波长380-450nm）伤害，保护双眼的同时，使得亮度不减，色彩保真，为您呈现更贴近真实世界的颜色。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t628/266/923794274/287485/75692b56/54bc5e7dNadf81ddf.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t670/225/1166969406/347426/5d577790/54b8ca2aNed12b9a7.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">运算加速 画质更靓 飞利浦锐腾核芯引擎，带来不可思议的清晰度。画面的每个像素值均被修正，更好地匹配周围的像素，从而产生真实自然的画面。您最终将感受到高清晰度、真实细节、生动色彩、卓越对比度以及流畅动感的独特完美统一。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t526/29/884995310/246183/af96bcdb/54b8ca80N6f76e942.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">1080P全高清 卓越享受 全高清1920&times;1080液晶屏分辨率，带来高清晰度影像，使电视画面细节真实还原，一览无余。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t490/27/1225907384/346175/b44b5f3c/54b8cae5N07aa1f4a.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">优化画质 身临其境 飞利浦先进的4大画质处理技术带来更高水准的色彩、对比度和清晰度，呈现非凡画质和性能，让每一个画面，都宛如真境。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t667/252/1252661917/200288/ef49336/54c5e793N52907d67.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">八核引擎 迅捷精彩 采用先进八核处理器&mdash;&mdash;高效利用四核CPU运算，后台运行速度更快；四核(GPU*2+VPU*2)显著提升图形渲染能力，使得画面更加清晰、色彩还原更加逼真。通过八核处理，畅快淋漓的完美视效瞬间跃然眼前。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t505/193/1193643592/308595/ac86452c/54b8cb83Nc55f4f45.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">360&deg;环绕 震撼心灵 飞利浦不断开创领先业界的音频技术，运用超宽环绕立体声、晶晰声效，创造层次丰富的立体声和环绕音效，令您欣赏到无与伦比的强劲音效，感受身临其境般的虚拟环绕立体声。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t451/242/1159278808/328482/868e49f6/54b8cbc0N3c4ee13d.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">采用市场主流智能开放式平台 拥有更好的兼容性和稳定性 飞利浦应用商城 飞利浦专为电视定制的海量应用系统，给您丰富精彩地应用体验。无论您是游戏控、炒股王、音乐狂还是社交达人，都能找到至爱。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t508/104/1158482977/311551/a472e734/54b8cbf6Nf09a6271.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">ICNTV在线视频 ICNTV内容平台拥有海量正版视频资讯，每日更新片库，为您提供最全最酷的影视资讯和新闻内容。 </div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-30\" name=\"detail-tag-id-30\" text=\"产品细节\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品细节</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t718/336/494160931/264472/ce04037f/54b8cc85Nd331e2b3.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-32\" name=\"detail-tag-id-32\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t727/64/545211349/271226/2d9acc8/54bc606cNa1cea66e.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t676/70/903901596/219231/d7f64ff0/54bc607fN9e86aa63.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-35\" name=\"detail-tag-id-35\" text=\"尺寸信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>尺寸信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Size Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t646/238/1175427399/48505/1abd3e0e/54bc60b2Nfaf833e6.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-37\" name=\"detail-tag-id-37\" text=\"售后服务\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>售后服务</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">After-Sales Service</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t634/244/759226018/152469/4322fedb/5486c674N8b19a100.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t577/48/887522791/136622/97640ed/54b7737fNfb2b2896.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-40\" name=\"detail-tag-id-40\" text=\"品牌荣誉\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌荣誉</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Awards</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t634/328/1127691108/379085/56854286/54b72d39N4f284116.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-42\" name=\"detail-tag-id-42\" text=\"温馨提示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>温馨提示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t742/324/521601438/772674/af01fb0b/54b8ce2cN65b50736.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:45', '2015-03-08 21:27:45');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1331411', '<div class=\"content_tpl\"><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-0\" name=\"detail-tag-id-0\" text=\"产品信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t775/277/509633460/333058/a6d57710/54b8c7eeN53852381.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-2\" name=\"detail-tag-id-2\" text=\"产品特色\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品特色</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Selling Point</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t451/268/1183460822/165308/b2460188/54b78d7eN5b335fe6.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">什么是短波蓝光？短波蓝光（波长380nm-450nm）是来自于各种屏幕中的一种可见光，科学研究表明，短波蓝光波长短、能量高，会对眼睛、身体健康造成损害，造成各种&ldquo;蓝光病&rdquo;，是时候警惕蓝光了。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t541/285/1160308399/249321/56743d80/54b78dd6N6e8a1abb.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">看得见的蓝光 看不见的伤害！你还在忽视身边的蓝光病？长时间面对各种屏幕，你是否感到眼睛红肿、眼酸流泪、眼睛干涩、头痛头晕？这正是&ldquo;蓝光病&rdquo;的症状。而被短波蓝光长时间照射后，会造成危害最大的一种&ldquo;蓝光病&rdquo;--黄斑病，这种眼科疾病一旦发生，往往不可逆转。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t682/313/1164376290/226599/a0d4c106/54b78e59N30fee94b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">你还在忽视孩子脆弱的视力？由于孩子的水晶体清澈透明，无法滤掉蓝光，故孩童接触屏幕时，大约60-70%的短波蓝光直射孩子的视网膜，造成每年约有三百万幼童戴上眼镜。世卫组织WHO 爱眼协会公布：2006年至2008年因蓝光、辐射每年导致全球超过30000人失明，并在2009年底发出橙色预警：&ldquo;蓝光、辐射对人类的潜在隐性威胁将远远超过苏丹红、三聚氰胺、SASI、HINI的破坏性，无形中吞噬人的双眼。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t610/4/1193999263/135536/2684cbdd/54b78eafN2179ae33.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">面对蓝光伤害 我们怎么办？飞利浦专利舒视蓝真正呵护双眸健康 飞利浦经过数年研发，前沿专利舒视蓝，用独一无二的背光源发光鳞粉，改变了短波蓝光强度峰值分布，使得峰值波长从444nm变为460nm，从而能净化90%以上的短波蓝光产生，真正保护双眸。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t721/14/508747662/157110/f07f07d7/54b8c2b1N7bbaac0d.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">实验证明，飞利浦专利舒视蓝，能真正从源头解决蓝光危害问题，真正杜绝短波蓝光危害，健康护眼！</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t550/11/1355945085/367744/c9e8beef/54b78efdNd141fb76.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">亮度不减 色彩靓丽 飞利浦前沿专利舒视蓝，在净化了90%以上的短波蓝光（波长380-450nm）伤害，保护双眼的同时，使得亮度不减，色彩保真，为您呈现更贴近真实世界的颜色。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t490/159/1185716494/287485/d98194f5/54b8c9bcN00806dd7.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t670/225/1166969406/347426/5d577790/54b8ca2aNed12b9a7.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">运算加速 画质更靓 飞利浦锐腾核芯引擎，带来不可思议的清晰度。画面的每个像素值均被修正，更好地匹配周围的像素，从而产生真实自然的画面。您最终将感受到高清晰度、真实细节、生动色彩、卓越对比度以及流畅动感的独特完美统一。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t526/29/884995310/246183/af96bcdb/54b8ca80N6f76e942.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">1080P全高清 卓越享受 全高清1920&times;1080液晶屏分辨率，带来高清晰度影像，使电视画面细节真实还原，一览无余。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t490/27/1225907384/346175/b44b5f3c/54b8cae5N07aa1f4a.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">优化画质 身临其境 飞利浦先进的4大画质处理技术带来更高水准的色彩、对比度和清晰度，呈现非凡画质和性能，让每一个画面，都宛如真境。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t667/252/1252661917/200288/ef49336/54c5e793N52907d67.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">八核引擎 迅捷精彩 采用先进八核处理器&mdash;&mdash;高效利用四核CPU运算，后台运行速度更快；四核(GPU*2+VPU*2)显著提升图形渲染能力，使得画面更加清晰、色彩还原更加逼真。通过八核处理，畅快淋漓的完美视效瞬间跃然眼前。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t505/193/1193643592/308595/ac86452c/54b8cb83Nc55f4f45.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">360&deg;环绕 震撼心灵 飞利浦不断开创领先业界的音频技术，运用超宽环绕立体声、晶晰声效，创造层次丰富的立体声和环绕音效，令您欣赏到无与伦比的强劲音效，感受身临其境般的虚拟环绕立体声。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t451/242/1159278808/328482/868e49f6/54b8cbc0N3c4ee13d.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">采用市场主流智能开放式平台 拥有更好的兼容性和稳定性 飞利浦应用商城 飞利浦专为电视定制的海量应用系统，给您丰富精彩地应用体验。无论您是游戏控、炒股王、音乐狂还是社交达人，都能找到至爱。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t766/299/497988507/311551/a472e734/54b8cc21Nfb2ff3d5.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">ICNTV在线视频 ICNTV内容平台拥有海量正版视频资讯，每日更新片库，为您提供最全最酷的影视资讯和新闻内容。 </div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-30\" name=\"detail-tag-id-30\" text=\"产品细节\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品细节</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Product Details</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t718/336/494160931/264472/ce04037f/54b8cc85Nd331e2b3.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-32\" name=\"detail-tag-id-32\" text=\"产品展示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>产品展示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Products Exhibition</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t481/292/1193614540/271226/56d6e7d7/54b8ccd3Ne084bd09.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t727/65/506474345/219231/75876df6/54b8cce6Nfdc1522b.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-35\" name=\"detail-tag-id-35\" text=\"尺寸信息\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>尺寸信息</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Size Information</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t559/147/1186170897/48860/ebf5d106/54b8cd08Nd6ee1601.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-37\" name=\"detail-tag-id-37\" text=\"售后服务\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>售后服务</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">After-Sales Service</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t634/244/759226018/152469/4322fedb/5486c674N8b19a100.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t577/48/887522791/136622/97640ed/54b7737fNfb2b2896.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-40\" name=\"detail-tag-id-40\" text=\"品牌荣誉\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>品牌荣誉</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Brand Awards</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t634/328/1127691108/379085/56854286/54b72d39N4f284116.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-42\" name=\"detail-tag-id-42\" text=\"温馨提示\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>温馨提示</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">Kindly Remind</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t742/324/521601438/772674/af01fb0b/54b8ce2cN65b50736.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:45', '2015-03-08 21:27:45');
