/div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_text\">专业解码采用DOLBY专业级音效解码，配备悬浮式立体音箱，声音还原真实，让您如同身临其境，酷开TV不需要配置外置音响，即可享受真实的影院效果。</div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t670/274/1205514512/38733/5341939f/54bdc094N0b216bfd.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"formwork_bt\" id=\"detail-tag-id-23\" name=\"detail-tag-id-23\" text=\"售后服务\">\n   <div class=\"formwork_bt_dz\">\n    <span>售后服务</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">After-Sales Service</span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t583/101/1012032887/170242/45a3ce6e/54a35be5N5b83d28a.jpg\" /></div>\n</div><div class=\"formwork\">\n<div class=\"formwork_img\"><img src=\"http://img20.360buyimg.com/vc/jfs/t508/122/810507937/306059/4dd4209d/548ab914N13c2038d.jpg\" /></div>\n</div></div>', '2015-03-08 21:27:39', '2015-03-08 21:27:39');
