\"font-size:14px; color:#666666; background-color:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid #d9d9d9; border-right:1px solid #d9d9d9;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;发货时间：<font style=\"color:#000000;\">当天订单次日发出。</font></td> \n   <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:14px; color:#666666; background-color:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid #d9d9d9; border-right:1px solid #d9d9d9;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;库房：<font style=\"color:#000000;\">北京市新华书店</font></td> \n   <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:14px; color:#666666; background-color:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid #d9d9d9;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;商品类别：<font style=\"color:#000000;\">图书</font></td> \n  </tr> \n </tbody> \n</table> \n<br /> \n<table width=\"749\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #cccccc;\"> \n <tbody> \n  <tr> \n   <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:14px; color: #990000; font-weight:bold; background-color:#fbfbfb; border-bottom:1px dashed #d9d9d9;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 温馨提示： </td> \n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:20px; color:#666666; background-color:#ffffff; padding:10px;\"> 商品正常发货后买家拒收或买家其他原因而导致退货的订单，需要买家承担该订单的发货费用和退货费用。 </td> \n  </tr> \n </tbody> \n</table> \n<table width=\"749\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #cccccc;\"> \n <tbody> \n  <tr> \n  </tr> \n </tbody> \n</table> \n<br /> \n<table width=\"749\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #cccccc;\"> \n <tbody> \n  <tr> \n   <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:14px; color: #990000; font-weight:bold; background-color:#fbfbfb; border-bottom:1px dashed #d9d9d9;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 内容简介</td> \n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:20px; color:#666666; background-color:#ffffff; padding:10px;\"> \n    <div>\n      翻开这本书，就可以和瓦特老师一起走进能源的世界，听老师为你亲口讲述能量、能源的故事。本书作者为韩国的大学物理系教授；由韩国著名插画师和美术家协会会员绘图，配图丰富，极富想象力和感染力；配套动手实验与孩子互动，激发科学思维，是一本科学性、趣味性和通俗性兼备 \n    </div></td> \n  </tr> \n </tbody> \n</table> \n<br /> \n<table width=\"749\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #cccccc;\"> \n <tbody> \n  <tr> \n   <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:14px; color: #990000; font-weight:bold; background-color:#fbfbfb; border-bottom:1px dashed #d9d9d9;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 作者简介</td> \n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:20px; color:#666666; background-color:#ffffff; padding:10px;\"> </td> \n  </tr> \n </tbody> \n</table> \n<br /> \n<table width=\"749\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #cccccc;\"> \n <tbody> \n  <tr> \n   <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:14px; color: #990000; font-weight:bold; background-color:#fbfbfb; border-bottom:1px dashed #d9d9d9;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 目录</td> \n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:20px; color:#666666; background-color:#ffffff; padding:10px;\"> <p>詹姆斯&middot;瓦特<br />利用垃圾制造能量<br />笑能产生能量<br />能量在持续变化<br />小时候的瓦特<br />哪边的能量更大</p> </td> \n  </tr> \n </tbody> \n</table> \n<br /> \n<table width=\"749\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #cccccc;\"> \n <tbody> \n  <tr> \n   <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:14px; color: #990000; font-weight:bold; background-color:#fbfbfb; border-bottom:1px dashed #d9d9d9;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 文摘 </td> \n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:20px; color:#666666; background-color:#ffffff; padding:10px;\"> </td> \n  </tr> \n </tbody> \n</table> \n<br /> \n<table width=\"749\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"font-size:12px; border:1px solid #cccccc;\"> \n <tbody> \n  <tr> \n  </tr> \n </tbody> \n</table>', '2015-03-08 21:33:27', '2015-03-08 21:33:27');
