INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1050268249', '<p><a href=\"http://lanree.jd.com/\"><img src=\"http://img10.360buyimg.com/cms/g14/M00/14/0F/rBEhV1MUUccIAAAAAAEFiHCVOpQAAJfgQILQXAAAQWg830.jpg\" width=\"990\" height=\"138\" /></a></p> \n<h6 style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:medium;color:#E4393C;background-color:#FFEEFF;font-family:微软雅黑;\">图书基本信息</h6> \n<p style=\"line-height:24px;font-size:14px;padding:5px 15px;font-family:微软雅黑;\"><b style=\"line-height:28px;font-size:16px;\">Critical Marketing: Issues in Contemporary Marketing</b><br /><b>作者</b>： Tadajewski, Mark; Brownlie, Douglas;<br /><b>ISBN13</b>： 9780470511985<br /><b>类型</b>： 平装<br /><b>出版日期</b>： 2008-05-01<br /><b>出版社</b>： John Wiley & Sons<br /><b>页数</b>： 401<br /><b>重量（克）</b>： 771<br /><b>尺寸</b>： 242 x 169 x 26 mm<br /></p> \n<h6 style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:medium;color:#E4393C;background-color:#FFEEFF;font-family:微软雅黑;\">英文简介</h6> \n<p>Focusing on a new and developing field, this text provides an overview of the development of marketing thought and the emergence of critical marketing. It covers a range of topics important to a critical marketing or contemporary issues in marketing course, including a number of topics (e.g. postcolonialism and marketing) previously not examined in detail in marketing.</p> \n<h6 style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:medium;color:#E4393C;background-color:#FFEEFF;font-family:微软雅黑;\">帮助信息</h6> \n<p style=\"line-height:24px;font-size:14px;padding:5px 15px;font-family:微软雅黑;\"><a style=\"color:#005aa0;\" href=\"http://lanree.jd.com/view_page-7255797.html\">购前须知及发货时间</a><br /><a style=\"color:#005aa0;\" href=\"http://lanree.jd.com/view_page-7255806.html\">退货和退款</a><br /><a style=\"color:#005aa0;\" href=\"http://lanree.jd.com/view_page-7255835.html\">发票政策</a><br /><a style=\"color:#005aa0;\" href=\"http://lanree.jd.com/view_page-7255897.html\">常见问题解答</a><br /></p> \n<br /> \n<br /> \n<br /> \n<br /> \n<br /> \n<br />', '2015-03-08 21:29:12', '2015-03-08 21:29:12');
