3901587/582392/2d4358f3/5389467eN5b56d3e9.jpg\" align=\"absmiddle\" style=\"border: 0px; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: tahoma, arial, 宋体, sans-serif; font-size: 14.399999618530273px; line-height: 16.799999237060547px; white-space: normal; \" alt=\"\" /> \n<img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/popWaterMark/jfs/t178/278/384243405/832269/102a56a6/5389467fN9a05ab74.jpg\" align=\"absmiddle\" style=\"border: 0px; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: tahoma, arial, 宋体, sans-serif; font-size: 14.399999618530273px; line-height: 16.799999237060547px; white-space: normal; \" alt=\"\" />', '2015-03-08 21:29:19', '2015-03-08 21:29:19');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1086096930', '<p><b><font color=\"blue\">基本信息</font></b></p> \n<p>书名:我爱我的身体：身体的暗号</p> \n<p>原价：15.00元</p> \n<p>作者：李舟妮译</p> \n<p>出版社：湖北少儿出版社</p> \n<p>出版日期：2014-02-01</p> \n<p>ISBN：9787535397263</p> \n<p>字数：2000</p> \n<p>页码：32</p> \n<p>版次：1</p> \n<p>装帧：平装</p> \n<p>开本：16开</p> \n<p>商品重量：0.4kg</p> \n<p><b><font color=\"blue\">编辑推荐</font></b></p> \n<hr size=\"1\" /> \n<p>1. 轻松了解身体，学会更爱自己。<br />2. 可爱的儿童形象，让孩子有如透过镜子看自己，通过模仿养成好习惯。<br />3. 让孩子自己讲述，用儿童化的表现方式，让严肃的科学变得可爱、可亲。 <br />4. 为儿童量身定做，针对性强，简明易懂。<br /><br /></p> \n<p><b><font color=\"blue\">内容提要</font></b></p> \n<hr size=\"1\" /> \n<p>小朋友，你了解自己的身体吗？我们可爱的身体，可比你想象的要强大得多哦。我们要注意很多事情，才能使身体保持健康。只有健康的身体，才能发挥强大的机能，正常地感觉、消化、运动和生长。<br />怎样才能快乐地玩耍，而不会受伤呢？我们的小手都有哪些令人惊讶的功能？为什么我们的身体会发出各种各样的声音？我们吃下去的食物，最后都到哪儿去了呢？为什么我们的心脏一刻不停地跳动？你是怎样出生的，又是怎样长大的呢？这些问题都能在这套书中得到解答。我们能够用不同的感官去感知着这个美丽的世界，都是我们身体的功劳。<br />这套绘本是韩国首尔大学金吉元教授精心策划的，他用心邀请了有实力的作者和绘者来共同创作。书中通过可爱的儿童形象，来讲述人体和生命的知识，引导小朋友正确认识自己的身体，进而爱护自己的身体，养成健康的习惯。每一本中都有一个简单的小故事和一个可爱的主角，让我们跟随他们，一起走进童真的科学世界。在孩子的眼里，身体是这样的神奇。<br /><br /></p> \n<p><b><font color=\"blue\">目录</font></b></p> \n<hr size=\"1\" /> \n<p></p> \n<p><b><font color=\"blue\">作者介绍</font></b></p> \n<hr size=\"1\" /> \n<p></p> \n<p><b><font color=\"blue\">文摘</font></b></p> \n<hr size=\"1\" /> \n<p></p> \n<div class=\"pic\">  \n</div> \n<br /> \n<div class=\"pic\">  \n</div> \n<br /> \n<div class=\"pic\">  \n</div> \n<br /> \n<div class=\"pic\">  \n</div> \n<p></p> \n<p><b><font color=\"blue\">序言</font></b></p> \n<hr size=\"1\" /> \n<p></p>', '2015-03-08 21:29:12', '2015-03-08 21:29:12');
INSERT INTO `tb_item_desc` VALUES ('1086133362', '<div style=\"text-align: center;\"> \n <img class=\"desc_anchor\" id=\"desc-module-1\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/popWaterMark/jfs/t208/199/373159474/43/9acceab1/53896348Nf7697e24.gif\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<table style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"> \n <tbody> \n  <tr> \n   <td> <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/popWaterMark/jfs/t205/288/389728601/94202/f537ae72/53896349N7944d0c8.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"457\" width=\"750\" /> </td> \n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td align=\"left\" background=\"http://img03.taobaocdn.com/imgextra/i3/708979849/T2M_lRXsXXXXXXXXXX-708979849.jpg\" height=\"650\" valign=\"top\" width=\"790\"> \n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"790\"> \n     <tbody> \n      <tr> \n       <td> \n        <div style=\"padding-top: 222.0px;padding-left: 30.0px;\"> \n         <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"390\"> \n          <tbody> \n           <tr> \n            <td align=\"left\" height=\"40\" valign=\"top\"> \n             <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"> \n              <tbody> \n               <tr> \n                <td align=\"left\" width=\"355\"> <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#3d3d3d;font-size: 14px; \">产品容量</span> </td> \n                <td align=\"left\" width=\"257\"> <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#3d3d3d;font-size: 14.0px;\">质地</span> </td> \n               </tr> \n               <tr> \n                <td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"> \n                 <div style=\"padding-bottom: 2.0px;padding-top: 0.0px;\"> \n                  <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#5d5a5a;font-size: 12.0px;\">-90ML</span> \n                 </div> </td> \n                <td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"> \n                 <div style=\"padding-bottom: 2.0px;padding-top: 0.0px;\"> \n                  <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#5d5a5a;font-size: 12.0px;\">-膏状</span> \n                 </div> </td> \n               </tr> \n               <tr> \n                <td width=\"355\"> <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#3d3d3d;font-size: 14.0px;\">保质期</span> </td> \n                <td> <br /></td> \n               </tr> \n               <tr> \n                <td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\"> \n                 <div style=\"padding-bottom: 2.0px;padding-top: 0.0px;\"> \n                  <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#5d5a5a;font-size: 12.0px;\">- 2016年，未开封3年，开封后一年内用完。</span> \n                 </div> </td> \n               </tr> \n               <tr> \n                <td> <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#3d3d3d;font-size: 14.0px;\">适合肤质</span> </td> \n                <td> <br /></td> \n               </tr> \n               <tr> \n                <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"> \n                 <div style=\"padding-bottom: 2.0px;padding-top: 0.0px;\"> \n                  <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#5d5a5a;font-size: 12.0px;\">- 为亚洲女性精心订造，任何年龄段，任何肤质适用。</span> \n                 </div> </td> \n               </tr> \n               <tr> \n                <td> <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#3d3d3d;font-size: 14.0px;\">使用方式</span> </td> \n                <td> <br /></td> \n               </tr> \n               <tr> \n                <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"> \n                 <div style=\"padding-bottom: 2.0px;padding-top: 0.0px;\"> \n                  <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#5d5a5a;font-size: 12.0px;\">- 将手及全脸弄湿，先于掌心中取适量，加水轻柔起泡，于脸上打圈洁净后以水冲洗即可。</span> \n                 </div> </td> \n               </tr> \n               <tr> \n                <td colspan=\"2\"> \n                 <div style=\"padding-bottom: 0.0px;padding-top: 4.0px;\"> \n                  <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#500071;font-size: 14.0px;\">推荐理由</span> \n                 </div> </td> \n               </tr> \n               <tr> \n                <td colspan=\"2\"> \n                 <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"> \n                  <tbody> \n                   <tr> \n                    <td align=\"left\" valign=\"bottom\" width=\"20\"> \n                     <div style=\"padding-bottom: 2.0px;padding-top: 5.0px;\"> \n                      <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/popWaterMark/jfs/t175/215/378771543/431/5f98ca0/53896349N2262f2c3.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n                     </div> </td> \n                    <td align=\"left\"> <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#5d5a5a;font-size: 14.0px;\">干性肌肤、皮肤干燥、脱皮形成的原因：</span> </td> \n                   </tr> \n                   <tr> \n                    <td> &nbsp; </td> \n                    <td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"> \n                     <div style=\"padding-bottom: 5.0px;padding-top: 0.0px;line-height: 18.0px;\"> \n                      <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#5d5a5a;font-size: 12.0px;\">- 内因方面：与先天性皮质活动力弱等有关。<br /> - 外因方面：与烈日、寒风吹袭、皮肤不洁等有关。</span> \n                     </div> </td> \n                   </tr> \n                  </tbody> \n                 </table> </td> \n               </tr> \n               <tr> \n                <td colspan=\"2\"> \n                 <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"> \n                  <tbody> \n                   <tr> \n                    <td align=\"left\" valign=\"bottom\" width=\"20\"> \n                     <div style=\"padding-bottom: 2.0px;padding-top: 5.0px;\"> \n                      <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/popWaterMark/jfs/t163/340/338882115/449/c0455a7f/53896349N40d51c28.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n                     </div> </td> \n                    <td align=\"left\"> <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#5d5a5a;font-size: 14.0px;\">平衡细致冰川水的功效：</span> </td> \n                   </tr> \n                   <tr> \n                    <td> &nbsp; </td> \n                    <td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"> \n                     <div style=\"padding-bottom: 5.0px;padding-top: 0.0px;line-height: 18.0px;\"> \n                      <span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#5d5a5a;font-size: 12.0px;\">-边洗边护肤，拒绝洗脸伤害，<span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;color:#500071;font-size: 12.0px;\">不含对皮肤有害成分（无PEG表面活性剂、无尼泊金酯类防腐剂、无矿物油、无色素、无酒精、无合成香精）</span>不给肌肤任何负担。</span> \n                     </div> </td> \n                   </tr> \n                  </tbody> \n                 </table> </td> \n               </tr> \n               <tr> \n                <td colspan=\"2\"> &nbsp; </td> \n               </tr> \n              </tbody> \n             </table> </td> \n           </tr> \n          </tbody> \n         </table> \n        </div> </td> \n       <td align=\"right\" valign=\"top\"> \n        <div style=\"padding-top: 3.0px;padding-right: 7.0px;\"> \n         <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/popWaterMark/jfs/t199/282/348645547/13806/e6366b91/53896349N5e089ee6.png\" alt=\"\" /> \n        </div> </td> \n      </tr> \n     </tbody> \n    </table> </td> \n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td> <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/popWaterMark/jfs/t187/286/394654878/27019/ebd656e4/53896349N9c357556.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"78\" width=\"790\" /> </td> \n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td> <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/popWaterMark/jfs/t157/227/343247948/133447/4ee12e07/53896349N401b8be9.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> </td> \n  </tr> \n </tbody> \n</table> \n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div> \n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"> \n <img class=\"desc_anchor\" id=\"desc-module-2\" src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/popWaterMark/jfs/t208/199/373159474/43/9acceab1/53896348Nf7697e24.gif\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/popWaterMark/jfs/t148/81/363906592/22505/44d2cb6/53896349N8724ab9e.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> \n</div> \n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"> \n <img src=\"http://img30.360buyimg.com/popWaterMark/jfs/t151/157/368879750/195763/9dd5fd06/5389634aNb2